<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- YAO BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ngani Jambone mpela yatite pakulemba Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ngani Jambone mpela yatite pakulemba</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matayo</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngani Jambone mpela yatite pakulemba che Matayo chili chimo mwa itabu ncheche mu Lilangano lya Sambano chachikusala nkati umi u Che Yesu Kilisito Chachilichose chikuŵilanjikwa “Injili,” malumbo gakwe, “Ngani Jambone.” Yele itabu yalembekwe pakumala chiwa chi Che Yesu, yele itabu yalembekwe ni che Matayo ni che Maliko ni che Luka ni che Yohana. Ŵaumanyilisi ngaakumanyilila uchenene katema pijalembekwe Ngani Jambone mpela yatite pakulemba Matayo, nambo ikuganichikwa kuti jalembekwe mu yaka sitini pakumala kupagwa kwa Che Yesu Kilisito Nombe ngakukumanyika kwapi kuŵalembele, nambo ikuganichikwa kuti jalembelechekwe ku Palesitina panepa mmusi wa ku Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Matayo ni juŵalembile, mundu juŵaliji jwakukumbikanya nsongo akanaŵe kuŵilanjikwa ni Che Yesu kuŵa jwakulijiganya jwakwe. Ŵamanyiche sooni kwa liina lya che Lawi. Che Matayo ŵaliji jumo jwa achinduna likumi ni ŵaŵili, nombe ŵaalembele ŵa umanyilisi ŵa Chiyahudi. Gelego nkukombola kugaona pangasisika pakuŵa kwana Malembo sitini kutyochela mu Lilangano lya Kalakala. Nningwa wao waliji kulosya kuti Che Yesu ŵaliji Kilisito, Jwakuwombola jwasagulikwe ni Akunnungu, mundu jwati ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu ŵasalaga ngani syakwe. Sooni che Matayo ŵalembile indu yejinji nkati umwenye wa Akunnungu. Ŵayahudi ŵalolele kuti Jwakuwombola chaŵe chilongola jwa umwenye wa pachilambo pano. Che Matayo kwa kulilolechesya nnope akuchikanila chikulupi chao kwa kukunguluchila kuti umwenye wa Akunnungu uli wa chimbumu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngani Jambone mpela yatite pakulemba che Matayo chili chitabu chambone kuŵa chaandanda mu Lilangano lya Sambano kwa ligongo lya malembelo gagalembekwe kutyochela mu Lilangano lya Kalakala. Chili chilumbikanyo chambone cha malangano gaŵili. Ŵaumanyilisi akuganisya kuti pane che Matayo ŵalingaga kusyasya mpela che Musa yatite kulemba mu itabu yakwe nsano yaandanda mu Lilangano lya Kalakala. Majiganyo ga Che Yesu paŵaliji pa chikwesya (Matayo 5-7). Ikukomboleka kulandanywa ni chipanganyo chiŵachitesile Akunnungu chakwapa che Musa Lilajisyo. (Chikumbuchilo cha lilajisyo 19:3-23:33)</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaili mwelemo</para>
  <para style="io">Che Matayo akujitanda Ngani Jambone nkati kupagwa ku Che Yesu Kilisito ni ndande ja masengo gakwe mu liunjili lya 1-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Kumala pele che Matayo akusala nkati masengo ga Che Yesu ni majiganyo gakwe gamajinji mu liunjili lya 5-25.</para>
  <para style="io">Liuto lya mbesi lya Ngani Jambone mpela yatite pakulemba che Matayo likusala nkati Che Yesu iŵatite pakumalichisya masengo gakwe, gagakuwoneka mu chiwa chakwe ni kusyuka kwakwe mu liunjili lya 26-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Lukosyo lu Che Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Achi chili chitabu cha meena ga lukosyo lu Che Yesu Kilisito, Che Yesu Kilisito jwaliji jwa uŵelesi u che Daudi, jwa uŵelesi u che Iblahimu.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Che Iblahimu ŵammeleche che Isaka ni che Isaka ŵammeleche che Yakobo ni che Yakobo ŵammeleche che Yuda ni achapwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Che Yuda ŵammeleche che Pelesi ni che Sela, achikulu ŵao ŵaliji che Tamali ni che Pelesi ŵammeleche che Esloni ni che Esloni ŵammeleche che Alamu. <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Che Alamu ŵammeleche che Aminadabu ni che Aminadabu ŵammeleche che Nashoni ni che Nashoni ŵammeleche che Salumoni ni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Che Salumoni ŵammeleche che Boasi, achikulu ŵao che Boasi ŵaliji che Lahabu. Che Boasi ni che Lusi ŵaliji achaŵelesi ŵa che Obedi ni che Obedi ŵammeleche che Yese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />nombe che Yese ŵammeleche Mwenye che Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 1:6">Che Daudi ŵammeleche che Selemani, achikulu ŵao che Selemani ŵaliji ŵankwawo che Ulia. <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Che Selemani ŵammeleche che Lehoboamu ni, che Lehoboamu ŵammeleche che Abiya ni che Abiya ŵammeleche che Asa ni, <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />che Asa ŵammeleche che Yehoshafati ni che Yehoshafati ŵammeleche che Yolamu ni che Yolamu ŵammeleche che Usia ni, <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Che Usia ŵammeleche che Yosamu ni che Yosamu ŵammeleche che Ahasi ni che Ahasi ŵammeleche che Esekiya ni, <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Che Esekiya ŵammeleche che Manase ni che Manase ŵammeleche che Amoni ni che Amoni ŵammeleche che Yosia ni, <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Che Yosia ŵammeleche che Yekonia ni achapwakwe. Keleko kaliji katema kakwasamichisya Ŵayahudi ku chilambo cha ku Babeli.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Nipele, Ŵayahudi paŵaiche ku chilambo cha Babeli, che Yekonia ŵammeleche che Sealitieli ni che Sealitieli ŵammeleche che Selubabeli ni, <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Che Selubabeli ŵammeleche che Abiudi ni che Abiudi ŵammeleche che Eliakimu ni che Eliakimu ŵammeleche che Asoli. <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Che Asoli ŵammeleche che Sadoki ni che Sadoki ŵammeleche che Akimu ni che Akimu ŵammeleche che Eliudi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Che Eliudi ŵammeleche che Eliasali ni che Eliasali ŵammeleche che Matani ni che Matani ŵammeleche che Yakobo, <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Che Yakobo ŵammeleche che Yusufu, ŵankwawo che Maliamu achikulugwe Che Yesu ŵakuŵilanjikwa Kilisito Jwakuwombola.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Pelepo paliji ni iŵelesi kumi na nne kutyochela che Iblahimu kwaichilila che Daudi, iŵelesi kumi na nne kutyochela che Daudi mpaka Ŵayahudi paŵajigalikwe ku usami ku Babeli ni iŵelesi kumi na nne kutyochela kwigalikwa ku usami kuichila katema ka Kilisito.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupagwa ku Che Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Yelei ni iŵatite pakupagwa Che Yesu Kilisito, che Maliamu, achikulugwe, ŵaliji atomelwe ni che Yusufu. Nambo akanaŵe kuwonegana mpela mundu ni ŵankwakwe, che Maliamu ŵalisimene ali ŵapachiilu kwa ukombole wa Mbumu jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Nombe che Yusufu ŵankwakwe pakuŵa ŵaliji mundu jwambone paujo pa Akunnungu nganasaka kwachembulusya che Maliamu pa ŵandu, ŵasachile kwaleka pangaimanyilila ŵandu. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Nombewo paŵaliji aninkuganisya yeleyo, katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje ŵankopochele mu sagamisi, ŵansalile, “Che Yusufu mwana ju che Daudi nkajogopa kwajigala che Maliamu kuŵa ŵankwenu, ligongo ali ŵapachiilu kwa ukombole wa Mbumu jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Chaligopole mwanache jwannume nomwe chimwape liina lyakwe Che Yesu, pakuŵa jwelejo ni juchiŵakulupusye ŵandu ŵakwe mu sambi syao.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Nipele yoseyo yakopochele kuti liŵe isyene, liloŵe lya Ambuje liŵaŵechete kwa litala lya jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu achitiji, <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Mwalimwalipe chaŵe jwapachiilu, chaligopole mwanache jwannume, nombewo chachaŵilanga Emanueli” malumbo gakwe, “Akunnungu ali pamo ni uwe.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Nombe che Yusufu paŵajimwiche, ŵatesile ilaila iŵatite pakusala katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje, ŵanjigele che Maliamu ŵankwawo ni kwaulanawo kumangwao. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Nambo nganawonegana nawo mpaka che Maliamu paŵaligopwele mwanache jwannume. Nombe che Yusufu ŵampele liina lyakwe Che Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Achalendo kutyochela kungopochelo lyuŵa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Che Yesu ŵapagwile mmusi wa ku Beselehemu, muchilambo cha ku Yudea, kele katemako che Helode ali mwenye. Napagwa pe, ŵandu ŵaŵaimanyichisye nnope ndondwa kutyochela kungopochelo lyuŵa ŵaiche ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />Ŵausisye ŵandu, “Ana alikwapi mwanache jwapagwile, kuŵa Mwenye jwa Ŵayahudi? Tujiweni ndondwa jakwe pajikopochele kungopochelo lyuŵa ni weleu tuiche kukwapopelela.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Mwenye che Helode paŵapilikene yeleyo ni ŵapwele ntima, ŵelewo pamo ni ŵandu wose ŵa ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Nipele, ŵaaŵilasile pamo achakulungwa wose ŵambopesi ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ga Akunnungu gaŵapele che Musa, ŵausisye kuti, “Ana Kilisito Jwakuwombola chapagwe kwapi?” <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Nombewo ŵajanjile, “Mu musi wa ku Beselehemu, muchilambo cha ku Yudea, pakuŵa yeleyo ni yaitite pakulembekwa ni jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />‘Mmwe Beselehemu chilambo cha ku Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">mmwe nganimma jwamwana kose pasikati misi ja chilambo cha ku Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">pakuŵa kutyochela kukwenu chakopochele chilongola</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">juchiŵalongosye ŵandu ŵangu, Ŵaisilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Pelepo, che Helode ŵaaŵilasile pachisyepela ŵanyawo ŵaŵaimanyichisye nnope ndondwa ni ŵausisye katema chi jele ndondwa jo pijakopochele. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Nipele ŵatumile ku Beselehemu aninkuti, “Njaulanje nkauchilichisye uchenene ngani sya jwele mwanache. Mwamalaga kummona, nkauje kukuusalila, ni une jwakwe nyaule ngaatindiŵalile.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Paŵamalisisye kumpilikanila mwenye, ŵajendelechele ni ulendo wao nipele jele ndondwa jo jiŵajiweni kungopochelo lyuŵa jalongolele mmbujo mwao mpaka pajaiche ni kwima pachanya nyuumba jiŵaliji mwanache. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Paŵajiweni jele ndondwa jo ŵasengwile nnope. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Ŵajinjile nkati ni ŵammweni mwanache jula pamo ni che Maliamu achikulugwe, ŵatindiŵalile ni kunkotamila. Pelepo ni ŵagopwele mmalombo gao ni ŵampele ntuuka, sahabu ni ubani ni mauta gagakuŵilanjikwa manemane.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Akunnungu ŵakanyisye mu sagamisi kuti akaujila sooni ku che Helode, nipele ŵausile kumangwao kwa litala line.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuutuchila ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Paŵamasile kutyoka achalendo ŵala, katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje ŵankopochele che Yusufu mu sagamisi ni kwasalila, “Njimuche! Munjigale mwanache jo pamo ni achikulugwe ni mmutuchile ku Misili. Ntamanje kweleko mpaka pachinantanjile, pakuŵa che Helode akusaka kummulaga mwanache ju.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Nipele che Yusufu ŵajimwiche ni kunjigala mwanache pamo ni achikulugwe, ŵatyosile chilo, ŵajawile ku Misili. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Ŵatemi kweleko mpaka che Helode paŵajasiche. Yeleyo yatendekwe kuti liloŵe liŵaŵechete Ambuje kwa litala lya jwakulondola jwakwe liŵe isyene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:15">“Nammilasile mwanangu kutyochela ku Misili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuulagwa kwa ŵanache achanandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Che Helode paŵaimanyi kuti ŵaŵaimanyichisye ndondwa kwa nnope ŵala ŵalambwisye, ŵatumbile nnope. Ŵalajisye ŵandu ŵakwe akaaulaje ŵanache achanandi wose ŵachilume ŵapagwile ku Beselehemu ni mumbali mwakwe ŵaali ni yaka iŵili ni paasi ja pelepo. Ŵatesile yeleyo malinga ni katema paŵaimanyi kutyochela kwa ŵele ŵaŵaimanyichisye nnope ndondwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Yeleyo ni igatite kuŵa isyene maloŵe gagaŵechetekwe kwa litala lya che Yelemia juŵaliji jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu achitiji,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Liloŵe lipikaniche ku Lama ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">kulila kwa kupeteka ni kulila kwa malumbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Che Laheli akwalilila ŵanache ŵao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">ni ngaakusaka kwamyalasya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">pakuŵa ŵanache wose ajasiche.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutyoka ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Paŵawile che Helode, katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje ŵankopochele che Yusufu mu sagamisi ku Misili kula, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />ŵansalile, “Njimuche! Munjigale mwanache jo pamo ni achikulugwe, mmuje sooni ku chilambo cha Isilaeli, pakuŵa ŵandu ŵaŵasakaga kummulaga mwanache jo ŵamale kwasika.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Nipele che Yusufu ŵajimwiche ni ŵanjigele mwanache pamo ni achikulugwe, ŵausile ku chilambo cha Isilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Nambo che Yusufu paŵapilikene kuti che Alikelao mwanache ju che Helode, akamulile umwenye wa atatigwe, ŵajogwepe kwaula ku Yudea. Nombe, paŵamasile kukanyikwa mu sagamisi, ŵajawile mbande sya ku Galilaya, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />ŵajawile kutama mu musi waukuŵilanjikwa ku Nasaleti. Yele ni iyatite pakuŵa isyene maloŵe gagaŵechetekwe kwa litala lya ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu gagakuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:23">“Chaŵilanjikwe jwa ku Nasaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Che Yohana Ŵakubatisya akwalalichila ŵandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Agala moŵa gala ŵakopochele che Yohana Ŵakubatisya, ŵatandite kwalalichila ŵandu mu lipululu lya ku Yudea. <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />Ŵatite, “Nneche sambi, pakuŵa Umwenye wa kwinani uŵandichile.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Aŵa ni ŵeŵala che Yohana ŵala, juŵagambagwa ni che Isaya jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu paŵatite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Liloŵe lya mundu likuŵilanga mwipululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Mwakolochesye Ambuje litala lyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">ngolosyanje litala lyakwe.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Che Yohana ŵawete chiwalo chichakolochekwe ni manyunya ga chinyama chachikuŵilanjikwa ngamia ni nkaanda wa lipende nchiunu mwao, chakulya chao chaliji itete ni uchi wa mwikonde. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Ŵandu ŵa ku Yelusalemu ni kutyochela kosekose ku chilambo cha Yudea ni ilambo yose yaili mungulugulu lusulo lwa Yolodani, ŵajaulile, <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />ŵajitichisye sambi syao ni kuleka, nombewo ŵabatisye mu lusulo lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Nambo che Yohana paŵaweni Mafalisayo achajinji ni Masadukayo aninkwaichilila kuti ŵabatisye ni ŵaasalile, “Ŵanyamwe uŵelesi wa lijoka! Ŵaani ŵanjamwiche muuŵambale uchimwa wa Akunnungu waukwika? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Nnosye kwa isambo kuti nnesile sambi. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Nkaganisya ni kuliŵechetela muntima kuti, ‘Tukwete ambuje ŵetu che Iblahimu!’ Ngunsalila isyene kuti, Akunnungu akupakombola kugapanganya maganga ga gaŵe uŵelesi u che Iblahimu. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Sambano jino liŵago lili chile kata michiga ja itela, nipele, chitela chachili chose changasogola isogosi yambone chichigwisikwe ni kujasikwa pa mooto. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Une ngumbatisyanga ni meesi kulosya kuti nnesile sambi. Nambo ŵakwika kunyuma kwangu akwete machili nnope kumbunda une, ni une nganguŵajilwa namose kwawula ilatu yao. Ŵelewo chambatisyanje ni Mbumu jwa Akunnungu ni kwa mooto. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Ŵelewo akwete lupeta mmakono mwao ali chile kupeta ngano. Chakumbikanye ngano jambone ni kutaga mu ngokwe ni ikambi kuitinisya pa mooto wangasimika.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akubatiswa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maliko 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Kele katema ko Che Yesu ŵatyosile ku Galilaya ni kwika mu lusulo lwa Yolodani ku che Yohana, kuti nombewo abatiswe. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Nambo che Yohana ŵalinjile kwasiŵila aninkuti, “Une ni jungusachilwa kubatiswa ni mmwe sambano iŵele uli mmwe kwika kukwangu nambatisye?” <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Nambo Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Nneche kaje itendekwe yeleyo kwa sambano, pakuŵa ikusachilwa itendekwe yeila yose yaili yambone paujo pa Akunnungu.” Pelepo che Yohana ŵajitichisye.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Che Yesu paŵamasile kubatiswa ŵatyosile mmeesi ni papopo kwinani kwaugwiche, ŵammweni Mbumu jwa Akunnungu achitulukaga mpela nguunda ni kwatula pachanya pakwe. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Nipele Liloŵe kutyochela kwinani lyaŵechete, “Jweleju ni Mwanangu jungunnonyela nonyelwe nawo.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akulinjikwa ni Shetani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maliko 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Nipele Mbumu jwa Akunnungu jwanlongwesye Che Yesu mwikonde kuti alinjikwe ni Shetani. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Paŵatemi pangalya moŵa alobaini muusi ni chilo, mbesi jakwe jakwete sala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Nipele Shetani ŵannyichilile, ni ŵansalile, “Iŵaga mmwe ndi Mwana jwa Akunnungu ngasalile aga maganga gagalauche gaŵe mikate.” <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ilembekwe mu Malembelo ga Akunnungu kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:4">‘Mundu ngakulama ni nkate pe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:4">nambo kwa liloŵe lyalili lyose lyakuŵecheta Akunnungu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Nipele, Shetani ŵanjigele Che Yesu mpaka ku Yelusalemu pa musi wa Akunnungu, ŵammisile penani pa lusonga lwa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />ŵaasalile, “Iŵaga mmwe ndi Mwana jwa Akunnungu, nliponye paasi pakuŵa ilembekwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Akunnungu chachatuma achikatumetume ŵao ŵa kwinani kwa ligongo lyenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">channyakule mmakono mwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">ntakuligomba lukongolo lwenu pa liganga.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ilembekwe sooni mu Malembelo ga Akunnungu, ‘Nkaalinga Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Nipele Shetani ŵanjigele Che Yesu sooni ku chitumbi cheleu ni kwalosya mwenye syose sya chilambo ni ukulu wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Ŵansalile, “Ni yose yi chinampe ni kuŵa yenu iŵaga chimundindiŵalile ni kumbopelela.” <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Pelepo, Che Yesu ŵanjanjile, “Shetani ngambe kwaula! Ilembekwe mu Malembelo ga Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:10">‘Chimwatindiŵalile Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu ni kwapopelela ŵawowo pewo.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Nipele Shetani, ŵannesile Che Yesu, ni ŵaiche achikatumetume ŵa kwinani ni kwatumichila.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akugatanda masengo gao ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maliko 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Che Yesu paŵapilikene kuti che Yohana ataŵikwe mu nyuumba jakutaŵilwa ŵandu, ŵajawile ku Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Ŵatyosile ku Nasaleti ni kwaula kutama ku Kapelenaumu musi wauli mbwani ja litanda lya Galilaya, mu chilambo cha Sabuloni ni Nafutali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Yeleyo ni ilyatite pakuŵa isyene liloŵe lilyaŵechetekwe kwa litala lya che Isaya jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Chilambo cha ku Sabuloni ni chilambo cha ku Nafutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">litala lyalikwaula ku bahali, peesi lusulo lwa Yolodani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">ku Galilaya, chilambo cha ŵandu ŵangaŵa Ŵayahudi!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Ŵandu ŵakutama mu chipi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">chaliwone lilanguka lyalikulungwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Nombe ŵandu ŵakutamanga pa chilambo cha chipi ni pa mmwilili wa chiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">lilanguka chilyalanguchisye!” <verse eid="MAT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kutandilila kele katema Che Yesu ŵatandite kulalichila achitiji, “Nneche sambi, pakuŵa Umwenye wa kwinani uŵandichile!”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwaŵilanga ŵandu ncheche ŵakukoka somba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maliko 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Che Yesu paŵajimajimaga mungulugulu litanda lya Galilaya, ŵaweni ŵanakajumo ŵaŵili ŵakukoka, che Simoni jwakuŵilanjikwa che Petulo ni che Andulea mpwakwe. Ŵaliji mu litanda aninkukoka somba kwa lwau pakuŵa ŵaliji ŵakukoka somba. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Munguye, none chinantende ŵanyamwe mme ŵakwaikanawo ŵandu kwa Ambuje.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Papopo ŵalesile nyau syao ni kwakuya.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Paŵajawile mmbujo kanandi ŵaweni ŵanakajumo ŵane ŵaŵili che Yakobo ni che Yohana ŵanache ŵa che Sebedayo. Ŵanyawo ŵaliji mu ngalaŵa pampepe ni che Sebedayo atati ŵao aninkusaula nyau syao. Nipele Che Yesu ŵaaŵilasile. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Papopo ŵajilesile ngalaŵa jila pamo ni atati ŵao, ni kwakuya.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwalamya ŵakulwala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Che Yesu ŵajaulaga papalipose pala mu chilambo cha ku Galilaya, achijiganyaga mmajumba ga kupopelela ni kulalichila Ngani Jambone ja Umwenye wa Akunnungu. Ŵalamisye ŵandu ilwele yakupisyangana iŵaliji nayo. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Ngani syakwe syajenele mbande syose sya ku Silia. Ŵakulwala wose ŵaŵaliji ni ilwele yakupisyangana ni aŵala ŵakulaga, ŵaŵakamwilwe ni masoka ni ŵaali ni njilinjili ni ŵandu ŵakulemala ŵajawisye kweleko nombewo ŵalamisye ŵana wose. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Mipingo ja ŵandu achajinji kutyochela ku Galilaya ni ku Dekapoli yaani misi likumi ni ku Yelusalemu ni ku Yudea ni peesi lusulo lwa Yolodani ŵankuiye.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwajiganya ŵandu pa chitumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Che Yesu paŵauweni mpingo wa ŵandu ŵakwesile pa chitumbi ni kutama. Ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵajaulile, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />nombewo ŵatandite kwajiganya.<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusangalala kusyenesyene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Akwete upile ŵele ŵakwakulupilila Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">pakuŵa umwenye wa kwinani uli wao.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Akwete upile ŵele ŵakulilasika muntima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">pakuŵa chatulaswe.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Akwete upile ŵele ŵakulitimalika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">pakuŵa chapochele chilanga cha Akunnungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Akwete upile ŵele ŵajakwete sala ni njota ja kupanganya yaili yambone paujo pa Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">pakuŵa Akunnungu chachajikutisya.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Akwete upile ŵaali ni chanasa kwa ŵane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">pakuŵa chachikolelwa chanasa.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Akwete upile ŵaali ni ntima wambone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">pakuŵa chachawona Akunnungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Akwete upile ŵakwalumbanya ŵandu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">pakuŵa ŵanyawo chachiŵilanjikwa ŵanache ŵa Akunnungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Akwete upile ŵele ŵakusaukanga ligongo lya kupanganya yaili yambone paujo pa Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">pakuŵa Umwenye wa kwinani uli wao.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Nsangalale ŵanyamwe ŵandu pachachintukananga ni kunnagasya ni kummechetela yangalumbana kwa ligongo lyangu. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Nsangalale ni kuchina pakuŵa mbote jenu jili jekulungwa kwinani. Pakuŵa iyoyo peyo ni iŵapanganyichisye ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu ŵaŵapali nkanaŵe ŵanyamwe.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilanguka ni njete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maliko 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Ŵanyamwe ndi njete ja pachilambo! Nambo njete jasoyesyaga kulasa kwakwe chintaje chichi kuti unonye wakwe uujile sooni? Ngajikufai kulikose, nambo jikwasikwa paasa ni kuliŵatikwa ni ŵandu.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Ŵanyamwe ndi lilanguka lya pachilambo! Musi wautaŵikwe pachanya chitumbi ngaukukomboleka kusisika. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Ŵandu ngakupamba lumuli ni kuluunichila ni lulo, nambo akuluŵika pachanya chindu chakuŵichila lumuli pakuti lwalanguchisye ŵaali nkati mo. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Iyoyo peyo lilanguka lyenu likusachilwa lilanguchisye paujo pa ŵandu, kuti aiwone isambo yenu yambone, ni ŵakusye Atati ŵenu ŵaali kwinani.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majiganyo gankati Malajisyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Nkaganisya kuti naiche kukugatyosya Malajisyo ni majiganyo ga ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu. Nganiika kukugatyosya nambo kukugamalichisya. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Ngunsalila isyene kuti, mpaka pelepo kwinani ni chilambo pachiimale kupita, ngapagwa namose nukuta pane chindu chamwana mu malajisyo chachichityochekwe mpaka imalile yose. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Nipele, mundu jwalijose jwangajitichisya namose likanyo limo mmalamulo ga mwana ga ni kwajiganya ŵane, jwelejo chaŵe jwannandi nnope mu Umwenye wa kwinani. Nambo jwelejo juchalikamulichisye ni kwajiganya ŵane, jwelejo chaŵe jwankulungwa mu Umwenye wa kwinani. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Nipele ngunsalila kuti, iŵaga umbone wenu ngaupunda aula wa ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ga Akunnungu gaŵapele che Musa ni Mafalisayo nganjinjila ng'oo mu Umwenye wa kwinani.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majiganyo gagakukanya kuŵa ni Uchimwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luka 12:57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Mpilikene kuti ŵandu ŵa chiikala ŵasalilwe kuti, ‘Nkaulaga! Juchaulaje akusachilwa alamulikwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Nambo une ngunsalila kuti, mundu jwalijose jwakuntumbilila mpwakwe, chiimbajile kulamulikwa. Jwakwachembulusya apwao chachajausya pa nkungulu. Ni jwakummilanga mpwao ‘Jwakuloŵela,’ chaŵajilwe kwinjila ku mooto wangasimika moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Nipele mwapelekaga mbopesi jenu pa chilisa ni papopo mwakumbuchilaga kuti apwenu ŵana umenyani nomwe, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />njileche mbopesi jenu mmbujo mwa chilisa, njaule kaje nkajilane ni mpwenu jo ni mmujeje ni kujityosya mbopesi jenu.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Njilane chitema ni jwammagongo ndi mwitala nkanaŵe kwika ku nkungulu. Yapundaga pelepo jwammagongo jwenu chantaje mmakono mwa jwakulamula, nombe jwakulamula jo chantaje mmakono mwa jwangondo, nombejo champonye mu nyuumba jakutaŵilwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Ngunsalila isyene kuti, ngantyoka mwelemo mpaka pachimmalisye kulipa mbiya ja mbesi.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majiganyo gagakukanya Chikululu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Mpilikene kuti, ŵandu ŵasalilwe, ‘Nkatenda chikululu!’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Nambo une ngunsalila, kila mundu juchannolechesye jwankongwe kwa kunsaka, amasile kutenda chikululu nawo muntima mwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Nipele, iŵaga liso lyenu lya kundyo likunneŵasya nlityosye ni kulijasila kwakutalika. Mmbaya nnope kupotesya chiŵalo chenu chimo cha pachiilu, kupunda chiilu chenu chose chiponyekwe pa mooto wangasimika, moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Ni iŵaga nkono wenu wa kundyo ukunneŵasya, nkate nkaujase kwakutalika. Mmbaya kukwenu kupotesya chiŵalo chimo cha chiilu kupunda chiilu chose chiponyekwe pa mooto wangasimika moŵa gose pangali mbesi.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majiganyo gagakukanya kulekangana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matayo 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maliko 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Iŵechetekwe kuti, ‘Jwakunleka ŵankwakwe, akusachilwa ŵaape talaka.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Nambo une ngunsalila kuti, kila mundu jwakunleka ŵankwakwe, pangaŵa kwa ligongo lya chikululu, akwatenda atende chikululu, nombe jwannume alombelaga jwankongwe jwalesilwe, akutenda chikululu.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majiganyo gagakukanya kulumbila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Sooni mpilikene kuti ŵandu ŵa kalakala ŵasalilwe kuti, ‘Nkalumbila kwa unami, nambo mpanganye mpela imwalumbile kupanganya kwa Ambuje.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Nambo une ngunsalila, nkalumbila ng'o, atamuno kwa kwinani, pakuŵa chili chitengu cha umwenye cha Akunnungu, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />atamuno kulumbila kwa chilambo, pakuŵa chili chitengu chao cha kuŵichila makongolo, atamuno kulumbila kwa musi wa Yelusalemu, pakuŵa uli musi wa Mwenye jwankulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Atamuno nkalumbila kwa ntwe wenu, pakuŵa ngankukombola kupanganya luumbo lumo kuŵa lweswela atamuno lwepiliu. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Mwatiji, ‘Elo’, jiŵe ‘Elo’, ni mwatiji, ‘Ngwamba’, jiŵe ‘Ngwamba’. Chachili chose cha kupunda yeleyo chikutyoka kwa jwangalumbana jula.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majiganyo gagakukanya kuliuchisya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luka 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Mpilikene kuti isasilwe, ‘Liso kwa liso, ni Liino kwa liino.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Nambo une ngunsalila kuti, nkaliuchisya kwa jwangalumbana. Mundu jwalijose juchampute lijanda pa lijeje lya kundyo, mwagalauchisye ni lijakwe. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Mundu anjausyaga ku nkungulu kukummechetela magambo melepe ansumule lishati lyenu, munnechele ni likoti lyenu. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Mundu jwalijose ankanganichisyaga njigale nsigo wao njaule nawo kilomita jimo, njende nawo kilomita siŵili. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Jwakummenda mumpe, nombe jwakusaka kunkongola, ngasimwajima.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwanonyela ŵammagongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luka 6:27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Mpilikene kuti isasilwe, ‘Munnonyele njenu ni munchime jwammagongo jwenu.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Nambo une ngunsalila, mwanonyele ŵammagongo ŵenu ni mwapopelele aŵala ŵakunlagasya, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />kuti mme ŵanache ŵa Atati ŵenu ŵaali kwinani. Pakuŵa akwalanguchisya lyuŵa lyakwe ŵandu ŵangalumbana ni ŵambone ni kwanyelela ula ŵandu ŵambone paujo pa Akunnungu ni ŵangalumbana. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Ana chimpate mbote chi mwanonyelaga pe ŵakunnonyela ŵanyamwe? Ngwamba! Pakuŵa ŵakukumbikanya nsongo nombe akutenda iyoyo? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Iŵaga nkwakomasyaga achapwenu pe, ana ntesile chapi chakupunda kwapunda ŵane? Ana ngati ŵangakwamanyilila Akunnungu akutenda iyoyo. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Nipele mme ŵautindimisyo mu ntima kwati mpela Atati ŵenu ŵa kwinani yatite kuŵa jwautindimisyo.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Majiganyo gankati kwakamuchisya ŵakulaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Nlilolechesye, nkatenda yambone pa ŵandu kuti mmoneche. Pakuŵa mwatendaga yeleyo ngampegwa ntuuka kutyochela kwa Atati ŵenu ŵa kwinani.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Nipele pankunkamuchisya jwakulaga, nkagomba lipenga. Nkatenda mpela yakuti pakutenda ŵaulamba mmajumba ga kupopelela ni mmatala kuti ŵandu anlape. Ngunsalila isyene, ŵelewo ŵamale kupochela ntuuka wao. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Nambo mmwe pankunkamuchisya jwakulaga, ntende yeleyo mwakusisa namose ambusanga ŵenu akamanyilila, <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />nipele mwakamuchisye ŵakulaga mwakusisika ni Atati ŵenu ŵakulola yakusisika, chachimpa mbote.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majiganyo gankati kupopela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Sooni pankupopela, nkaŵa mpela ŵaulamba. Pakuŵa ŵelewo ikwanonyela kupopela achijimaga mmajumba ga kupopelela ni pamalekano melepe aoneche ni ŵandu. Ngunsalila isyene, ŵelewo ŵamale kupochela mbote jao. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Nambo mmweji pankupopela, njinjile nkati mwenu, mmugale nnango ni mwapopele Atati ŵenu ŵangakuwonekana. Nombe Atati ŵenu ŵakulola inkuipanganya kwakusisika, champe mbote.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />“Pankupopela, nkaŵecheta maloŵe ga wamba mpela ŵandu ŵangakwamanyilila Akunnungu. Pakuŵa ŵanyawo akuganisya kuti Akunnungu chachapilikanila kwa ligongo lya maloŵe gao gamajinji. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Nipele nkalandana ni ŵanyawo, pakuŵa Atati ŵenu akumanyilila chinkusaka nkanaŵe kwaŵenda. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Nipele ŵanyamwe mpopeleje yeleyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Atati ŵetu ŵandi kwinani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Liina lyenu lichimbichikwe kwannope.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Umwenye wenu uiche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">Chinkusaka cho chitendekwe pachilambo pano mpela kwinani.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Ntupe chakulya chetu cha lyuŵa ni lyuŵa.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Ntulechelesye ileŵo yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">mpela uweji itukuti kwalechelesya wose ŵakutuleŵela.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Nkatujinjisya nkulinjikwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">nambo ntukulupusye ni jwangalumbana.’ Pakuŵa umwenye uli wenu ni machili ni ukulu moŵa gose pangali mbesi.<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />“Pakuŵa mwalechelesyaga ŵandu ileŵo yao, Atati ŵenu ŵa kwinani channechelesye ni ŵanyamwe ŵakwe. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Nambo iŵaga ngamwalechelesya ŵandu, nombe Atati ŵenu ŵa kwinani ngasannechelesya ni ŵanyamwe ŵakwe.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majiganyo gankati kutaŵa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Pankutaŵa, ngasimma mpela ŵaulamba. Ŵanyawo akutaŵa sinya ku meeso kwao melepe awoneche ni ŵandu kuti akutaŵa. Nambo une ngunsalila isyene kuti ŵelewo ŵamale kupochela ntuuka wao. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Nambo mwe pankutaŵa, nsukusule ku meeso ni kupakala mauta muntwe, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />kuti ŵandu anamanyilile kuti nkutaŵa, nambo mmanyiche ni Atati ŵenu ŵangakuwoneka. Nombe Atati ŵenu pe ŵakulola yakusisika, chachimpa mbote jenu.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbiko kwinani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luka 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Nkaligosela mbiko pa chilambo pano pajikonasika ni idudu ni imbulukutu, ni ŵawiyi akwinjila ni kwiŵa. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Nambo nligosele mbiko kwinani kwangajonasika chindu ni idudu namose imbulukutu, atamuno ŵawiyi ngakukombola kwinjila ni kwiŵa. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Pakuŵa pajili mbiko jenu pele ntima wenu ni pachiuŵe.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liso lili lilanguka lya chiilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Liso lili lulanga lwa chiilu. Nipele liso lyenu lyaŵaga lyansima, chiilu chenu chose chichiŵe mu lilanguka. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Nambo liso lyenu lyaŵaga ngaŵa lyansima, chiilu chenu chose chichiŵe mu chipi. Nipele lilanguka lyalili nkati mwenu lyaŵaga mu chipi, chipi cho chili totoloo!<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akunnungu ni chipanje</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Ngapagwa jwakukombola kwatumichila achambuje ŵaŵili. Pakuŵa chanchime jumo ni kunnonyela jwine. Pane chanchimbichisye jumo ni kunnyelusya jwine. Ngankukombola kwatumichila Akunnungu nchitumichilaga mbiya kwanakamo.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Kwa lyele ligongo ngunsalila, ngasinlilagasya kwa ligongo lya umi wenu kuti chindye chichi ni ching'we chichi namose kwa ligongo lya iilu kuti chimmwale chichi. Pakuŵa umi utopele kupunda yakulya ni chiilu chitopele kupunda iwalo. <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Nnyilole ijuni ya mwikonde, ngaikupanda namose ngaikugungula atamuno nganiikola ikuti yaili yose. Nambo Atati ŵenu ŵa kwinani akuilisya. Ŵanyamwe ndi wakutopela kwipunda ijuni yo. <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Nipele, ŵaani mwa ŵanyamwe kwakulichenjeusya nnope akukombola kulijonjechesya namose lyuŵa limo mmoŵa ga umi wakwe?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Yankati iwalo, kwachichi nkulajilila? Nnole uluŵa wa mwikonde yaukuti umele wakwe. Ngaukupanganya masengo atamuno ngaukuliluchila iwalo. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Nambo ngunsalila kuti, namose mwenye che Selemani ni ukulu wao wose nganawale yambone mpela limo lya uluŵa wo. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Nipele iŵaga Akunnungu akulitakusya yeleyo lisamba lya mwitinji lyalikumela lelo ni malaŵi likupatuka ni kwasikwa pa mooto ana ngati chantakusye kwakupunda ŵanyamwe ŵandi ni chikulupi chamwana?<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Nipele ngasinkola lipamba chindye chichi? Atamuno ching'we chichi? Namose chimbwale chichi? <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Pakuŵa yose yo ikuchenjeuchilwa ni ŵandu ŵangakwamanyilila Akunnungu. Nambo mwanya Atati ŵenu ŵa kwinani akumanyilila kuti nkuilajila yele indu. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Nipele nsose kaje Umwenye wa Akunnungu ni kupanganya yaili yambone paujo pa Akunnungu, ni indu ine chiijonjechekwe kukwenu. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Nipele ngasinkola lipamba yankati malaŵi, pakuŵa malaŵi ikwete yakwe. Kulaga kwa lyuŵa limo kukunkwana kwa lyele lyuŵa.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Yankati kwalamula ŵandu ŵane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luka 6:37-38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Ngasimwalamula ŵane, kuti ni ŵanyamwe nkaika kulamulikwa ni Akunnungu, <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />pakuŵa chinchilamulikwa ni Akunnungu mpela inkuti kwalamula ŵane ni chipimo chilachila chinkupimila kwalamulila ŵane ni chichocho chachipimila Akunnungu kunlamula ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Ligongo chi nkulolechesya chiswani chachili mu liso lya mpwenu, ni papopo ngankulola chitela chachili mu liso lyenu? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Pane nkukombola chinauli kunsalila mpwenu kuti, ‘Mpwanga, nninde kaje nantyosye chiswani chachili mu liso lyenu’, akuno mu liso lyenu kwana chitela? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Jwaulamba mmwejo! Ntyosye kaje chitela chachili mu liso lyenu nipele chinlole uchenene ni kukombola kuchityosya chiswani chachili mu liso lya mpwenu.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Ngasimwapa mbwa chachili chachiswela, ngakaŵa chagalauche ni kumpalula, namose ngasimwajasila maguluŵe igogo yenu ya ndalama, ngakaŵa chailiŵate.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mmende, nsose ni kugomba nnango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Mmende ni ŵanyamwe chimpegwe, nsose ni ŵanyamwe chinnyiwone, mpoposye ni ŵanyamwe chachimbugulila nnango. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Pakuŵa jwalijose jwakuŵenda akupegwa ni jwakusosa akwiwona ni jwakupoposya nnango ukuugulikwa kwa ligongo lyakwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Ana jwapi mwa ŵanyamwe, mwanache aŵendaga nkate chiŵape liganga? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Pane aŵendaga somba, chiŵape lijoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Iŵaga ŵanyamwe ŵangalumbana, nkumanyilila kwapa achiŵana ŵenu indu yambone, isyene Atati ŵenu ŵa kwinani chatende mwakupunda, chiŵape yambone aŵala ŵakwaŵenda.<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />“Nipele yose inkusaka ŵandu ampanganyichisye, ni ŵanyamwe ŵakwe mwapanganyichisye iyoyo. Pakuŵa gelega gali malumbo ga malajisyo ga che Musa ni majiganyo ga ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnango wakunyilila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Njinjile kwa kupitila nnango wakunyilila. Pakuŵa litala lyalikwaula ku uwonasi lipangwiche, ni nnango wakwinjilila mwelemo uli wepanguche ni ŵakwinjila mwelemo atupile. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Nambo litala lya kwinjilila mu umi linyilile ni nnango wakwinjilila mwelemo uli wakunyilila ni ŵandu ŵakulimanyilila litala lyo nganatupa.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitela ni isogosi yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luka 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Nlilolechesye ni ŵakulondola ŵa unami. Ŵelewo akwika kukwenu ali nkuwoneka mpela ngondolo kwa paasa, nambo kwa munkati ali masogo gakalipa. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Chimwamanyilile kwa isambo yao. Uli?, Ŵandu akukombola kukaŵa sabibu pa chitela cha miiŵa, pane tini pa nkwanga? Ngwamba! <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Nipele, chitela chambone chikusogola isogosi yambone, ni chitela changalumbana chikusogola isogosi yangalumbana. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Chitela chambone ngachikusogola isogosi yangalumbana, ni chitela changalumbana ngachikusogola isogosi yambone. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Chitela chachili chose chingachikusogola isogosi yambone chachichigwisya ni kwasila pa mooto. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Nipele chinchamanyilila kwa isambo yao.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngangummanyilila ŵanyamwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Ngaŵa kila mundu jwakumilanga, ‘Ambuje, Ambuje’, juchajinjile mu umwenye wa kwinani, nambo ajula jwakwitenda yakwisaka Atati ŵangu ŵaali kwinani. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Lyuŵa lya malamulo lyo ŵajinji chaasalile, ‘Ambuje, Ambuje! Uwe ni ŵeŵala utwalalichilaga ngani syenu kwa liina lyenu, ni kwa liina lyenu twagakoposyaga masoka ni kupanganya yakusimonjeka yejinji’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Pelepo chinjasalila kwa kang'wa jangu, ‘Ŵanyamwe nganinammanya ng'o, ntyoche mmbujo mwangu, ŵanyamwe ŵankupanganya yaigongomalo.’<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵakutaŵa nyuumba ŵaŵili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Nipele jwalijose jwakugapilikana maloŵe gangu ni kugapanganya, akulandana ni mundu jwakwete lunda, jwataŵile nyuumba jakwe pa lwala. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Pajanyele ula, sulo syasewiche, mbungo japujile ni kujigomba nyuumba jila. Nambo nyuumba jo nganijigwa pakuŵa jaliji jitaŵikwe pachanya lwala.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />“Nambo jwalijose jwakugapilikanila maloŵe gangu ga nombejo anapanganye chachili chose, jwelejo akulandana ni mundu jwakuloŵela jwataŵile nyuumba jakwe pa nsanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Pajanyele ula, sulo syasewiche, ni mbungo japujile, ni kujigomba nyuumba jila, nombejo jagwile ni kugumuka jose.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukombole u Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Nipele, Che Yesu paŵamasile kuŵecheta maloŵe go, mpingo wa ŵandu ŵasimosile yatite kwiganya. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Pakuŵa ŵajiganyaga nti mundu jwali ni ukombole, ngaŵa mpela yakuti kwiganya ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ŵao.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunlamya mundu jwa matana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maliko 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Che Yesu paŵatulwiche pa chitumbi, mipingo jekulungwa ja ŵandu jakuiye. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Nipele, ŵaiche mundu jwa matana, ŵatindiŵalile ni kwakotamila ni kuti, “Ambuje, mwasakaga, nkukombola kuswejesya!” <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Che Yesu ŵajongwele nkono, ŵakwayiye ni kuti, “Ngusaka, nswejele.” Papopo mundu jo ŵalamile matana gao. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Mpilikane, munansalile mundu jwalijose, nambo njaule nkalilosye kwa jwambopesi, nkatyosye mbopesi mpela iŵatite pakusala che Musa kwalosya ŵandu wose kuti nnamile.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chikulupi cha chilongola jumo jwa Chiloma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Che Yesu paŵajinjilaga musi wa Kapelenaumu, chilongola jumo jwa ŵandu ŵangondo ŵa chilambo cha ku Loma ŵanjaulile ni kwachondelela ŵakamusye <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />achitiji, “Ambuje, katumetume jwangu agonile mu nyuumba atatele, ni akupotekwa nnope.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Chiiche kukunnamya.” <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Chilongola jwa ŵandu ŵangondo jo ŵanjanjile, “Ambuje, nganguŵajilwa mmwe njinjile mu nyuumba jangu. Nambo mmechete liloŵe pe ni katumetume jwangu chalame. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Pakuŵa noneji nombe ndili mundu jundi paasi pa ukombole wa achakulungwa, sooni ngwete ŵangondo paasi pa une. Nansalilaga jumo, ‘Njaule!’ Nombejo akwaula ni jwine, ‘Njise!’ Nombejo akwika ni kapolo jwangu, ‘Ntende achi!’, Nombejo akuchitenda.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Nipele, Che Yesu paŵagapilikene maloŵe go, ŵasimosile, ni ŵasalile ŵandu ŵaŵaliji aninkwakuya, “Ngunsalila isyene, nganinammone mundu jwali ni chikulupi mpela achi namuno mu chilambo cha ku Isilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Nipele, ngunsalila kuti, ŵandu achajinji chaiche kutyochela kungopochelo lyuŵa ni kulikuswela lyuŵa, ni ŵanyawo chatame pachindimba cha chakulya pamo ni che Iblahimu ni che Isaka ni che Yakobo mu Umwenye wa kwinani. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Nambo ŵelewo ŵati aŵe mu Umwenye wo chaponyekwe paasa, pa chipi, kweleko chalile ni kuchilimya meeno.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵansalile chilongola jwa ŵandu ŵangondo jula, “Njaule kumangwenu ni itendekwe kukwenu mpela inkuti pakukulupilila.” Ni katumetume jwao ŵalamile katema kakoko.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwalamya ŵandu ŵajinji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maliko 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Che Yesu ŵaiche kumusi ku che Petulo, ŵasimene akwegwao ŵa chikongwe che Petulo ali agonile pachindanda, aninkulwala chiboko. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵankwaiye nkono jwankongwe, nombewo ŵalamile ni ŵajimwiche ni kwatumichila.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Ligulo lyakwe, ŵaichisye ŵandu achajinji ŵaŵakamwilwe ni masoka, nombejo kwa litala lya majiganyo gakwe, ŵagaŵinjile masoka go ni kwalamya wose ŵaŵalwalaga. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Ŵatesile yeleyo kuti gamalile maloŵe gaŵaŵechete che Isaya jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu gagakuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">“Asyene akutyosisye kulaga kwetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">ni kutulamya ilwele yetu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵakusachilwa kuŵa ŵakulijiganya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Nipele, Che Yesu paŵauweni mpingo wa ŵandu uninkwasyungula, ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao ajomboche ajaulangane peesi litanda. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Jwakwiganya Malajisyo jumo ŵanjaulile Che Yesu ni kwasalila, “Jwakwiganya, une chinankuye kwakulikose kuchinjaule.” <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Che Yesu ŵatite, “Macheto gakwete masomwa, ni ijuni ikwete isusi, nambo Mwana jwa Mundu nganakola peuto pakupumulila.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Nipele, mundu jwine mwa ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵansalile, “Ambuje muuneche kaje nyaule ngaasiche atati ŵangu.” <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Nambo Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Munguye, mwaleche ŵawe ŵaasiche ŵawe ŵao.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akuchikalipila chimbunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maliko 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Che Yesu ŵajinjile mu ngalaŵa ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵajawile nawo. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Chisisimuchile jatandite kupuga chimbunga chekulungwa mu litanda ni matumbela gatandite kujiunichila ngalaŵa. Nambo Che Yesu ŵaliji agonile lugono. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵajaulile kukwajimusya achitiji, “Ambuje ntukulupusye, tulinkwasika!” <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ŵanyamwe ŵandu ŵandi ni chikulupi chamwana, ligongo chi nkogopa?” Nipele, ŵajinamukwiche, ni kuchikalipila chimbunga ni matumbela, ni kwatulele jii. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Ni ŵandu ŵasimonjile ni ŵatite, “Ana mundu ju ali jwanti uli? Namuno chimbunga ni matumbela ikwapilikanila!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwalamya ŵandu ŵaŵili ŵaali ni masoka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maliko 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Che Yesu paŵaiche peesi litanda mu chilambo cha Ŵagelasi, ŵandu ŵaŵili ŵaŵakamwilwe ni masoka ŵasimene nawo achikopochelaga kumalembe. Ŵandu wo ŵajogoyaga nnope, namose ŵandu nganapitaga litala lyo. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Nipele, ŵatandite kunyanyisya achitiji, “Nkusaka ichichi kwetuwe, alakwe Mwana jwa Akunnungu? Ana nnyiche kukutulagasya kakanaŵe katema ketu?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Chiŵandi ni pelepo kwaliji ni mpingo wa maguluŵe ganinkulya. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Nipele, masoka gala gaachondelele Che Yesu ganinkuti, “Iŵaga nkutukoposya, ntusalile tukagajinjile maguluŵe gala.” <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Che Yesu ŵagasalile, “Ayaga, njaule.” Papopo gakopweche kwa ŵandu ŵala ni kwinjila mmaguluŵe. Mpingo wose wa maguluŵe waselelechele mu litanda ni maguluŵe gose gawile mmeesi.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Ŵakuchinga maguluŵe gala ŵautwiche, ŵajawile mmusi. Kweleko ŵaasalile ŵandu ngani syose ni indu iyasimene ŵandu ŵaŵili ŵaŵakamwilwe ni masoka ŵala. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Nipele, ŵandu wose ŵa musi wo ŵatyosile kukwachingamila Che Yesu, paŵaweni ŵachondelele kuti atyoche mu chilambo chao.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunnamya mundu jwakutatala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maliko 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Che Yesu ŵajinjile mu ngalaŵa, ŵajombweche litanda ni kwika mmusi wao. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Pelepo ŵandu ŵampeleche mundu jumo jwatatele chiilu, ali agonile mu chitagala. Nipele Che Yesu paŵachiweni chikulupi chao, ŵansalile mundu jwakutatala jula, “Muusimane mtima, ambusanga! Nlecheleswe sambi syenu.” <verse eid="MAT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Nipele, ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ŵane ŵatandite ganisya mmitima jao aninkuti, “Mundu ju akwatukana Akunnungu!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Che Yesu ŵasimanyi ng'anisyo syao ni ŵausisye, “Kwachichi nkuganisya yangalumbana mmitima jenu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Chichi chili chakwepepala nnope, kusala, ‘Sambi syenu silecheleswe,’ pane kusala, ‘Njimuche, Njaule?’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Nambo, ngusaka mmanyilile kuti Mwana jwa Mundu akwete ukombole pa chilambo pano wa kwalechelesya ŵandu sambi syao.” Pelepo ŵansalile jwakutatala jo, “Njimuche, njigale chitagala chenu njaule kumangwenu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Nipele, mundu jo ŵajimwiche ni kwaula kumangwao. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Ŵandu wose mu mpingo wo paŵaiweni yeleyo, ŵasimosile ni kukamulwa ni lipamba, ŵaakusisye Akunnungu uŵapele ŵandu ukombole wanti yele.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akummilanga che Matayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maliko 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Che Yesu ŵatyosile pelepo, ni paŵajaulaga, ŵambweni mundu jumo ali atemi mu nyuumba ja kulipila nsongo liina lyakwe che Matayo. Nipele Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Munguye.” Nombe che Matayo, ŵajimwiche ni kwakuya.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Che Yesu paŵaliji mu nyuumba ji che Matayo kulya chakulya, ŵakukumbikanya nsongo ŵajinji ni ŵaali ni sambi ŵaiche ni kutama pamo nawo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Mafalisayo paŵaiweni yeleyo, ŵausisye ŵakulijiganya ŵa Che Yesu, “Kwachichi jwakunjiganya akulya pamo ni ŵakukumbikanya nsongo ni ŵaali ni sambi?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Che Yesu ŵagapilikene gelego ni ŵajanjile, “Ŵangakulwala ngakwalajila ŵantela, ikaŵe ŵakulwala ni ŵakwalajila ŵantela. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Nipele, njaule nkalijiganye malumbo ga maloŵe ga, ‘Ngusaka chanasa, ngaŵa mbopesi.’ Nganiika kukwaŵilanga ŵandu ŵakupanganya yambone paujo pa Akunnungu nambo ŵaali ni sambi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majiganyo gankati kutaŵa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maliko 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Nipele, ŵakulijiganya ŵa che Yohana Ŵakubatisya ŵajaulile Che Yesu ni kwausya, “Uweji ni Mafalisayo tukutaŵa kaŵilikaŵili, kwachichi ŵakulijiganya ŵenu ngakutaŵa?” <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Uli, nkuganisya kuti nkukombola kwatendekasya achambusanga ŵa mlombela asupuche akuno ali pamo nawo? Ngwamba! Nambo chikaiche katema pachajigalikwe mlombela jo pasikati jao, gele moŵa go chachitaŵa.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Ngapagwa mundu jwakutotela chigamba cha nguo jasambano mu nguo jewisale. Atamuno atendaga yeleyo chigamba chasambano cho chichipapule nguo jo, ni upapuche wakwe chiupundanganye. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Sooni ngapagwa ŵandu ŵakutaga divai jasambano mu misaku jewisale jekolochekwe ni mapende. Pakuŵa jele divai jasambano jo chijipapule misaku ni divai chijimwasiche ni misaku jo chijijonasiche. Nambo ŵandu akutaga divai jasambano mu misaku jasambano ni yose yana iŵili ikugosekwa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwali juŵawile ni jwankongwe jumo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maliko 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Nipele, Che Yesu paŵaliji nkuŵecheta gelego, ŵaiche chilongola jumo jwa Chiyahudi, ŵatindiŵalile ni kuti, “Mwali jwangu akuwa sampano. Nambo, choonde twende nkaasajichile nkono wenu kuti akole umi.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Che Yesu ŵajimi ni kunkuya, ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵajawile pamo nawo.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Jwakopochele jwankongwe jumo juŵalwalaga magono kwa yaka likumi ni iŵili, ŵannyichilile Che Yesu panyuma, ŵakwaiye lujenje lwa mwinjilo wao. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Ŵatesile yeleyo pakuŵa ŵaganisisye muntima mwao kuti, “Nakwayaga pe mwinjilo wakwe, chilame.” <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Nombe Che Yesu ŵagalawiche, ŵamweni ni ŵansalile, “Muusimane ntima, mwanangu, chikulupi chenu chinnamisye.” Jwankongwe jo ŵalamile katema kakoko.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵaiche mu nyuumba ja chilongola jula. Ni ŵaweni ŵakugomba ipeta ni mpingo wa ŵandu aninkulila kwa malumbo, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />ni ŵatite, “Ntyochanje pelepa, pakuŵa mwali ju nganajasika, agambile gona pe.” Ni ŵanyawo ŵaasechile. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Ŵandu ŵala paŵaŵinjikwe, Che Yesu ŵajinjile nkati, ŵankamwile nkono mwali jula, nombejo ŵajimwiche. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Ngani jila jajenele pa chilambo pala pose.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwalamya ŵandu ŵaŵili ŵangakulola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Che Yesu ŵatyosile pelepo, ni paŵaliji nkwaula, ŵandu ŵaŵili ŵangakulola ŵankuiye achinyanyisyaga, “Choonde Mwana ju che Daudi ntukolele chanasa!” <verse eid="MAT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Che Yesu paŵajinjile mu nyuumba, ŵangakulola wala ŵajaulile, nombejo ŵausisye, “Ana nkukulupilila kuti ngukombola kunlamya?” Nombewo ŵajanjile, “Elo, Ambuje.” <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Pelepo Che Yesu ŵagakwaiye meeso gao, ŵatite, “Iŵeje kukwenu mpela inkuti pakukulupilila.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Meeso gao gaugwiche. Nombe Che Yesu ŵakanyisye kwa nnope kuti, “Ngasimunsalila mundu jwalijose ngani ji.” <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Nambo ŵanyawo ŵatyosile ni kutanda kwenesya ngani si Che Yesu mchilambo chila chose.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunnamya mundu jwangakuŵecheta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Ŵandu ŵaŵili ŵala paŵaliji nkutyoka, ŵandu ŵane ŵannyichisye Che Yesu mundu jumo jwangakuŵecheta kwa ligongo lya kukamulwa ni masoka. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Paŵankopwesye masoka papopo mundu jwangakuŵecheta jula, ŵatandite kuŵecheta. Ŵandu ŵasimosile nikuti, “Nganigawoneche kose gelega mu chilambo cha ku Isilaeli!” <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Nambo Mafalisayo ŵatite, “Akugakoposya masoka kwa machili ga jwankulu jwa masoka.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwakolela chanasa ŵandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Che Yesu ŵasyungwile mose mmisi ni mmisinda jose, achijiganyaga mmajumba gao ga kupopelela, ni kulalichila Ngani Jambone ja Umwenye wa Akunnungu ni kwalamisya ŵandu ilwele yose ni kulaga kwakulikose. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Nipele, paŵaweni ŵandu, mipingo kwa mipingo, ŵakolele chanasa pakuŵa ŵapesile ni kukola lipamba chisau ngondolo syangali ni jwakuchinga. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Pelepo ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao, “Magungulo gali gamajinji, nambo ŵakugungula nganatupa. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Nipele mwapopele Ambuje ŵa magungulo, apeleche ŵakupanganya masengo mmagungulo gao.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Achinduna likumi ni ŵaŵili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maliko 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Che Yesu ŵaaŵilasile pamo ŵakulijiganya ŵao likumi ni ŵaŵili, ŵapele ukombole wa kugakoposya masoka, ni kwalamya ŵandu ilwele yose ni kulaga kwakulikose. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Ni meena ga ŵele achinduna likumi ni ŵaŵili wo gali gelega: Che Simoni jwakuŵilanjikwa che Petulo ni che Andulea mpwao, che Yakobo mwanagwao che Sebedayo ni che Yohana mpwao, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Che Filipo ni che Batolomayo, che Tomasi ni che Matayo juŵaliji jwakukumbikanya nsongo, che Yakobo mwanagwao che Alufayo ni che Tadayo, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Che Simoni jwa ku Kanani ni che Yuda Isikaliote juŵangalawiche Che Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwatuma achinduna likumi ni ŵaŵili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maliko 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵaatumile ŵanyawo kumi na mbili ni kwapa ulamusi achitiji: “Nkajaula mmajumba ga ŵandu ŵangaŵa Ŵayahudi, atamuno nkajinjila mmisi ja Ŵasamalia. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Nambo njaule kwa ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵasochelele mpela ngondolo syangali ni jwakuchinga. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Pinkwaulanga nkalalicheje yeleyi, ‘Umwenye wa kwinani uŵandichile.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Nkaalamye ŵakulwala, nkaasyusye ŵawile, nkaaswejesye ŵaali ni matana, nkagakoposye masoka. Mwapochele pangali malipilo, nkapeleganye pangali malipilo. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Kasinjigala sahabu atamuno mbiya atamuno makobili ga shaba mu ulendo wenu. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Nkajigala nsaku wa ulendo atamuno mwinjilo waaŵili, atamuno ilatu, atamuno nkongojo. Pakuŵa jwakupanganya masengo immajile kupegwa chakulya chakwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Sooni pachinkajinjile mu musi wauli wose atamuno mu nsinda, nkasose mwelemo mundu juchasache kumpochela, ni nkalonjele mwelemo mpaka pachinkatyoche. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Pachinjinjile mu nyuumba mwakomasye nchitiji, ‘Chitendewele chiŵe kukwenu.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Nipele, ŵele ŵakutama mu nyuumba mo ampochelaga, chitendewele chenu chichitame kwa ŵanyawo. Nambo yaŵaga ngakumpochela, nipele, chitendewele chenu chichimmujile mwachinsyene. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Nipele, akanaga kumpochela mundu jwalijose atamuno kugapilikana maloŵe genu, pachinkopoche mu jele nyuumba jo atamuno mu wele musi wo, nkung'unde luundu mmakongolo mwenu kulosya kuti mkwajamuka. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Ngunsalila isyene, lyuŵa lya malamulo, ŵandu ŵa wele musi wo chakole magambo gamakulungwa kupunda gegala ga ku Sodoma ni ku Gomola.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagasyo gagakwika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maliko 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Nnole, nguntuma ŵanyamwe mpela ngondolo mmasogo. Nipele nkole lunda mpela majoka, ni ŵakulitimalika mpela nguunda. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Mlilolechesye ni ŵandu, pakuŵa chachinjausya ŵanyamwe pankungulu ni chachimputa mbokola mmajumba gao ga kupopelela. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Chachinjausya kwa achakulu ni mamwenye kwa ligongo lyangu une, mpatanje kwasalila ŵanyawo Ngani Jambone jankati une ni kwa ŵandu ŵangaŵa Ŵayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Nipele pachachinjausya ŵanyamwe pa nkungulu, nkakola lipamba lyati chimmechete chichi pane chimmechete chinauli, pichikaiche katema, chimpegwe chakuŵecheta. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Pakuŵa ngaŵa ŵanyamwe ni uchimmechete, nambo Mbumu jwa Atati ŵenu jwaali nkati mwenu ni juchaŵechete.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Nipele, jwankulungwa changalauche jwamnung'una aulajikwe, ni atati changalauche mwanagwe, ni ŵanache chiŵagalauche achaŵelesi ŵao ni kwaulaga. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Ŵandu chanchimanje ŵanyamwe kwaligongo lya kuungulupilila une. Nambo juchapililile mpaka kumbesi, jwelejo ni juchakulupuche. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Annagasyaga ŵandu mmusi umo, mmutuchilanje mmusi wine. Ngunsalila isyene, ngammalisya kuutuchila misi jinajose ja ku Isilaeli akanaŵe kwika Mwana jwa Mundu.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Jwakulijiganya ngakumpunda jwakwiganya pane kapolo ngakumpunda mmbujegwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Paichile pa jwakulijiganya kuŵa mpela jwakujiganya ni kapolo mpela mmbujegwe. Iŵaga ammilasile nsyene nyuumba Belesebuli, uli ana ngati chakapunde kwaŵilanga ŵandu ŵaali mu nyuumba jo meena gakusakala nnope.<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵakusachilwa kwajogopa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Nipele, kasimwajogopa ŵandu. Pakuŵa kila chindu cheunichikwe chichiŵe cheunukukwe, ni kila chachisisikwe chichimanyiche. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Chingunsalila pa chipi, nchisale palulanga, ni chinkupilikana mwipikanilo kwakunsongonela, nkachisale kwa ŵandu pangasisa. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Kasimwajogopa ŵakuchiulaga chiilu, nambo ngakukombola kujiulaga mbumu. Mmbaya mwajogope ŵakukombola kuchijonanga chiilu ni mbumu ku mooto wangasimika moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Ijojolo iŵili ikusumichikwa kwa senti jimo. Namose ngapagwa hata chimo chachikuwa pangali Atati ŵenu kusaka. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Nambo kukwenu ŵanyamwe, atamuno umbo sya muntwe wenu nombe nasyo siŵalanjikwe syose. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Kwayele ngasinjogopa, ŵanyamwe ndi ŵakutopela mwakuipunda ijojolo.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwakunda ni kwakana Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Nipele, jwalijose jwakunyitichisya une paujo pa ŵandu kuti jwele ali jwangune, noneji chinankunde jwelejo paujo pa Atati ŵangu ŵaali kwinani. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Nambo jwalijose juchachingana paujo pa ŵandu, noneji chinamkane paujo pa Atati ŵangu ŵaali kwinani.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utiinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Nkaganisya kuti ichenawo chitendewele pachilambo pano. Ngwamba! Nganiikanawo chitendewele nambo ichenawo ngondo. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Pakuŵa iche kukuntindanya mundu ni atatigwe, mwali ni achikulugwe, akwegwe ni nkwegwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Ni ŵammagongo ŵa mundu chaŵe ŵandu ŵaali mu nyuumba jakwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Jwakunnonyela atatigwe pane achikulugwe kumbunda une, jwelejo ngakuŵajilwa kuŵa jwakulijiganya jwangu. Ni jwakunnonyela mwana jwannume pane mwana jwankongwe kumbunda une, jwelejo ngakuŵajilwa kuŵa jwakulijiganya jwangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Mundu jwangakuujigala nsalaba wakwe ni kunguya, jwelejo ngakuŵajilwa kuŵa jwakulijiganya jwangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Nipele, jwalijose jwakuugosa umi wakwe, chaujase, nambo jwele juchautyosye umi wakwe kwa ligongo lya kungulupilila une, chachiusimana.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbote</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maliko 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Jwakumpochela ŵanyamwe, akumbochela une ni jwakumbochela une, akwapochela ŵele ŵandumile une wo. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Jwakumpochela jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu ligongo atekuŵa jwakulondola, chachipochela mbote ja jwakulondola. Nombe jwakumpochela mundu jwakupanganya yambone paujo pa Akunnungu pakuŵa ali jwambone, chachipochela mbote ja mundu jwakupanganya yambone paujo pa Akunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Ngunsalila isyene, jwalijose juchachimpa jumo jwa ŵangamanyika kwannope ŵa ngao wa meesi gamasisi, pakuŵa ali ŵakulijiganya ŵangu, isyene, jwelejo chachipochela mbote jakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Ŵantenga kutyochela ku Che Yohana Ŵakubatisya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Nipele, Che Yesu paŵamalisisye kwalajisya ŵakulijiganya ŵao likumi ni ŵaŵili, ŵatyosile kweleko, ŵajawile kwiganya ni kulalichila mmisi jajili ku Galilaya.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Nombe che Yohana paŵaliji mu nyuumba jakutaŵilwa ŵapilikene ngani ja masengo ga Kilisito Jwakuwombola, ŵaatumile ŵakulijiganya ŵao, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />akausye, “Ana mmwe ni ŵele ŵakwika ŵala pane twalolele ŵane?” <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Che Yesu ŵaajanjile, “Njaulanje nkaasalile che Yohana aila inkuipilikana ni kuilola. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Ŵangalola akulola, ni ŵangajenda akwenda, ni ŵamatana akuswejeswa, ni ŵangapilikana akupilikana, ni ŵawe akusyuswa, ni ŵakulaga akusalilwa Ngani Jambone. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Jwana upile jwele mundu jwangakungolela lipamba.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Nipele, ŵele ŵakulijiganya ŵa che Yohana paŵaliji nkwenda, Che Yesu ŵatandite kwasalila ŵandu ngani si che Yohana aninkuti, “Ana mwajawile kukulola chichi kwele kwipululu ko? Uli, mwajawile kukulilola litete lili nkupungunyikwa ni mbungo?” <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Iŵaga ngaŵa yeleyo ana mwajawile kukulola chichi? Mwajawile kukunnola mundu jwawete iwalo yambone? Ŵandu ŵakuwala iwalo yambone akutama mmajumba ga mamwenye. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Nambo, ana mwajawile kukulola chichi? Mwajawile kukunnola Jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu? Elo, ngunsalila, jwakumpunda jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Jwelejo ni che Yohana, Akunnungu juŵangambaga mmalembelo ga Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:10">Nnole, nguntuma jwantenga jwangu mmbujo mwenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:10">juchakankolochesye litala lyenu. <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Ngunsalila isyene, mwa ŵandu ŵakutama mu chilambo, nganatyochele mundu jwali jwankulungwa kumpunda che Yohana Ŵakubatisya. Nambo jwalijose jwakulolechela jwannandi mu Umwenye wa kwinani ali jwankulungwa kumpunda jwelejo. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Chitandile katema kaŵalalichilaga che Yohana Ŵakubatisya mpaka lelo, umwenye wa kwinani ukukanikwa, ni ŵandu ŵaali ni machili akulinga kuujigala kwa machili. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Majiganyo gose ga ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu ni Malajisyo gakunguluchile ngani ja umwenye wa Akunnungu mpaka katema ka che Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Iŵaga nkusaka kwitichisya gelega, che Yohana ju ni che Elia juchaiche. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Jwakwete mapilikanilo, apilikane!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Chinaulandanye ni chichi uŵelesi wu? Ulandene ni achachanda ŵaŵatemi paluŵala lwa kusumichisya malonda, ni kuŵechetesyana ni achinjao,<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Twangombele ngoma nambo nganintyala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">Twanjimbile nyimbo sya pamalilo nambo nganinlila!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Pakuŵa Che Yohana ŵaiche, ŵataŵaga ni nganang'waga divai, ni ŵanyawo ŵatite, ‘Akamwilwe ni masoka.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mwana jwa Mundu ŵaiche, achilyaga ni aching'waga ni ŵanyawo ŵatite, ‘Munnole aju, jwakutolwa ni jwakolelwa, mmbusanga jwa ŵakukumbikanya nsongo ni ŵa sambi!’ Nambo lunda lwa Akunnungu lwawoneche kuŵa lwambone kwa litala lya ipanganyo yakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵandu ŵangakulupila ŵa misi jine jine</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵatandite kwakalipila ŵandu ŵa misi jo jiŵatesile yakusimonjeka, nambo ŵandu ŵakwe nganaleka sambi. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Ulaje kukwenu ku Kolasini! Ulaje kukwenu ku Besesaida! Pakuŵa, ayi yakusimosya yaitendekwe kukwenu, ikatendekwe akula ku Tilo ni ku Sidoni kula, ŵandu ŵakwe akawasile magunia ni kutama mu itutu kulosya kuti alesile sambi syao. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Nambo ngunsalila, lyuŵa lya kulamula, ŵanyamwe chinjamukwe kwannope kupunda ŵandu ŵa ku Tilo ni ku Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Nomwe Kapelenaumu ana chinlikusye mpaka kwinani? Chinchituluswa mpaka kwiuto kwa ŵandu ŵawile. Pakuŵa, yakusimosya yaitendekwe kukwenu ikatendekwe ku Sodoma, wele musi wo ukaliji chiŵela mpaka lelo. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Nambo ngunsalila, lyuŵa lya kulamula mmwe chinjamukwe kwannope kupunda ŵandu ŵa ku Sodoma.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njise kukwangu nkapumulile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Katema kakoko, Che Yesu ŵatite, “Nguntogolela Atati, Ambuje ŵa kwinani ni chilambo, pakuŵa mwasisile indu yi ŵandu ŵa lunda ni ŵandu ŵa umanyilisi ni kwaunukulila ŵanache. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Elo, Atati, pakuŵa yeleyo ni yaitite pakunnonyela.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Atati ŵangu ambele indu yose. Ngapagwa jwakummanyilila Mwana, akaŵe Atati, ni sooni ngapagwa jwakummanyilila Atati, akaŵe Mwana ni jwalijose jwakunsaka Mwana kuti ammunukulile. <verse eid="MAT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Njisanje kukwangu ŵanyamwe wose unkusauka ni kutopelwa ni misigo jakutopa, none chinampumusye. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Mungunde, nkalijiganye kukwangu, pakuŵa une ndili jwakutulala ni jwakulitulusya, nomwe chinkapumule mmitima jenu. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Pakuŵa chingunsalila mpanganye chili chambone kukwenu ni chingumpa njigale ngachikutopa.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Ambuje ŵa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maliko 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Kele katema ko Che Yesu ŵapitaga mmigunda ja ngano pa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila. Nipele, ŵakulijiganya ŵao jakwete sala, ŵatandite kupulula masache ga ngano ni kulya. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Nambo Mafalisayo paŵaiweni yeleyo, ŵaasalile Che Yesu, “Nnole, ŵakulijiganya ŵenu akugapanganya gamakanye kugapanganya pa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile ŵanyawo kuti, “Uli nganinsyome iŵatite pakupanganya che Daudi pamo ni achinjakwe pajakwete sala? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Jwelejo jwajinjile mu Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ŵajigele ni kulya mikate jijatyosyekwe kwa ligongo lya Akunnungu. Che Daudi ni achinjakwe nganasachilwa kulya ikaŵe ŵambopesi pe. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Pane, uli ngannaŵe kusyoma mmalembelo ga Malajisyo ga Akunnungu gaŵapele che Musa kila Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila ŵambopesi akugatema Malajisyo pa nyuumba ja Akunnungu, nambo ngakuŵalanjilwa kuŵa aleŵile? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Nipele, ngunsalila kuti apano apali jwaali jwankulu kujipunda Nyuumba ja Akunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Nambo nkagamanyilile malumbo gakwe aga maloŵe ga gaasasile Akunnungu, ‘Ngusaka chanasa ngaŵa mbopesi,’ ngankaalamule ŵandu ŵangali ni sambi. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Pakuŵa Mwana jwa Mundu ali Ambuje ŵa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu jwali ni nkono wakutatala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maliko 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵatyosile pelepo, ŵajinjile mu nyuumba ja kupopelela. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Mwaliji ni mundu jumo jwali ni nkono wakutatala. Nipele, ŵandu ŵausisye Che Yesu, “Uli, ili yambone kunnamya mundu pa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila?” Ŵambusisye yeleyo kuti akolanje ligongo lya kwaŵechetela.<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Nambo Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Tujile jumo jwenu akwete ngondolo jimo, nombe najo jitumbuchile mwisimbo, uli, ana nganjenda kujikamula ni kujityosya pakuŵa lili Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Nambo, mundu atopele kujipunda ngondolo! Nipele, ili yambone kupanganya yaili yambone pa Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Nipele, ŵansalile mundu jo kuti, “Ngolosye nkono wenu.” Ŵaugolwesye, nombe ni ŵalamile chisau nkono wine ula. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Nipele, Mafalisayo ŵatyosile paasa ni kuusyana ichajile pakwaulaga Che Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Katumetume jwasagulikwe ni Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Nambo Che Yesu paŵasimanyi ng'anisyo syao, ŵatyosile pepala. Ŵandu achajinji ŵakuiye ni ŵaalamisye ŵakulwala wose, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />ŵakanyisye ngasiŵamanyisya ŵandu ngani syakwe, <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />pakuti gamalile maloŵe gaŵechete jwakulondola che Isaya,<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Nnole, jwakutumichila jwangu junansagwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">jwakunonyelwa jwangu jwakuusengwasya nnope ntima wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Chinantaje Mbumu jwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">nombejo chakaasalile ŵandu ŵa ilambo kulamula kwangu.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Ngasakola makani atamuno nganyanyisya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">ni liloŵe lyao ngalipikanika mwitala.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Chapunde kwakolela chanasa ŵandu ŵakwete masauko ga kuputikwa kwa nnasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">ni kwakamulisya ntima ŵandu ŵangali machili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">mpaka ulamusi waukusachilwa pachiukomboleswe kulamula.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Ŵandu wose ŵa ilambo yose chakole chilolelo kwa jwelejo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ni Belesebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maliko 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Papopo ŵandu ŵannyichisye Che Yesu mundu jwangalola atamuno kuŵecheta kwa ligongo lya kukamulwa ni masoka. Nipele ŵannamisye jwangaŵecheta jo ni jwaŵechete ni kulola. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Mpingo wose wa ŵandu ŵasimosile ni ŵatite, “Jweleju ngati Mwana ju che Daudi?” <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Nambo Mafalisayo paŵapilikene gelego, ŵatite, “Mundu ju akugakoposya masoka kwa machili ga Belesebuli jwankulu jwa masoka.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Che Yesu ŵasimanyilile ng'anisyo syao, ŵaasalile, “Umwenye wauliwose waugaŵanyiche maunjili maunjili gagakumenyana, ngaukulonjela, yalumo peyo, musi pane ŵandu ŵa nyuumba jajilijose agaŵanyikaga maunjili maunjili gagakumenyana achinsyene pe, nyuumba jo ngajijima. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Iŵaga mpingo umo ukumenyana ni mpingo wine mu umwenye wa Shetani, malumbo gakwe umwenye wo ugaŵanyiche, nipele, chiujime chinauli? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Ŵanyamwe nkutinji une ngugakoposya masoka kwa machili ga Belesebuli, uli, ŵakulijiganya ŵenu akugakoposya kwa machili ga acheni? Kwa lye ligongo lyo ŵandu ŵakunkuya ni ŵachammechetele ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Nambo iŵaga une ngugakoposya masoka kwa ukombole wa Mbumu jwa Akunnungu, pelepo mmanyilile kuti umwenye wa Akunnungu unnyichilile.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />“Sooni mundu akukombola chinauli kwinjila mu nyuumba ja mundu jwali ni machili ni kunsumula chipanje chakwe, akanamtaŵe kaje mundu jwali ni machili jula? Pele ni pachapakombole kunsumula chipanje chakwe.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“Jwalijose jwanganaŵa pamo none, akunganila une ni jwangasonganganya ŵandu pamo none, akwapwilinganya. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Kwa lye ligongo lyo ngunsalila, ŵandu chalecheleswe sambi ni liloŵe lyalili lyose lyakwatukana Akunnungu, nambo juchantukane Mbumu jwa Akunnungu jwelejo ngalecheleswa. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Ni jwalijose juchaŵechete liloŵe lya kunkanila Mwana jwa Mundu, chalecheleswe, nambo jwele juchaŵechete liloŵe lya kunkanila Mbumu jwa Akunnungu jo, ngalecheleswa, ngaŵa pa chilambo cha sambano chi atamuno pa chilambo chachikwika cho.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitela ni isogosi yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Chitela chambone chikusogola isogosi yambone ni chitela changalumbana chikusogola isogosi yangalumbana. Nipele chitela chikumanyika kwa isogosi yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Ŵanyamwe uŵelesi wa majoka! Nkukombola chinauli kusala gambone mwasyene mwaŵaga ŵangalumbana? Pakuŵa mundu akuŵecheta agala gagagumbele mu ntima wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Mundu jwambone akukoposya gambone mu ngokwe jakwe jambone, ni mundu jwangalumbana akukoposya gangalumbana mu ngokwe jakwe jangalumbana.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Nipele, ngunsalila, lyuŵa lya kulamula ŵandu chasachilwe kwanga kwa liloŵe lyalili lyose lyangalumbana lyaŵaŵechete. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Pakuŵa kwa maloŵe genu gambone chachimmalanjila kuti ndi ŵambone paujo pa Akunnungu, ni kwa maloŵe genu gakusakala chinchilamulwa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusaka chimanyisyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maliko 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Nipele, ŵane ŵa ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ni Mafalisayo ŵaasalile Che Yesu kuti, “Jwakwiganya, tukusaka kulola chimanyisyo kutyochela kukwenu.” <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Nombejo ŵaajanjile, “Uŵelesi wangalumbana ni wangakulupilichika! Nkusakanga chimanyisyo, nambo ngampegwa chimanyisyo ikaŵe achila pe chimanyisyo cha che Yona jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Pakuŵa mpela che Yona iŵatite pakutama moŵa gatatu muusi ni chilo mlutumbo lwa somba jajikulungwa, iyoyo Mwana jwa Mundu nombe ni ichajile pakutama mu lisi moŵa gatatu muusi ni chilo. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Ŵandu ŵa ku Ninawi chakopochele katema kakulamula, nombewo chasale kuti au uŵelesi u wana magambo. Pakuŵa ŵandu ŵa ku Ninawi ŵalesile sambi syao kwa ligongo lya kulalichila ku che Yona, ni nnole, apano apali jwampundile che Yona! <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Mwenye jwankongwe jwa chilambo cha ku Sheba chakopochele katema au uŵelesi u pachiulamulikwe, nombe chasale kuti uŵelesi u wana magambo. Pakuŵa ŵelewo ŵaiche kutyochela kwakutalika, ŵaiche kukugapilikanila maloŵe ga lunda ga mwenye che Selemani, nambo pelepa kwana jwankulungwa kupunda mwenye che Selemani.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuja kwa lisoka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Lisoka palikunkopoka mundu, likusyungula syungula mwipululu mwangali meesi lichisosaga pakupumulila, nambo lyalepelaga kupata, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />pelepo ni likuti, ‘Chimujile ku nyuumba jangu akula kungopochele kula.’ Nambo palikuuja ni kujisimana nyuumba jila jili jangali chindu ni jepyajile ni jekolosye, <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />pele likwaula kukugajigala masoka gane saba gakusakala kupunda ŵelewo, gose gakwaula kukunjinjila jwele mundu jo. Ni jwele mundu jo akuŵa jwangalumbana nnope kupunda iŵaliji kundanda. Yeleyo ni ichijile pakutyochela kwa ŵandu ŵangalumbana.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Achalongo ŵausyesyene ŵa Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maliko 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Che Yesu paŵaliji aninkwendelechela kukunguluka ni mipingo ja ŵandu, achikulu ŵao ni achalongo ajao ŵaiche ni kwima paasa, ŵasachile kunguluka nawo. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Nipele, mundu jumo ŵaasalile Che Yesu kuti, “Achikulu ŵenu ni achalongo ajenu ajimi paasa, akusaka kuŵecheta nomwe.” <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Nambo Che Yesu ŵanjanjile jwele mundu jo kuti, “Ŵaani achikulu ŵangu? Ni ŵaani achalongo ajangu?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Che Yesu ŵanlanjile mundu jula ŵakulijiganya ŵao achitiji, “Ŵeleŵa ni ŵaali achikulu ŵangu ni achalongo achinjangu! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Pakuŵa jwalijose jwakupanganya yakuisaka Atati ŵangu ŵa kwinani, jwelejo ni mpwanga ni mlumbwangu ni achikulu ŵangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha jwakupanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliko 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Ndaŵi jijojo, Che Yesu ŵakopweche mu nyuumba jila, ŵajawile kukutama mungulugulu litanda. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Mipingo jajikulungwa ja ŵandu jansyungwile nipele ŵakwesile mu ngalaŵa ni kutama. Ŵandu wose ŵajimi mungulugulu litanda, <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />nombe Che Yesu ŵaasalile indu yejinji kwa itagu, achitiji, “Mpilikane! Jwakupanda ŵajawile kukumisa mbeju.<verse eid="MAT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />“Paŵaliji nkumisa mbeju, sine syapatuchile mungulugulu matala ga mmigunda, nipele yaiche ijuni ni kusimila. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Sine syapatuchile mmaganga pangali litaka lyejinji. Syawoneche simesile kwachitema pakuŵa litaka lyaliji kanandi. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Nipele, lyuŵa palyaŵasile syatiniche ligongo michiga jakwe jaliji nganijijinjilisya paasi, syajumwile. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Sine syapatuchile pa miiŵa, nombe miiŵa jo jamesile ni kusiŵijikanya. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Sine syapatuchile pa litaka lya chajila, syamesile, ni kusogola, sine mia moja, sine sitini ni sine selasini. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Jwakwete mapilikanilo ga kupilikanila, apilikane!”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nningwa wa kwiganya kwa itagu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maliko 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵao Che Yesu ŵajaulile ni kwausya kuti, “Ana ligongo chi nkuŵecheta ni ŵandu kwa itagu?” <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ŵanyamwe mpegwilwe ukombole wa kumanyilila yantemela ya umwenye wa kwinani nambo ŵanewo nganapegwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Pakuŵa jwalijose jwakwete chindu chapegwe ni kujonjecheswa, nambo jwele jwanganakola chindu, atamuno chele chakwete cho chasumulwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Kwa ligongo lyo nguŵecheta nawo kwa itagu, pakuŵa akulola nambo ngakulola, akupilikana nambo ngakupilikanichisya atamuno ngakumanyilila. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Kwa ŵelewo gamalile agala maloŵe gaŵechete che Isaya jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu gagakuti:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Kupilikana chimpilikane nambo ngammanyilila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">Kulola chinlolechesye nambo ngammona.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Pakuŵa lunda lwa ŵele ŵandu wo lupungwene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">agasiŵile mapilikanilo gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">akupilenje.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Nambo ikaliji akulola kwa meeso gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ni kupilikana kwa mapilikanilo gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">nombe akamanyilile kwa lunda lwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ni kung'alauchila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">none ngaalamisye.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />“Nambo nkwete upile ŵanyamwe pakuŵa meeso genu gakulola ni mapilikanilo genu gakupilikana. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Ngunsalila isyene kuti ŵakulondola achajinji ni ŵandu ŵajinji ŵakupanganya yambone paujo pa Akunnungu, ŵasachile kugaona gankugaona nambo nganagaona ni kugapilikana gamkugapilikana nambo nganagapilikana.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malumbo ga chitagu cha jwakupanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maliko 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Nipele, ŵanyamwe mpilikane malumbo ga achi chitagu cha jwakupanda chi. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Jwalijose jwakulipilikana liloŵe lyankati Umwenye wa Akunnungu pangalimanyilila, ali mpela mbeju sisyapatuchile mmatala ga mmigunda, Jwangalumbana jula akwika kuchityosya chele chepandikwe mu ntima mwakwe cho. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Nombe syele mbeju sisyapatuchile mmaganga, sili mpela mundu jwakupilikana liloŵe ni kulipochela kwa unonyelo. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Nambo ngakulikamulichisya ni nganakola michiga nkati mwakwe, akulikamula katema kakajipi pe, pakukutyochela kulaga ni kusauka kwa ligongo lya liloŵe lyo, papopo akuleka kulikulupilila liloŵe. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Nombe syele mbeju sisyapatuchile pa miiŵa syo sili mpela mundu jwakulipilikana liloŵe, nambo kwa ligongo lya kuchenjeuchila masengo ga umi watulinawo ni kuchinonyela kwannope chipanje kukuliŵijikanya liloŵe lyo, nombejo ngakusogola isogosi, yaani kupanganya yaikwanonyelesya Akunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Nombe syele mbeju sisyapatuchile pa litaka lyambone sili mpela mundu jwakupilikana liloŵe ni kulimanyilila, jwelejo akupanganya yejinji yambone yaikusachilwa mpela mbeju ijikuti pakusogola, jimo mia moja, jine sitini, ni jine selasini.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha masindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya chitagu chine kuti, “Umwenye wa kwinani ukulandana ni mundu jwapandile mbeju syambone mu ngunda wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Nambo ŵandu paŵaliji agonile, ŵaiche jwammagongo jwakwe, ŵapandile masindi mwepande ngano, ni kutyoka. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Nipele, pasyamesile mbeju ni kutanda kusogola ni masindi gatandite kuwoneka. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Achikapolo ŵa asyene ngunda ŵaiche nikuti, ‘Ambuje, ngati mwapandile mbeju syambone mu ngunda mwenu? Sambano gatyochele kwapi masindi?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Nipele ŵatite, ‘Jwammagongo ni jwatesile yeleyo.’ Nipele, achikapolo wakwe ŵaausisye, ‘Uli, nkusaka tujaule tukagatupule?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Nombejo ŵajanjile, ‘Ngwamba, pachintupule masindi, pane chinkatupule pamo ni ngano. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Nneche ikule yose pamo mpaka katema ka kugungula. Nipele, katema ka kugungula chinjasalila ŵakugungula kuti, nsonganganye kaje masindi nkagataŵikanye ilingo ilingo, nkagatinisye. Nambo ngano nsonganganye ni kutaga mu ngokwe jangu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha mbeju ja Haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maliko 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵaatagulile ŵandu chitagu chine kuti, “Umwenye wa kwinani ulandene ni mbeju jajinandi nnope jajikuŵilanjikwa haladali jatosile mundu ni kujipanda mungunda mwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Jisyene jili jajinandi kusipunda mbeju sine syose, nambo jamelaga ni kukula jikuŵa jajikulungwa kupunda mimela jose. Ukukula ni kuŵa chitela mpaka ijuni ya mwinani ikwika ni kutaŵa isusi mu nyambi syakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha amila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵandu chitagu chine kuti, “Umwenye wa kwinani ulandene ni amila jajigele jwankongwe jumo, ni kuwanganya ni utandi mbisi siŵili ni nusu, ni utandi wose wasaseŵele.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakuti pakutumia itagu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Maliko 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵandu yose kwa itagu. Ni pangali chitagu nganiŵasalila chachili chose. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Pakuti limalile liloŵe lyaŵechete jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Chiŵechetenawo kwa itagu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">chinaasalile ŵandu indu yaisisikwe chitandile kugumbikwa chilambo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akusagamukula chitagu cha masindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵaulesile mpingo wa ŵandu, ŵajinjile mu nyuumba. Ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaichile ni kwasalila, “Ntugopolele chitagu cha masindi ga mungunda.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Jwakupanda mbeju syambone ni Mwana jwa Mundu. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Nombe ngunda uli chilambo chino. Nombe syele mbeju syambone syo sili ŵele ŵandu ŵati Umwenye uli wo. Nambo masindi ali ŵandu ŵa jwangalumbana jula. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Nombe jwammagongo jwapandile masindi ali Shetani. Magungulo gali mbesi ja chilambo chino, nombe ŵakugungula ali achikatumetume ŵa kwinani. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Mpela ila masindi igakuti pakusonganganywa ni kutinisya, iyoyo ichichiŵa kumbesi kwa chilambo chino. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana jwa Mundu chachalajisya achikatumetume ŵao ŵa kwinani kuti asonganganye kutyochela mu Umwenye wao wose aŵala ŵakwaleŵekasya ŵandu atende sambi ni wose ŵatesile ya sambi. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Ni achikatumetume ŵa kwinani wo chiŵaponye ŵandu pa litanuli lya mooto wakalipa ni kweleko chalile ni kuchilimya meeno. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Kele katema ko ŵandu ŵakupanganya yaili yambone paujo pa Akunnungu chachimelemenda mpela lyuŵa mu Umwenye wa Atati ŵao. Ŵakwete mapikanilo, apikanile!<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha mbiko jajisisiche</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Umwenye wa kwinani ulandene ni mbiko jajisisiche mu ngunda. Mundu jumpepe ŵajiweni ni kujisisa sooni. Nipele ŵasangalele nnope ni ŵajawile kukuisumisya iŵakwete yose ni kusuma ngunda ula.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha igogo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Sooni, umwenye wa kwinani ulandene ni mundu jwakusumisya malonda achisosaga igogo yambone. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Nombe paŵachiweni chigogo chimo cha ndalama jajikulungwa, ŵajawile, ŵaisumisye iŵakwete yose, ŵachisumile chigogo chila.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha lwau lwa somba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Sooni, Umwenye wa kwinani ulandene ni lwau lwauponyekwe mu litanda, lwatanjile somba syasili syose. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Lwau palwagumbele, ŵakukoka somba ŵaluutile kumbwani, ŵatemi kusagula somba syambone ni kusitaga mu itundu yao ni somba syangalumbana ŵasijasile. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Yeleyi ni ichichiŵa kumbesi kwa chilambo chino, achikatumetume ŵa kwinani chachikopochela, chiŵalekanganye ŵandu ŵambone ni ŵangalumbana. <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />Nombe ŵele ŵangalumbana wo chiŵajasile pa litanuli lya mooto. Kweleko chachilila ni kuchilimya meeno.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbiko ja sambano ni ja kalakala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Che Yesu ŵausisye, “Ana gele gose ga nkugamanyilila?” Ŵajanjile, “Elo.” <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Nombewo ŵaasalile, “Kwa ligongo lyo, jwakwiganya Malajisyo ga Akunnungu gaŵapele che Musa jwalijose jwakuŵa jwakulijiganya jwa Umwenye wa kwinani, alandene ni nsyene nyuumba jwakukoposya mu mbiko jakwe indu ya ndalama ya sambano ni indu ya ndalama ya kalakala.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akukanikwa ku Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maliko 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Che Yesu paŵamasile kuŵecheta yele itagu yo, ŵatyosile pelepo, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />ni ŵapite mu musi wao. Kweleko ŵajiganyaga ŵandu mu nyuumba jao ja kupopelela, nombewo ŵasimosile nikuti, “Jweleju apatile kwapi alu lunda lu ni ukombole wa kuipanganya yakusimonjeka? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Ana ajuju ngati mwana jwa jwakusepa itela? Achikulu ŵao ngati akuŵilanjikwa che Maliamu ni achapwakwe ngati che Yakobo ni che Yusufu ni che Simoni ni che Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Achalumbugwe wose ngati ali pamo ni uweji? Nambi ajuju apatile kwapi aga gose ga?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Nipele, nganiŵakunda. Nambo Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu akuchimbichikwa nambo ngaakuchimbichikwa mu chilambo chakwe ni mu nyuumba jakwe!” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Kwa ligongo lyo, nganatenda yakusimonjeka yaijinji ligongo lya ungali chikulupi wao.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi Che Yohana Ŵakubatisya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maliko 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Kele katema ko chilongola che Helode ŵapilikene ngani si Che Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Nipele, ŵaasalile achikatumetume ŵao, “Jwele mundu ni che Yohana Ŵakubatisya asyuchile mchiwa, lyele ni ligongo machili gakupanganya yakusimonjeka gakupanganya masengo nkati mwakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Che Helode ni juŵankamwile che Yohana ni kuntaŵa kwa minyolo, ŵammisile mu nyuumba jakutaŵilwa kwa ligongo lya che Helodia, ŵankwawo che Filipo nkulugwe. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Ligongo che Yohana ŵansalile che Helode kuti, “Ngankusachilwa kunnombela jwele jwankongwe jo!” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Che Helode ŵasachile kwaulaga che Yohana, nambo ŵajogwepe ŵandu pakuŵa kukwao che Yohana ŵaliji jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Nipele, pa chindimba cha lyuŵa lyekulungwa lya kupagwa kwao che Helode, mwali jwao che Helodia ŵatyasile mmbujo mwa achalendo ni mwali jula ŵaasengwasisye che Helode, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />mpaka ŵalanjile achitiji, “Ngulumbilila, chinampe chachili chose chachinsache.” <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Nombejo ŵanyenjekwe ni achikulugwe, ŵatite, “Mumbeje panopano ntwe u che Yohana Ŵakubatisya mumbale.” <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Mwenye ŵasupwiche, nambo kwa ligongo lya kulumbila kwao ni ligongo lya achalendo ŵaŵatemi pamo nawo, ŵalajisye apegwe. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Nipele, che Helode ŵannajisye mundu ku nyuumba ja kutaŵila ŵandu kuti ŵakate che Yohana ntwe. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Ntwe wakwe wajigalikwe mu mbale ni kumpa mwali, nombejo ŵampele achikulugwe. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵa che Yohana ŵaiche, ŵachijigele chiilu chakwe, ŵachisichile. Nipele ŵajawile kukwasalila Che Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwapa chakulya ŵandu elufu tano.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Che Yesu paŵapilikene ngani syo, ŵatyosile pepala kwa ngalaŵa, ŵajawile pantemela pajikape. Nambo ŵandu paŵapilikene, ŵakuiye kwa makongolo achityochelaga mmisi jao. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Nipele, paŵaiche kumbwani, ŵauweni mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵandu, ŵakolele chanasa ni ŵalamisye ŵakulwala ŵao.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Pakwaswele, ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaichilile ni kwasalila, “Apano patuli pa mwikonde ni sambano kuswele. Sambano, mwalanje ŵandu wo kuti ajaule mmisinda akalisumile chakulya.” <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Nganakola ligongo lya kwaula, ŵanyamwe mwape chakulya.” <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Nambo ŵanyawo ŵanjanjile, “Tukwete mikate nsano pe ni somba siŵili.” <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Njise nawo apano.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Ŵaasalile ŵandu kuti atame paasi pa manyasi. Nipele, Che Yesu ŵajigele mikate nsano ni somba sila, ŵalolite kwinani, ŵatogolele Akunnungu ni kugaŵanya ni kwapa ŵakulijiganya mikate jo, nombewo ŵagaŵenye ŵandu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Ŵalile wose, ŵajikwite. Nipele ŵakulijiganya ŵalokwete sigasi sya mikate jila, ŵagumbesye itundu kumi na mbili. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Wose ŵaŵalile ŵala ŵaliji achalume mpela elufu tano, pangaŵalanjikwa achimmasyeto ni ŵanache.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwenda mmeesi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliko 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Pangakaŵa, Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao akwele mu ngalaŵa kuti alongolele peesi litanda asyene aninkujilanga mipingo ja ŵandu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Paŵamasile kwalanga ŵandu, ŵakwesile kwitumbi ali jikape kukupopela. Pakwaswele, ŵelewo ŵaliji kweleko jikape. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Kele katema ko ngalaŵa jo jaŵandichile pambindikati litanda, nambo jaliji nkupungunyikwa kwannope ni matumbela pakuŵa mbungo jaliji nkujiputa. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Kumasikusiku, Che Yesu ŵaichile ŵakulijiganya ŵao achendaga mmeesi. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵao paŵaweni achendaga mmeesi, ŵajogwepe nnope ni ŵatite, “Lili lilaika!” Ŵagumilangaga kwa woga. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Papopo, Che Yesu ŵasalile, “Muusimane ntima, ndili une, nkajogopa!” <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Che Petulo ŵatite, “Ambuje mwaŵaga mmwe, muusalile iche kukwenu njendaga mmeesi.” <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Che Yesu ŵatite, “Njise.” Nipele che Petulo ŵatulwiche mu ngalaŵa, ŵajesile mmeesi, kwajaulila Che Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Nambo paŵajiweni mbungo, ŵajogwepe ni ŵatandite kutiŵila, ŵagumisile achitiji, “Ambuje mungulupusye!” <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Papopo Che Yesu ŵagolwesye nkono wao, ŵankamwile ni ŵansalile, “Mmwe ŵa chikulupi chachinandi, ligongo chi nkukola lipamba?” <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Nipele, wose ŵakwesile mu ngalaŵa, ni mbungo jatulele. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Nombe, wose ŵaŵaliji mu ngalaŵa ŵatindiŵalile ni kwakotamila, achitiji, “Isyene alakwe ndi Mwana jwa Akunnungu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwalamya ŵakulwala ku msinda wa ku Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maliko 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Ŵajombweche litanda ni ŵaiche ku msinda wa ku Genesaleti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Ŵandu ŵa pepala paŵaamanyi Che Yesu, ŵajenesye ngani muumbali mose mumwasyungwile. Nipele, ŵannyichisye ŵakulwala wose, <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />ni ŵachondelele kuti akwaye atamuno lujenje lya mwinjilo ŵao. Nombe wose ŵaŵankwaiye ŵalamile.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Majiganyo ga achambuje</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maliko 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Nipele, Mafalisayo ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ŵaichile Che Yesu kutyochela ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />Paŵaiche ŵambusisye, “Kwachichi ŵakulijiganya wenu akugapwanya majiganyo gatupochele kutyochela kwa achambuje ŵetu? Ngakunaŵa makono yambone akanaŵe kutanda kulya?” <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Kwachichi ŵanyamwe mkupwanya makanyo ga Akunnungu kwa kusechelela majiganyo genu mwachinsyene? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Akunnungu atite, ‘Mwachimbichisye atati ŵenu ni achikulu ŵenu,’ ni ‘Jwakunlwesya atatigwe atamuno achikulugwe, akusachilwa kuulajikwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Nambo ŵanyamwe nkwiganya kuti, mundu aŵaga ni chindu cha kwakamuchisya atatigwe atamuno achikulugwe, ni atiji, ‘Achi chindu chi ndyosisye sadaka kwa Akunnungu.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />Nipele, jwele mundu jo ngakwachimbichisya atatigwe! Yele ni inkuti pakulinyelusya lilamulo lya Akunnungu ni kugakuya majiganyo genu mwachinsyene. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Ŵanyamwe ŵaulamba! Che Isaya jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu ŵasagamukwile yambone yankati ŵanyamwe paŵatite,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‘Akunnungu akuti, aŵa ŵandu ŵa akunjimbichisyanga ni ngomo pe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">nambo mmitima jao atalikengene ni une.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Nombe akumbopela iyiyipe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">pakuŵa indu yakwiganya ili malajisyo ga ŵandu pe.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aila yaikuntaga mundu usakwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maliko 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵauŵilasile mpingo wa ŵandu, ŵaasalile, “Mpilikane ni kumanyilila! <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Chindu chachikuntaga mundu usakwa ngaŵa chachikwinjila nkang'wa, nambo achila chachikutyoka nkang'wa ni chachikuntaga mundu usakwa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Nipele ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵajaulile ni kwasalila, “Ana nkumanyilila kuti Mafalisayo yachimile paŵapilikene maloŵe genu?” <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Nambo ŵelewo ŵatite, “Mmela wauliwose wanganapande Atati ŵangu ŵa kwinani, chiuchitupulwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Mwaleche ŵanyawo! Ŵele ali ŵangalola ŵakwalongosya ŵangalola. Jwangalola annongosyaga jwangalola njakwe, wose ŵaŵili chatumbuchile mwisimbo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Che Petulo ŵatite, “Ntugopolele chele chitagu cho.” <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Nombe ŵanyamwe ŵakwe ngankumanyilila? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Ana ngankumanyilila kuti chindu chachikwinjila nkang'wa chikupita nnutumbo ni chikujasikwa kulindi? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Nambo yaikutyoka nkang'wa ikutyochela mu ntima, yele ni yaikuntaga mundu usakwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Pakuŵa mu ntima sikukopoka ng'anisyo syangalumbana sya kuulaga ni chikululu ni chigwagwa ni wiyi ni kuŵecheta yaunami ni kutukana. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Gelego ni gakuntaga mundu usakwa. Nambo kulya panganaŵa makono ngakukuntaga mundu usakwa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chikulupi cha jwankongwe jumo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maliko 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Che Yesu ŵatyosile kweleko ni ŵajile ku chilambo cha ku Tilo ni ku Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Nipele, jwankongwe jumo Mkanaani, kutyochela chilambo chilachila, ŵaichilile achinyanyisyaga, “Ambuje, Mwana ju che Daudi, mungolele chanasa! Mwali jwangu akamwilwe ni masoka kwannope.” <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Nambo Che Yesu ngananjanga liloŵe. Ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵajaulile ni kwachondelela achitiji, “Mwasalile ajaule, pakuŵa akutukuya ali nkunyokonya.” <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Akunnungu andumile kukwakulupusya ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵaŵapotele mpela ngondolo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Pelepo jwambumba jula ŵaiche ni kwatindiŵalila paujo pao achitiji, “Ambuje, mungamuchisye.” <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ngaŵa yambone kutola chakulya cha ŵanache ni kusiponyela mbwa.” <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Jwankongwe jo ŵajanjile, “Elo, Ambuje, nambo mbwa sikulya mbakatika sisikupatuka pakulila achambuje ŵao.” <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Pelepo Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Jwankongwe, chikulupi chenu chachikulungwa, nipele, chitendekwe kukwenu chinkusaka.” Mwali jwao jula ni ŵalamile katema kakoko.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwalamya ŵandu ŵajinji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Che Yesu ŵatyosile pelepo ni kwaula mungulugulu litanda lya Galilaya, ŵakwesile kwitumbi, ŵatemi paasi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Nipele, jaichile mipingo ja ŵandu ŵajinji, ŵampelechele ŵandu ŵangajenda ni ŵangalola ni ŵakulemala ni ŵangaŵecheta ni ŵane ŵajinji ŵakulwala, nipele ŵaŵisile mmbujo mwakwe ni kwalamya. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Nombe mpingo wa ŵandu ula wasimonjile nnope paŵaweni ŵangaŵecheta aninkuŵecheta ni ŵangalola aninkulola ni ŵakulemala ali alamile ni ŵangajenda aninkwenda, ŵandu ŵaakusisye Akunnungu ŵa ku Isilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwapa chakulya ŵandu elufu nne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maliko 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Che Yesu ŵaaŵilasile ŵakulijiganya ŵao, ŵaasalile, “Ngwakolela chanasa aŵa ŵandu ŵa pakuŵa atemi ni une moŵa gatatu sambano ni nganakola chakulya. Ngangusaka naaleche ajaule pangalya ngakaŵa chakomoche mwitala.” <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵala ni ŵatite, “Tutupate kwapi chakulya chachijinji cha kwajikutisya ŵele ŵandu ŵa?” <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Che Yesu ŵaausisye, “Nkwete mikate jilingwa?” Ŵajanjile, “Saba ni tusomba kanandi pe.” <verse eid="MAT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵandu atamanje paasi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Ŵajitosile mikate saba ni tusomba tula, ŵatogolele Akunnungu, ŵajigaŵenye ni kwapa ŵakulijiganya ŵao, nombe ŵakulijiganya wo ŵagaŵenye ŵandu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Ŵalile wose, ŵajikwite. Paŵamasile kulya ŵalokotenye mbakatika ja mikate ni somba sila itundu saba yegumbale. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Ŵele uŵalile wo ŵaliji achalume elufu nne, pangaŵalanjila achakongwe ni ŵanache. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵalanjile ŵandu, ŵakwesile mu ngalaŵa ni kwaula ku chilambo cha Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Ŵandu akusaka chimanyisyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maliko 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Mafalisayo ni Masadukayo ŵaajaulile Che Yesu, ni kwa kwalinga ŵaŵendile ŵalosye chimanyisyo kutyochela kwinani. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Nambo Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Lyaikaga ligulo ŵanyamwe nkutinji, ‘Lelo chikulanguche pakuŵa kwiunde kuchejele!’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Ni kuninkucha nkutinji, ‘Lelo mbungo chijipuje, pakuŵa kwiunde kuchejele sooni maunde gagumbele!’ Nipele, ŵanyamwe nkukombola kumanyilila upagwe wa liunde, nambo imanyisyo ya katema kano ngankukombola kuimanyilila. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Uŵelesi wangalumbana ni wangali ni chikulupi ukusosa chimanyisyo, nambo ngaupegwa chimanyisyo ikaŵe chimanyisyo chi che Yona.” Nipele ŵalesile ni kwaula.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amila ja Mafalisayo ni Masadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maliko 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵao paŵamasile koombochela mbande jine ja litanda, ŵaliji aliŵalile kwigala mikate. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile kuti, “Nlilolechesye ni nligose ni amila ja Mafalisayo ni Masadukayo!” <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Nambo ŵele ŵanyawo ŵaliji nkuusyana achinsyene pe achitiji, “Akuŵecheta yeleyo pakuŵa nganitujigala mikate.” <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Che Yesu ŵasimanyilile ng'anisyo syao ni kwasalila, “Ligongo chi nkuusyana mwachinsyene pe, ŵanyamwe ŵa chikulupi chachinandi kuti nganinjigala mikate? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Ana ngankumanyilila atamuno kukumbuchila panagaŵenye mikate tano jila, kwa ŵandu elufu tano ŵala? Ana itundu ilingwa ya mbakatika imwagumbesye? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Pane mikate saba jila jiŵagaŵenye ŵandu elufu nne, ana itundu ilingwa ya mbakatika imwalokotenye? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Uli, ngankumanyilila kuti nganingunguluchilaga mikate? Nambo nlilolechesye ni amila ja Mafalisayo ni Masadukayo!” <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Pelepo ŵakulijiganya ŵaimanyilile kuti nganaŵecheta yankati amila ja mikate, nambo majiganyo ga Mafalisayo ni Masadukayo.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ali Mwana jwa Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maliko 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Che Yesu paŵaiche mmusi wa Kaisalia Filipi, ŵausisye ŵakulijiganya ŵao kuti, “Ŵandu akuti Mwana jwa Mundu ali nduni?” <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Ŵajanjile, “Ŵane akuti che Yohana Ŵakubatisya ni ŵane akuti che Elia ni ŵane akuti che Yelemia, pane jumo jwao ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu.” <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Che Yesu ŵaausisye sooni, “Nombe ŵanyamwe nkuti une ndili nduni?” <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Che Simoni Petulo ŵajanjile, “Alakwe ni Kilisito Jwakuwombola, Mwana jwa Akunnungu ŵaali ŵajumi.” <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Che Yesu ŵatite, “Nkwete upile mmwe che Simoni mwana ju che Yona, pakuŵa ngaŵa mundu jwammunukulile ngani jo, nambo Atati ŵangu ŵaali kwinani. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />None ngunsalila, mmwe ni che Petulo ni pa lwele lwala lu chindandisye mpingo wa ŵandu ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito ni machili ga chiwa ngagaika kuukombola. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />None chinampe iugulilo ya Umwenye wa kwinani, ni chachili chose chachinchitaŵe pa chilambo pano, chichiŵe chetaŵikwe kwinani ni chachili chose chachinchigopole pa chilambo pano, chichiŵe chegopolwe kwinani.” <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Nipele ŵakanyisye kwa nnope ŵakulijiganya ŵao kuti akansalila mundu kuti ŵelewo ali Kilisito.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akuŵecheta yankati kulaga ni chiwa chao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Maliko 8:31-9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Chitandile ke katema ko Che Yesu ŵatandite kwalosya pangasisika ŵakulijiganya ŵao kuti yaŵajile kwaula ku Yelusalemu ni kweleko chalagaswe ni achachekulu ni ilongola ŵa achakulu ŵambopesi ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo. Nipele chachiulagwa ni pa lyuŵa lyaatatu chasyuche. <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Pelepo che Petulo ŵaajigele Che Yesu pambali ni ŵatandite kwakalipila achitiji, “Ngwamba Ambuje! Ngagansimana gelego!” <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Nambo Che Yesu ŵagalauchile ni kwasalila che Petulo, “Ntyoche paujo pangu, Shetani! Mmwe nkusiŵila litala paujo pangu, pakuŵa ngankuganisya gagali ga Akunnungu, nambo ga ŵandu!”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao, “Mundu jwakusaka kunguya, alikane nsyene, atwichile nsalaba wakwe, anguye une. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Pakuŵa, mundu jwalijose jwakusaka kuukulupusya umi wakwe, chaujase. Nambo mundu jwakuutyosya umi wakwe kwaligongo lyangu, chaukole sooni. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Ana mundu chapate chichi akolaga chipanje cha pa chilambo, ali ajasile umi wakwe? Pane mundu chatyosye chichi pamalo pa umi wakwe? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Pakuŵa Mwana jwa Mundu chachiika mu ukulu wa Atatigwe pamo ni achikatumetume ŵakwe ŵa kwinani, pelepo chachinlipa jwalijose malinga ni masengo gao. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Ngunsalila isyene, apali ŵane mwa ŵanjimi apano ngaapasya chiwa akanaŵe kummona Mwana jwa Mundu achiikaga ali Mwenye.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akugalauka uwoneche wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maliko 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Pagamasile moŵa sita, Che Yesu ŵajigele che Petulo ni che Yakobo ni che Yohana mpwao, ŵakwesile pamo nawo penani chitumbi cheleu, kweleko ŵaliji ŵanyapewo. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Kweleko, Che Yesu ŵagalawiche uwoneche wakwe paujo pao, ku meeso kwao kwamelemendaga mpela lyuŵa ni iwalo yao yaliji yeswela mpela lulanga. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Chisisimuchile che Musa ni che Elia ŵaakopochele, ŵaliji nkukunguluka ni Che Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Pelepo che Petulo ŵaasalile Che Yesu, “Ambuje, yambone uwe kuŵa apano! Mwasakaga chindaŵe masakasa gatatu, limo lyenumwe ni line li che Musa ni line li che Elia.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Paŵaŵechetaga gelego, liunde lyeswela lyaunichile ŵanyawo, ni lyapikaniche liloŵe kutyochela mu liunde lila lichitiji, “Aju ali Mwanangu jungunnonyela, nonyelwe nawo, mumpilikanichisye jwelejo.” <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Ŵakulijiganya paŵapilikene yeleyo ŵajogwepe nnope, ŵagwile manguku. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵaichilile, ŵakwayiye achitiji, “Njimuche, nkajogopa!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Paŵalolite kwinani nganammona mundu jwalijose akaŵe Che Yesu jika pe.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Nipele, paŵatulukaga pa chitumbi po, Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Kasimunsalila mundu jwalijose inyiweni ila, mpaka patachisyuka Mwana jwa Mundu kutyochela mu chiwa.” <verse eid="MAT 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Nipele ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵammusisye, “Kwachichi nambi ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ga Akunnungu gaŵapele che Musa akuti chaiche kaje che Elia?” <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Isyene, che Elia chaiche kaje ni kukolosya indu yose iŵe chile. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Nambo ngunsalila, che Elia amasile kwika, nganammanyilila, nambo ŵantendele iŵasachile. Nombewo chachinnagasya Mwana jwa Mundu iyoyopeyo.” <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Pelepo ŵakulijiganya ŵala ŵaimanyilile kuti ŵangambaga che Yohana Ŵakubatisya.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akunnamya jwanchanda jwakamwilwe ni lisoka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maliko 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Paŵaiche sooni pa wele mpingo wa ŵandu ula, ŵaiche mundu jumo mmbujo pa Che Yesu ni kwatindiŵalila, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />ŵatite, “Ambuje, munkolele chanasa mwanangu pakuŵa akulwala njilinjili ni kulaga nnope, katema kakajinji akugwilila pa mooto pane mmeesi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Nannyichisye kwa ŵakulijiganya ŵenu, nambo nganakombola kunnamya.” <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Uŵelesi wangali chikulupi ni wakulyungasika, ana chime ni ŵanyamwe mpaka chakachi? Mpaka chakachi chinampililile? Munjise nawo apano.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵalikalipile lisoka lila, nombelyo lyankopweche ni jwanchanda jula ŵalamile katema kakoko.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Nipele, ŵakulijiganya ŵaichile Che Yesu kwa chisyepela ni kwausya, “Ligongo chi nganitukombola kulikoposya lisoka lila?” <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Kwa ligongo lya chikulupi chenu chachinandi. Ngunsalila isyene, mwaŵaga ni chikulupi atamuno chaŵaga chachinandi chisau mbeju jajinandi nnope jajikuŵilanjikwa haladali, chinkombole kuchisalila achi chitumbi chi, ‘Ntyoche apa njaule ako,’ nombecho chichityoche. Ngalipagwa liloŵe lyangalikombolecheka kukwenu.” <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Nambo lisoka lyanti yele ngalikutyosyekwa ikaŵe kwa kupopela ni kutaŵa.<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akuŵecheta sooni yankati chiwa ni kusyuka kwao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maliko 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Ŵakulijiganya paŵaliji pamo ku Galilaya, Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Mwana jwa Mundu akwaula kukutagwa mmakono ga ŵandu. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Nombewo chachimmulaga, nambo chachisyuka pa lyuŵa lyaatatu.” Pelepo ŵakulijiganya ŵasongoneche nnope.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupeleka nsongo wa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao paŵaiche ku Kapelenaumu ŵandu ŵakukumbikanya nsongo wa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ŵaichilile che Petulo, ŵausisye, “Ana jwakwiganya jwenu akulipa nsongo wa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu?” <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Che Petulo ŵajanjile, “Elo, akulipa.” Nipele, che Petulo paŵajinjile mu nyuumba, akanaŵe kuŵecheta liloŵe, Che Yesu ŵalongolele kummusya achitiji, “Che Simoni, mmwe nkuti uli? Mamwenye ŵa pa chilambo akukumbikanya nsongo atamuno ushulu kwa ŵandu chi? Kutyochela kwa achinsyene musi pane kwa achalendo?” <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Che Petulo ŵajanjile, “Kutyochela kwa achalendo.” Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Nipele, iŵaga ili yeleyo, achinsyene musi wo ngakusachilwa kulipa. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Nambo tukaachima ŵandu ŵa. Njaule kulitanda nkaloposye, ni somba jandanda kutanjila pa ndowana, nkajiunukule kang'wa ni chinkasisimane mbiya sya nsongo. Njigale ni kwapa ligongo lyangune ni lyenu mmwe.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Nduni jwaali jwankulungwa?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maliko 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Kekala katema kala ŵakulijiganya ŵaichilile Che Yesu ni kwausya, “Ana nduni jwaali jwankulungwa mu Umwenye wa kwinani?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Che Yesu ŵambilasile mwanache, ŵanjimiche mmbujo mwao. <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />Nipele ŵatite, “Isyene ngunsalila, iŵaga ngankugalauka ni kuŵa mpela ŵanache, nganjinjila kose mu umwenye wa kwinani. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Nipele jwalijose jwakulitimalika mpela aju mwanache ju, jwelejo ni jwali jwankulungwa mu umwenye wa kwinani. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Jwalijose jwakumpochela mwanache jumo mpela aju mu liina lyangu, jwelejo akumbochela une.”<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwatenda ŵane atende sambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maliko 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Nambo jwalijose juchantende jumo jwa achanandi ŵa, ŵakungulupilila une atende sambi, ikaliji yambone kwa ŵelewo ataŵikwe pa lukosi liganga lyekulungwa lya kusyajila ni kumponya mu bahali pakwendesya nnope.<figure style="fig" file="01 Millstone.jpg" size="col" ref="18:6">Ŵandu ŵaŵili ŵakutumia liganga lyekulungwa lya kusyajila mbeju</figure> <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Ulaje chiuŵe kwa ŵandu ŵa pa chilambo kwa ligongo lya kuichisya indu ya kwatenda ŵandu atende sambi. Indu yo ikusachilwa ikopochele nambo ulaje kukwakwe mundu juchaichenawo indu yo.<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />“Iŵaga nkono wenu pane lukongolo lwenu lukuntenda ntende sambi, mmukate nkaujase kwakutalika. Mmbaya kukwenu kwinjila mu umi pangali nkono umo pane lukongolo lumo kupunda kuponyekwa pa mooto wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi wangasimika ndi ni makono gaŵili ni makongolo gaŵili. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Ni liso lyenu lyantendaga ntende sambi, nlikolopole ni kuliponya kwakutalika. Mmbaya kukwenu kwinjila mu umi wangamala ni liso limo, kupunda kuponyekwa pa mooto wangasimika moŵa gose pangali mbesi ndi ni meeso gaŵili.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha ngondolo jajisochele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:3-7">Maliko 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Nlilolechesye! Nkanchembulusya jumo jwa achanandi ŵa. Ngunsalila, achikatumetume ŵao kwinani ko moŵa gose akulola usyo wa Atati ŵaali kwinani. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Pakuŵa Mwana jwa Mundu ŵaiche kukwakulupusya aŵala ŵaŵasochele.<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Ana ŵanyamwe nkuti uli, Mundu akolaga ngondolo mia moja, ni jasochelaga ngondolo jimo, ngaasileka ngondolo tisini na tisa sila pasyaliji po ni kwaula kukujisosa jajisochele jila? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Ajisimanaga, ngunsalila isyene, akusengwa ligongo lya jejila kusipunda tisini na tisa syangasochela sila. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Iyoyo Atati ŵenu ŵa kwinani ngakusaka ata jumo jwa achanandi ŵa kuti asochele.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunjamuka nlongo jwakutenda sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Nlongo njenu anleŵelaga, munjaulile nkanlosye chileŵo chakwe nli ŵaŵili pe. Ampilikanilaga chimme mumpatile nlongo njenu. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Nambo iŵaga ngakumpilikanila, munjigale mundu jumo pane ŵaŵili pakuti kwa kang'wa sya ŵaumboni ŵaŵili pane ŵatatu, kila liloŵe likaluche, mpela Malembelo ga Akunnungu yagakuti pakusala. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Akanaga kwapilikanichisya ŵanyawo, muusalile mpingo wa ŵandu ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito. Ni akanaga kuupilikanila mpingo wa ŵandu ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito, mummalanjile yalumo mundu jwangakwamanyilila Akunnungu ni jwakukumbikanya nsongo.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukanya ni kukunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Ngunsalila isyene, gagali gose gachingakanye pachilambo chigaŵe gamakanikwe kwinani ni gagali gose gachingakunde pachilambo, chigaŵe gamakundikwe kwinani.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Ngunsalila isyene, ŵaŵili pasikati jenu ajilanaga pachilambo pano kwa chindu chachilichose chichaŵende, Atati ŵangu ŵa kwinani chiŵapanganyichisye chindu cho. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Pakuŵa palipose pakusongangana ŵandu ŵaŵili pane ŵatatu pamo kwa liina lyangu, une ndili pelepo ni ŵanyawo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha jwakutumichila jwangalechelesya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Nipele, che Petulo ŵaichile Che Yesu nikuti, “Ambuje, ana mpwanga aneŵele kalingwa none naalechelesye? Mala saba?” <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ngangunsalila mala saba pe, nambo saba mala sabini. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Kwayele, Umwenye wa kwinani ulandene ni mwenye jumo juŵasakaga kulola achikapolo ŵakwe yatite pakupanganya. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Paŵatandite kulola, ŵannyichisye mundu jumo juŵaliji ni ligambo lya mamilioni kwa mamilioni. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Mundu jo nganakola chakulipa, kwayele ambujegwe ŵalamwile asumisikwe nti kapolo mundu jula ni ŵankwakwe ni achiŵanagwe ni yanayose iŵakwete, kuti ligambo limale. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Nipele, kapolo jula ŵatindiŵele mmbujo pa ambujegwe ni kwaŵenda achitiji, ‘Ambuje mumbililile kaje, none chinanlipe yose.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Mmbujegwe kapolo jula ŵankolele chanasa, ŵannechelesye ligambo lila, ni kuntendela ajaule.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Nambo kapolo jula ŵatyosile, ŵansimene jumo jwa achikapolo achinjakwe juŵandaiji mbiya kanandi. Ŵankamwile ni kunkamula pa lukosi achitiji, ‘Nlipe ligambo lyenu!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Nombe kapolo njakwe jula ŵatindiŵele pa makongolo gakwe ŵanchondelele achitiji, ‘Mumbililile kaje, none chinanlipe yose’. <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Nombejo ŵakanile, ŵajawile kukumponya mu nyuumba jakutaŵilwa, mpaka patachilipa ligambo lila.<verse eid="MAT 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />“Nipele, achikapolo achinjakwe paŵaiweni yeleyo ŵasongoneche nnope, ŵajawile kukwasalila ambuje ŵao yose iyatendekwe. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Pele ambujegwe ŵammilasile ni kunsalila, ‘Ugwe jwakutumichila jwangalumbana nnope! Nannechelesye ligambo lila lyose pamwanjondelele. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Ana nganinsachilwa kunkolela chanasa kapolo njenu jo mpela inatite pakunkolela chanasa mmwe?’<verse eid="MAT 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />“Nipele mmbujegwe jula ŵatumbile nnope, ŵampeleche katumetume jula kwa ŵakulagasya mpaka pele patachilipa ligambo lyose. <verse eid="MAT 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Ni atati ŵangu ŵa kwinani chachintendela iyoyo peyo iŵaga jwalijose mwa ŵanyamwe ngannechelesya mpwakwe ni mtima wakwe wose.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Makanyo gankati kulekangana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maliko 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Che Yesu paŵamasile kuŵecheta gele maloŵe go, ŵatyosile ku Galilaya, ŵapite ku Yudea peesi lusulo lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Ŵandu achajinji ŵakuiye ŵelewo kweleko, nombejo ŵalamisye ilwele yao.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Mafalisayo ŵaichile achalingaga achitiji, “Uli, ana ikusachilwa mundu kunleka ŵankwakwe kwa ligongo lililyose?” <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Uli, ana nganinsyoma Mmalembelo ga Akunnungu kuti Akunnungu juŵangumbile mundu kutyochela kundanda ŵaagumbile jwannume ni jwankongwe? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Ŵapundile kusala, ‘Kwaligongo lyo jwannume chiŵaaleche atatigwe ni achikulugwe, chalumbikane ni ŵankwakwe, nombe ŵaŵili wo chachiŵa chiilu chimo?’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Kwa yeleyo, ngaaŵa sooni ŵaŵili, nambo chiilu chimo. Nipele chalumbikenye Akunnungu, mundu akachilekanganya.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Nambo ŵele ŵanyawo ŵausisye, “Nambi kwachichi che Musa ŵatulamwile kuti jwankongwe apegwe talaka ni kunleka?” <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Che Musa ŵannechelele nlekangane ni achiŵankwenu kwa ligongo lya kukakatima kwa mitima jenu. Nambo chitandile kundanda nginiŵa yeleyi. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Nipele none ngunsalila ŵanyamwe, mundu juchalekangane ni ŵankwakwe kwaligongo lililyose ni kulombela jwankongwe jwine, ikaŵe kwa ligongo lya chikululu, akutenda chikululu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaasalile, “Iŵaga yele kwa mundu ni ŵankwakwe, nipele mmbaya kutama pangalombela.” <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ngaŵa ŵanawose ŵakukombola kulipochela liloŵe li, nambo ikaŵe ŵele ŵandu ŵapegwile ni Akunnungu machili ga kulipochela liloŵe li. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Pakuŵa kwana indu yakupisyangana yaikuntendekasya mundu kutama pangalombela, apali ŵaŵaŵelekwe yeleyo, ni ŵane atesilwe ni ŵandu atame ŵangalombela ni ŵane asachile achinsyene atame pangalombela kwaligongo lya umwenye wa kwinani. Jwakukombola kulipochela liloŵe li apochele.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwapa upile ŵanache achanandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maliko 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Nipele ŵannyichisye Che Yesu ŵanache achanandi kuti ŵasajichile makono ni kwapopelela. Nambo ŵakulijiganya ŵao ni ŵakalipile. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Che Yesu ŵatite, “Mwaleche ŵanache aichanje kukwangu ni nkaasiŵila, pakuŵa Umwenye wa kwinani uli wa ŵandu ŵaali mpela ŵanache ŵa.” <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Nipele, ŵasajichile makono kuti ŵape upile, ni ŵatyosile pelepo.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jwanchanda jwa kusichila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maliko 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Mundu jumo ŵaichile Che Yesu ŵausisye, “Jwakwiganya, ana ndende chindu chi chichili chambone kuti ngapate umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi?” <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Kwachichi nkuusya yankati umbone? Ngapagwa jwambone, nambo jumope yaani Akunnungu. Mwasakaga kwinjila mu umi, ngakamulichisye makanyo.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Mundu jula ŵausisye, “Makanyo chi?” Che Yesu ŵatite, “Kasimmulaga ni Kasintenda chikululu ni Kasinjiŵa ni Kasinsala ya unami. <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />Sooni, mwachimbichisye atati ŵenu ni achikulu ŵenu ni Munnonyele njenu mpela inkuti pakulinonyela mwasyene.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Jwanchanda jula ŵatite, “Makanyo ganagose nagakamulisye chitandile wanache wangu, chisoŵile chindu chi sooni?” <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Che Yesu ŵansalile jwelejo, “Mwasakaga kuŵa jwautindimisyo, njaule nkasumisye yose inkwete ni mbiya syo nkaape ŵandu ŵakulaga, nomwe chinkole mbiko kwinani, mwamalaga muunguye.” <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Paŵapilikene yele jwele nchanda jo, ŵajawile aninkusongoneka mu ntima, pakuŵa ŵakwete chipanje chachijinji.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Pelepo Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao, “Ngunsalila isyene, chiiŵe yakulimba jwachipanje kwinjila mu Umwenye wa kwinani. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Ngunsalila sooni, ili yakwaluka kwa chinyama chachikuŵilanjikwa ngamia kupeleta pachipowo cha sindano, kupunda jwachipanje kwinjila mu umwenye wa Akunnungu.” <verse eid="MAT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵao paŵapilikene yele, ŵasimosile nnope, ŵausisye, “Ŵaani nambi, akukombola kukulupuka?” <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Che Yesu ŵalolite, nikuti, “Lyeleli lili lyangakomboleka kwa ŵandu, nambo kwa Akunnungu indu yose ikukomboleka.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Nipele, che Petulo ŵajanjile, “Nnole, uwe tulesile yose ni kunkuya, chitupate chichi nambi?” <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Ngunsalila isyene, Mwana jwa Mundu pachatame pa chitengu cha umwenye cha ukulu wao mu chilambo cha sambano, ŵanyamwe umunguiye chintame mu itengu kumi na mbili ni kusilamula ngosyo kumi na mbili sya ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Ni jwalijose jwalesile nyuumba pane achapwakwe pane achalumbugwe pane atatigwe pane achikulugwe pane ŵanache pane migunda, kwa ligongo lyangu, chachipochela mala mia, ni chachinjila mu umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Nambo ŵajinji ŵaali ŵandanda sambano chachiŵa ŵambesi ni ŵaali ŵambesi sambano chachiŵa ŵandanda.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Ŵamasengo mu ngunda wa sabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Umwenye wa kwinani ulandene ni mundu jwaali ni ngunda wa sabibu, juŵatyosile kundaŵi pe kukwaŵika ŵandu ŵakulima mu ngunda wao. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Paŵamasile kulangana ni ŵakulima kuti chachalipa chipande chimo cha madini ga feza malinga ni malipilo ga lyuŵa limo, ŵapeleche ku ngunda wa sabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Ŵatyosile saa tatu kundaŵi, ŵaweni ŵane ŵangali ni masengo ali ajimi pakusumichisya malonda. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Ŵaasalile, ‘Njende ni ŵanyamwe ku ngunda wa sabibu, none chinanlipe.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Nipele, ŵapite. Asyene ngunda ŵala ŵatyosile sooni saa sita ni saa tisa, ŵatesile iyoyo. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Pajaŵandichile saa kumi na moja, ŵatyosile sooni, ŵasimene ŵandu ŵane ali ajimi papopo pakusumisya malonda. Nipele ŵausisye, ‘Kwachichi nkwima apano muusi wose u pangali masengo?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Ŵajanjile, ‘Pakuŵa ngapagwa mundu jwatupele masengo.’ Nombejo ŵaasalile, ‘Njaule ni ŵanyamwe nkapanganye masengo ku ngunda wa sabibu.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Pakwaswele, nsyene ngunda wa sabibu jula ŵansalile jwakulolela masengo gao kuti, ‘Nkaaŵilanje ŵamasengo mwape malipilo gao, kutandila ŵa kumbesi mpaka ŵa kundanda.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Nipele, ŵaiche ŵele ŵaŵapegwilwe masengo katema ka saa kumi na moja, jwalijose ŵapochele chipande chimo cha madini ga feza. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Ni ŵandanda ŵala paŵaiche ŵaganichisye kuti chapochele yakupunda, nambo nombe ŵanyawo ŵapochele chipande chimo cha madini ga feza yalumo ni achinjao. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Paŵapochele mbiya syao, ŵatandite kwasongonechela asyene ngunda ŵala. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Ŵatite, ‘Aŵaŵa ŵaŵapele masengo kumbesi apangenye masengo kwa katema ka lisaa limo pe, kwachichi ntulipile yalumo ni ŵanyaŵa akuno uweji tupililile masengo gakulimba muusi wose ni lyuŵa lili nkuŵala?’<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />“Pelepo nsyene ngunda jula ŵanjanjile jumo jwao kuti, ‘Ambusanga, ngangummonela! Ana nganitulangana none kwa malipilo ga chipande chimo cha madini ga feza? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Njigale chichili chenu, njaule kumangwenu. Ngunonyelwa kumpa aju junampele masengo kumbesi yalumo ni mmwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Uli, ngangusachilwa kutenda indu ingunonyelwa nkati yose ingwete? Ana nkukola wiwu pakuŵa une ndili jwambone?’ ”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵamalichisye kwa kusala, “Iyoyo ŵaali ŵambesi chachiŵa ŵandanda ni ŵaali ŵandanda chachiŵa ŵambesi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akuŵecheta kaatatu nkati chiwa chao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maliko 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Che Yesu paŵaliji nkukwela kwaula ku Yelusalemu, ŵaajigele ŵakulijiganya ŵao kumi na mbili, paŵaliji nkwenda mwitala, peuto pangali ŵandu ŵane, ŵaasalile, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Nnole! Tukwaula ku Yelusalemu, ni kwele Mwana jwa Mundu chakatajikwe mmakono mwa achakulu ŵambopesi ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo, nombewo chalamulikwe aulajikwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Chakampeleche kwa ŵandu ŵangaŵa Ŵayahudi apate kuntendela chanache ni kumputa mbokola ni kwaŵamba pa nsalaba ni pa lyuŵa lyaatatu chachisyuka.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuŵenda kwa achikulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maliko 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Nipele achikulu ŵa ŵanache ŵa che Sebedayo ŵaichile Che Yesu, pamo ni achiŵanagwe, ŵatindiŵalile ni kwaŵenda chindu. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Che Yesu ŵammusisye, “Chichi nkusaka?” Ŵatite, “Choonde nlanje kuti mu umwenye wenu, achiŵanangu ŵaŵili ŵa chatame, jumo kundyo kwenu ni jwine kunchiji kwenu.” <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ana nkumanyilila chinkuchiŵenda! Uli chinkombole kuching'welela chikombe cha masauko chiching'wele une?” Ŵanyawo ŵajanjile, “Tukupakombola.” <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Isyene chinng'welele chikombe changu cha masauko, nambo kutama kundyo ni kunchiji kwangu nganigaŵa masengo gangu nambo Akunnungu chachapa lipesa lyo ŵele ŵaŵakolochesye.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Nombe ŵakulijiganya ŵane likumi ŵala paŵapilikene gele, ŵatumbilile ŵaŵili wo. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵaaŵilasile ni kwasalila, “Nkumanyilila kuti mamwenye ŵa ilambo akwalongosya ŵandu ŵao kwa machili, ni achakulu ŵao akwatenda ali ŵandu ŵao. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Nambo inaŵe yele kukwenu, nambo jwalijose jwakusaka kuŵa jwamkulungwa kukwenu akusachilwa aŵe katumetume jwa wose. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Ni jwalijose jwakusaka kuŵa jwaandanda kukwenu akusachilwa aŵe jwakutumichila jwenu. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Iyoyopeyo, Mwana jwa Mundu nganaika kuti atumichilwe nambo kuti atumichile, ni kuutyosya umi wakwe kuti gaŵe malipilo kwa ligongo lya chiwombolo cha ŵandu ŵajinji.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwalamya ŵangalola ŵaŵili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maliko 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao paŵaliji nkutyoka ku Yeliko, mpingo wa ŵandu ŵaliji nkwakuya. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Nipele, ŵapali ŵangalola ŵaŵili uŵatemi mungulugulu litala, nombewo paŵapikene kuti Che Yesu ŵaliji nkupita pelepo, ŵanyanyisye achitiji, “Ambuje, Mwana ju che Daudi, choonde ntukolele chanasa!” <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Mpingo wa ŵandu wakalipile ni kwasalila amyalale. Nambo ŵanyawo ŵapundangenye kunyanyisya, achitiji, “Ambuje, Mwana ju che Daudi, choonde ntukolele chanasa!” <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Che Yesu ŵajimi, ŵaaŵilasile ni kwausya, “Ana nkusaka nampanganyichisye ichichi?” <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Ŵajanjile, “Ambuje, tukummenda gaunukuche meeso getu.” <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵakolele chanasa, ŵakwaiye meeso gao ni papopo ŵakombwele kulola, ni ŵankuiye.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwinjila ku Yelusalemu kwa kusangalala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Che Yesu pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaŵandichile ku Yelusalemu, ni paŵaiche ku Besefage pachikwesya cha Miseituni, ŵatumile ŵakulijiganya ŵaŵili. <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />Ŵaasalile, “Njaule kunsinda wauli mmbujo mwenu, ni kweleko chinkajisimane mbunda jajitaŵikwe ni mwanambunda pamo najo. Nkaagopole njise nawo kwangune. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Iŵaga chakammusye mundu ligongo lya kwagopola, nkajile, ‘Ambuje akusisaka,’ ni pangakaŵa chakannechele.” <verse eid="MAT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Ali lyatendekwe kuti gamalile gaŵaŵechete jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu.<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Mwasalile ŵandu ŵa musi wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Nnole, Mwenye jwenu akunnyichilila!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Atulele, ni akwesile mbunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">ni mwanambunda, chinyama chachikujigala itutule.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵala ŵajawile, ŵatesile mpela iŵatite pakusalilwa ni Che Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Ŵajiichenawo mbunda ni mwanambunda, ŵatandiche nguo syao pachanya pawo ni Che Yesu ŵatemi pachanya pakwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Mpingo wekulungwa wa ŵandu watandiche nguo syao mwitala, ni ŵane ŵakatile nyambi sya mwana sya itela ni ŵatandiche mwitala. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Mipingo ja ŵandu ŵaŵalongolele ni ŵaŵakuiye ŵanyanyisye achitiji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">“Ajinichilwe Mwana ju che Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Akole upile jwele jwakwika mu liina lya Ambuje!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Ajinichilwe Akunnungu ŵaali kwinani!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Che Yesu paŵajinjilaga ku Yelusalemu, ŵandu ŵa musi wose ŵaliji jugulijuguli. Ŵandu ŵaliji nkuusyana, “Ana aju ali nduni?” <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Ŵandu mu mpingo ula ŵatite, “Ŵeleŵa ni Che Yesu, jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu kutyochela ku Nasaleti musi wa ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maliko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵajinjile mu lutenje lwa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ŵaaŵinjile ŵanawose uŵasumisyaga ni kusuma malonda pepala, ŵapitikwisye mesa sya ŵaŵasumanyaga mbiya, ni itengu yao ŵaŵasumisyaga nguunda. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Ŵaasalile, “Ilembekwe Mmalembelo ga Akunnungu, ‘Nyuumba jangu chijiŵilanjikwe nyuumba ja kupopelela.’ Nambo ŵanyamwe njitesile peuto pakulisisila ŵa wiyi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Ŵangalola ni ŵakulemala ŵanjaulile pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, nombe Che Yesu ŵalamisye. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Achakulu ŵambopesi ni ŵakwiganya Malajisyo paŵaiweni indu yambone nnope iŵaitesile Che Yesu ni ŵanache ali nkunyanyisya pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu achitiji, “Ajinichilwe Mwana ju che Daudi,” ŵanyawo ŵatumbile. <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Ŵausisye, “Uli ngankupilikana yakuti ŵanache?” Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Elo, ngupikana! Ana nganinsyome Maloŵe ga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:16">‘Kutyochela nkang'wa sya ŵanache achanandi ni ŵakonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:16">nlipatile lumbili lwemalilwe.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Nipele, ŵalesile, ŵakopweche mmusi ni kwaula ku Besania ni kugona kweleko.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akuulwesya nkuju</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maliko 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Kundaŵi, Che Yesu paŵaujaga kwaula ku Yelusalemu, jakwete sala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Ŵauweni ntini mungulugulu litala, ŵaujaulile, nambo nganachisimana chindu mwelemo, ŵausimene uli masamba pe. Ŵausalile, “Nkasogola isogosi sooni moŵa gose pangali mbesi!” Papopo nkuju wo wanyasile. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Ŵakulijiganya paŵauweni, ŵasimosile, ŵaliusisye, “Ntini u ujumwile chinauli chitema kwantinyi?” <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ngunsalila isyene, mwaŵaga ni chikulupi pangali lipamba lili lyose, chinkombole kupanganya ngaŵa yeleyo pe yaitendekwe mu chitela cha ntini, nambo atamuno mwachisalilaga achi chitumbi chi, ‘Ntupuche ni kuliponya mu bahali,’ chiitendekwe iyoyo. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Mwakolaga chikulupi, chachilichose chachimmende nkupopela, chimpate.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liusyo lyankati ukombole u Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maliko 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Che Yesu ŵajinjile pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ni kwiganya. Paŵajiganyaga, achakulu ŵa mbopesi ni achakulu ŵane ŵa ŵandu ŵausisye kuti, “Ana kwa ukombole chi nkutenda yele indu yi? Ŵaani ŵampele wele ukombole u?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “None chinammusye liusyo limo pe, mwanyangaga, nipele, none chinansalile kwa ukombole chi nguitenda indu yi. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Uli ukombole u che Yohana wa kubatisya watyochele kwapi? Watyochele kwinani pane kwa ŵandu?” Nambo ŵaŵechetesyene achinsyene pe achitiji, “Twajilaga, ‘Watyosile kwinani,’ chatuusye, ‘Nambi kwachichi nganimunkulupilila?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Nambo twajilaga, ‘Watyochele kwa ŵandu,’ tukogopa mpingo wa ŵandu pakuŵa ŵanawose akwitichisya kuti che Yohana ali jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Nipele, ŵajanjile, “Ngatukumanyilila!” Nombe Che Yesu ŵatite, “Atamuno une ngangunsalila ŵanyamwe kwa ukombole chi nguitenda indu yi.<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha achachanda ŵaŵili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Ŵanyamwe nkuganisya uli? Mundu jumo ŵakwete achachanda ŵaŵili. Ŵantendele jwaandanda jo kuti, ‘Mwanangu, lelo njaule nkapanganye masengo mungunda wa sabibu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Nchanda jo ŵajanjile, ‘Ngangusaka!’ Nambo kanyuma kakwe ŵapitikwiche ntima, ŵajawile kupanganya masengo. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Atati ŵala ŵanjaulile mwanagwe jwaaŵili jo ni kunsalila ilaila, nombe ŵajanjile ŵatite, ‘Elo, atati!’ Nambo nganajaula kumasengo. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Ana jwapi jwa ŵele ŵaŵili wo jwatesile yakuisaka atatigwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Ŵajanjile, “Jwanchanda jwaandanda jo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Che Yesu ŵatite, “Ngunsalila isyene, ŵakukumbikanya nsongo ni ŵakulaŵalaŵa chajinjile mu Umwenye wa Akunnungu nkanaŵe kwinjila. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Pakuŵa che Yohana ŵaiche kukwenu ni kunnanjila kutama yambone nti yakuti pakusaka Akunnungu, ni ŵanyamwe nganimunkulupilila, nambo ŵakukumbikanya nsongo ni ŵakulaŵalaŵa ŵankulupilile. Ni ŵanyamwe pammasile kugawona gele nganinleka sambi ni kunkulupilila.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha ngunda wa misabibu ni ŵakwasima ngunda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maliko 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Che Yesu ŵatite, “Mpilikanile chitagu chine. Jwapali mundu jumo nsyene nyuumba ŵalimile ngunda wa sabibu, ŵausyunguchisye lutenje ni ŵakolosisye pakuminyila sabibu, ŵataŵile chilindo mmomopemo. Nipele ŵaujasimisye kwa ŵakulima ni kwaula ku chilambo cha kutalika. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Katema ka kugungula, ŵatumile achikapolo ŵao kwa ŵakulima ŵala, kuti akajigale liunjili lyakwe lya magungulo. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Ŵakulima ŵala ŵakamwile achikapolo ŵao, jumo ŵamputile, ni jwine ŵammuleje, ni jwine ŵamponyile maganga. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Sooni ŵatumile achikapolo ŵane ŵajinji kupunda ŵa kundanda. Ŵakulima ŵala ŵajasime ngunda ŵatendele ilaila. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Kumbesi kwakwe ŵantumile mwanagwe achiganisyaga mu ntima wakwe achitiji, ‘Chakanchimbichisye mwanangu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Nambo ŵakulima ŵala paŵammweni mwanagwao ŵaŵechetesyene achinsyene pe, ‘Aju ni juchapochele iŵagosele, twende tummulaje kuti indu iŵagosele tujigale uwe!’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Nipele, ŵankamwile, ŵantyosisye paasa ngunda wa sabibu, ŵammuleje.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />“Sambano, nsyene ngunda wa sabibu jula pachachiika, chachatenda ichichi ŵakulima ŵala?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Ŵanyawo ŵajanjile, “Chachajonanga wamba ŵele ŵachigongomalo wo ni ngunda wa sabibu ula chachiujasimisya kwa ŵakulima ŵane uchachapa liunjili lyakwe lya magungulo kwa katema kakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Pelepo Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Uli ana nganinsyome lye liloŵe li Mmalembelo ga Akunnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Liganga liŵalikanile ŵakutaŵa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">sambano lilyolyo lili lyetendekwe liganga lyalikusachilwa kwannope kugapunda maganga gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Ambuje ni ŵatesile achi chindu chi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">nombe chili chakusimonjeka nnope kwetuwe!’<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />“Kwayele ngunsalila, Umwenye wa Akunnungu chiutyosekwe kukwenu, ni kupegwa ŵandu ŵakupanganya yakuisaka Akunnungu.” <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Jwalijose juchagwilile pa liganga lyo chakasiche ipande ipande, ni jwalijose juchilyagwilile, chilinkanyatekanyate.<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Achakulu ŵa mbopesi ni Mafalisayo paŵapilikene itagu yao, ŵamanyilile kuti ŵaliji nkwagamba ŵanyawo. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Nipele ŵasosaga litala lya kwakamula, nambo ŵajogwepe ŵandu pakuŵa ŵanyawo ŵanganisisye nti jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Chindimba cha chakulya cha ulombela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Che Yesu ŵaŵechetenawo sooni kwa itagu achitiji, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Umwenye wa kwinani ulandene ni mwenye jumpepe juŵantendele mwanagwe chindimba cha chakulya cha ulombela. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Nipele ŵatumile achikapolo ŵao kukwaŵilanga ŵaalaliche kwika ku ulombela, nambo ŵakanile kwika. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Ŵaatumile sooni achikapolo ŵane, achitiji, ‘Mwasalile ŵalalichikwe ŵala kuti, jwammale kolosya yakulya yangu, sikite ng'ombe jangu ja nkambaku ni ng'ombe sine syakunakana, inayose ili chile, njise ku ulombela.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Nambo ŵandu ŵala ŵakanile kwika, ŵajawile, jumo ku ngunda wakwe, ni jwine ku masengo gakwe, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />ni ŵane ŵaakamwile achikapolo ŵala ŵaputile ni ŵane kwaulaga. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Mwenye jula ŵatumbile, ŵaatumile ŵandu ŵangondo ŵao kuti akaaulaje ŵakuulaga ŵala ni kuchoma mooto musi wao. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Nipele ŵaasalile achikapolo ŵao, ‘Ulombela uli chile, nambo unalaliche ŵala nganaŵajilwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Nipele njaule mmalekano ni ŵanawose uchinkaasimane, nkaaŵilanje aichanje ku chindimba cha chakulya cha ulombela.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Achikapolo ŵao ŵala ŵatyosile, ŵajawile mmatala, ŵaichenawo wose uŵasimene nawo, ŵangalumbana ni ŵambone. Nyuumba ja ulombela jagumbele achalendo.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Nambo paŵajinjile mwenye ku kwalola achalendo, ŵammweni mundu jumo jwanganatakula nguo sya ulombela. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Mwenye ŵammusisye, ‘Ambusanga, njinjile chinauli, nomwe nganinkola nguo sya ulombela?’ Nambo ŵelewo ŵamyalele. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Nipele, mwenye ŵaasalile achikatumetume ŵao, ‘Muntaŵe makongolo ni makono, mkamponye paasa ku chipi, kweleko chakalile ni kuchilimya meeno.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Che Yesu ŵamalichisye achitiji, “Ŵajinji ŵakuŵilanjikwa, nambo ŵasagulikwe nganatupa.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkati kulipa nsongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maliko 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Nipele, Mafalisayo ŵajawile, ŵajilene itajile pa kwatanjisya Che Yesu kwa maloŵe gao. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Nipele, ŵaatumile ŵakulijiganya ŵao, pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵa mumpingo u che Helode ku Che Yesu. Ŵausisye achitiji, “Jwakwiganya, tukumanyilila kuti mmwe ndi mundu jwakulupilichika, nkwiganya litala lya Akunnungu kwa usyene, pangaganisya ŵandu akusala chichi, pakuŵa ngankulola ukulu wa mundu. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Sambano, ntusalile, nkuganisya ichichi? Uli ili yambone kulipa nsongo kwa mwenye jwankulu jwa ku Loma pane akuŵilanjikwa che Kaisali, pane tunalipe?” <verse eid="MAT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Nambo Che Yesu ŵaumanyilile nningwa wao wangalumbana, ŵaasalile, “Kwachichi nkuuninga, ŵanyamwe ŵaulamba? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Munosye mbiya ja kulipila nsongo.” Nombewo ŵaiche nawo likobili. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵausisye, “Aku ku meeso ku ni liina li ya ŵaani?” <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Ŵajanjile, “Che Kaisali.” Pelepo Che Yesu ŵaasalile ŵanyawo kuti, “Nipele, i che Kaisali mwapeje che Kaisali, ni ya Akunnungu mwapeje Akunnungu.” <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Paŵagapilikene gele ŵasimosile, ŵalesile, ŵajawile.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liusyo lyankati kusyuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maliko 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Lye lyuŵa lyo, Masadukayo ŵane ŵakuti ngapagwa kusyuka ŵaichilile Che Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />nipele, ŵausisye, “Jwakwiganya, che Musa ŵatite mundu jwalombele awaga pangaleka ŵanache, ikusachilwa mpwakwe annombele jwankongwe jwawililwe ni ŵankwakwe, kuti ammelechele ŵanache nkulugwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Nipele, pa musi petu pano ŵapali ŵandu saba ŵaŵapagwile lutumbo lumo. Jwaandanda jo ŵalombele ni ŵawile pangali ŵanache, ni mpwakwe ŵannombile jwankongwe jula. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Iyoyo yaliji kwa jwaaŵili jula ni jwaatatu ni mpaka ŵanawose saba. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Paŵamasile kuwa ŵanawose saba, jwankongwe jula ŵawile. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Nambi, pa lyuŵa lya kusyuka jwele jwankongwe chaŵe jwa ŵaani mwa ŵele saba wo? Pakuŵa wose saba ŵannombile.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile ŵanyawo, “Ŵanyamwe nkosele pakuŵa ngankugamanyilila Malembelo ga Akunnungu atamuno ukombole wa Akunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Pakuŵa pachachisyuka ŵawe ngalombela atamuno kulombwa, chaaŵe mpela achikatumetume ŵa kwinani. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Nambo yankati kusyuka kwa ŵawe, uli, nganinsyoma aila iŵansalile Akunnungu? Ŵansalile, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Une ndili Akunnungu ŵa che Iblahimu ni Akunnungu ŵa che Isaka ni Akunnungu ŵa che Yakobo.’ Nipele ŵele nganaŵa Akunnungu ŵa ŵawe, nambo ŵa ŵajumi.” <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Mpingo wa ŵandu ula paŵapilikene yeleyo, ŵagasimosile majiganyo gao.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likanyo lyekulungwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maliko 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Mafalisayo paŵapilikene kuti Che Yesu ŵamyalesye Masadukayo, ŵasongangene pamo. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Jumo jwao, ŵakwiganya malajisyo, ŵausisye Che Yesu achalingaga kuti, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Jwakwiganya, likanyo chi lyalili lyekulungwa mu Malajisyo?” <verse eid="MAT 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Che Yesu ŵanjanjile, “ ‘Mwanonyele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu ni ntima wenu wose ni mbumu jenu jose ni lunda lwenu lose.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Alili ni likanyo lyekulungwa ni lyaandanda. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Ni lyaaŵili lyalikulandana ni lyele, lili, ‘Munnonyele njenu mpela yankuti pakulinonyela mwasyene.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Malajisyo gose ga Akunnungu gaŵapele che Musa ni majiganyo ga ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu gakukulupilila ge makanyo gaŵili ga.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liusyo lyankati Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maliko 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Paŵasongangene pamo Mafalisayo, Che Yesu ŵausisye, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Ŵanyamwe nkuganisya uli yankati Kilisito? Uli ali mwanagwao ŵaani?” Ŵajanjile, “Ŵa che Daudi.” <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Nipele, kwachichi che Daudi kwa ukombole wa Mbumu jwa Akunnungu akwaŵilanga Ambuje? Pakuŵa ŵatite,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘Ambuje ŵaasalile Ambuje ŵangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">ntame kundyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">mpaka pachinaaŵiche ŵammagongo ŵenu paasi pa makongolo genu.’<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Nipele, iŵaga che Daudi akwaŵilanga Kilisito ‘Ambuje’ ikukomboleka chinauli kuti ali mwanagwao?” <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Ngapagwa mundu jwalijose juŵakombwele kwanga. Chitandile lyuŵa lyo ngapagwa juŵalinjile sooni kummusya.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwajamuka ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ni Mafalisayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Maliko 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luka 11:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵausalile mpingo wa ŵandu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao kuti, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Ŵakwiganya malajisyo ni Mafalisayo akwete ukombole wa kusala uchenene Malajisyo. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Kwalye ligongo lyo mpikanichisye ni kutenda chachili chose chichansalile. Nambo nkasyasya isambo yao, pakuŵa ngakutenda yele yakuisala yo. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Akutaŵanga misigo jakutopela ni kwatwika ŵandu mmakoyo, nambo ŵele achinsyene wo ngakusaka atamuno kukwaya ni chala. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Ŵanyawo akugatenda masengo gao gose kuti apate kuloleka ni ŵandu. Akuwala indu yailembekwe malembelo ga malajisyo pachanya meeso ni konjechesya ukulu wa nguo syao kuti aloleche ali ŵandu ŵa Akunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Ikwanonyela kutama peuto pa kuchimbichikwa mu indimba ni itengu ya kuchimbichikwa mmajumba ga kupopelela. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Ikwanonyela kwakomasya kwa kwachimbichisya pa kusumichisya malonda ni kusaka ŵandu ŵaŵilanje, ‘Jwakwiganya.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Nambo ŵanyamwe nkaŵilanjikwa ‘Jwakwiganya,’ pakuŵa jwakwiganya jwenu ali jumo pe, ni wose ndi achalongo. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Atamuno ngasimummilanga mundu ‘Atati’ pa chilambo pano, pakuŵa Atati ŵetu ali ŵamo pe, ŵaali kwinani. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Atamuno ngasimmilanjikwa ‘ilongola’ pakuŵa chilongola jwenu ali jumo pe, yaani Kilisito. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Nombe jwali jwankulungwa jwenu chaaŵe katumetume jwenu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Jwakulikwesya chatuluswe ni jwakulitulusya chachikweswa.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwamuka yankati ulamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maliko 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11:39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Ulaje uwe kukwenu ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ni Mafalisayo, ŵaulamba! Pakuŵa nkuugala nnango wa Umwenye wa kwinani mmbujo pa ŵandu. Ni ŵanyamwe mwachinsyene ngankwinjila, atamuno ngankwaleka ŵakusaka kwinjila ajinjile. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Ulaje uwe kukwenu ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ni Mafalisayo, ŵaulamba! Nkwasumula ŵawililwe ni achiŵankwawo ipanje yao nchilitendaga ŵandu ŵambone nkupopela mapopelo gamaleu, kwa lye ligongo lyo kulaga kwenu chikuŵe kwakukulungwa nnope.<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Ulaje uwe kukwenu ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ni Mafalisayo, ŵaulamba! Pakuŵa nkutaŵa ulendo mu bahali ni pa chilambo kuti nkombole kuntenda namose mundu jumo aŵe jwa kunkuya mwanya. Pankumpata, nkuntenda aŵe mundu jwakwinjila ku jehanamu kumpunda mwachinsyene.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Ulaje uwe kukwenu ilongola ŵangalola! Ŵanyamwe nkutinji mundu alumbililaga kwa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, kwele kulumbila ko ngaŵa chindu, nambo alumbililaga kwa sahabu ja Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, kwele kulumbilila ko kukwakanganichisya kuchitenda chalumbilile. <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Ŵanyamwe ŵangalola ŵakuloŵela! Chapi chachili cha malumbo nnope, sahabu pane Nyuumba ja Akunnungu jajikujitenda sahabu jiŵe jeswela? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Sooni nkutinji mundu alumbililaga pa chilisa ngaŵa chindu, nambo alumbilaga nkujikolanga mbopesi jajili pa chilisa, kwele kulumbilila ko kukwakanganichisya kuchitenda chalumbilile. <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Ŵanyamwe ŵangalola! Ana kulumbilila chi kwakuli kwamalumbo nnope, kwa mbopesi pane kwa chilisa chachikujitenda mbopesi jiŵe jeswela? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Jwakulumbila kwa chilisa akulumbilila kwa chele chilisa cho, ni kwa chose chachili pachanya pakwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Ni jwakulumbila kwa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu akulumbilila kwa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ni kwa jwele jwakutama nkati mo. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Nombe jwakulumbila kwa kwinani akulumbilila kwa chitengu cha Umwenye wa Akunnungu, ni kwa jwele jwakutama pachanya pakwe.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Ulaje uwe kukwenu ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ni Mafalisayo, ŵaulamba! Nkupochela mbopesi kwa ŵandu, atamuno pa masamba ga kununjila, ni bisali ni jila, nkuileka indu yekulungwa yailajichikwe ni Malajisyo mpela ila kupanganya yaikwanonyelesya Akunnungu ni chanasa ni chikulupi. Gelega ni gankusachilwa kugakamulisya pangagaliŵalila gane. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />ilongola ŵangalola! Nkujityosya membe mu yakung'wa, nambo nkuchimila chinyama chachikuŵilanjikwa ngamia!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Ulaje uwe kukwenu ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ni Mafalisayo, ŵaulamba! Nkosya chikombe ni mbale kwa paasa, nambo nkati nkuleka indu impatile kwa wiyi ni nsese. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Ugwe Mfalisayo jwangalola! Njosye chikombe nkati kaje ni paasa chipasalale.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Ulaje uwe kukwenu ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ni Mafalisayo, ŵaulamba! Pakuŵa nkulandana ni malembe gagasililwe ni chokaa, nombe kwa paasa gakuwoneka kuŵa gambone, nambo nkati mwakwe gagumbele maupa ga ŵawe ni usakwa wejinji. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Iyoyopeyo ni ŵanyamwe kwa paasa nkuoneka ni ŵandu kuŵa ŵambone nambo nkati ngumbele ulamba ni ungalimate.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulaga kukwika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Ulaje uwe kukwenu ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ni Mafalisayo, ŵaulamba! Nkugumba malembe ga ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu ni kugasalalisya malembe ga ŵandu ŵambone. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Nkutinji, ‘Tukaapali kalakala katema ka achambuje ŵetu, ngatukaŵe pamo mmaulajo ga ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu!’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Kwakuŵecheta yeleyo nkulilosya mwachinsyene kuti ŵanyamwe ndi achiŵana ŵa aŵala ŵaŵauleje ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Hayaga, mmalichisye masengo gaŵachokwele achambuje ŵenu! <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Ŵanyamwe ŵa uŵelesi wa lijoka lya sumu! Chimmutuche chinauli ulamusi wa ku jehanamu? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Nipele lye ligongo lyo une ngumpelechela ŵanyamwe ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu, ŵandu ŵa lunda ni ŵakwiganya malajisyo, ŵane mwa ŵanyawo chimwaulaje ni kwaŵamba pa nsalaba, ni ŵane chimwapute ibokola mmajumba genu ga kupopelela ni kwasosa mmisi jinajose. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Nipele chileŵo chichiŵe kukwenu kwa ligongo lya miasi ja ŵandu ŵambone jajijitiche mu chilambo muno. Elo chitandile chiwa chi che Habili jwanganakola chileŵo mpaka chi che Sakalia, mwana ju che Balakia, jumwammuleje pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu pasikati ja papaswela ni chilisa. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Isyene ngunsalila kuti, ŵandu ŵa uŵelesi u chalamulikwe kwa ligongo lya indu yi.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu yakuti pakuunonyela musi wa ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Yelusalemu! Ugwe Yelusalemu! Nkwaulaga ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu ni kwaputa maganga ŵelewo ŵaŵatumikwe kukwenu. Ana kalingwa nasachile kwasonganganya achiŵana ŵenu, mpela nguku ijikuti pakwasonganganya achiŵanagwe kusi kwa mapapiko gakwe, nambo mwakanile. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Ayaga nipele, nyuumba jenu chijisigale lisame pe. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Ngunsalila, ngamuumona sooni mpaka pachinchiti, ‘Akole upile jwele jwakwika mu liina lya Ambuje.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akuŵecheta yankati konasika kwa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maliko 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Che Yesu ŵakopweche pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ni paŵajaulaga, ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵajaulile ni kwalosya majumba ga Nyuumba ja Akunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Elo, gose gankugawona ga! Isyene ngunsalila kuti, ngapagwa liganga namuno limo lichilisigale pa line, kila chindu chichijonasikwe.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulaga ni kusauka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maliko 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Che Yesu paŵatemi ku chitumbi cha Miseituni, ŵakulijiganya ŵajaulile pa chisyepela, ŵausisye, “Ntusalile ana gelega chigatyochele chakachi? Ni chimanyisyo chi chakutulosya kwika kwenu ni kumbesi kwa chilambo chino?” <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Nlilolechesye kuti akaika kunnambusya mundu. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Pakuŵa achajinji chakopochele aninkuti, une ndili Kilisito nombewo chachasoyasya ŵandu ŵajinji. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Chimpikane yankati ngondo ni kusongona yankati ngondo, nambo nkatojima, pakuŵa gelega gakusachilwa gatyochele kaje, nambo kumbesi kwakwe kukanaŵe. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Chilambo chimo chichiputane ni chine, umwenye umo chiuputane ni wine. Kosekose kuchichiŵa ni sala ni chindendemesi cha chilambo. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Aga ganagose ga gali mpela kutanda kwa chilungusi.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Nipele chachintyosya kuti ansausye ni kummulaga. Chinchichimwa ni ŵandu ŵa ilambo yose ligongo lya liina lyangu. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Sooni, achajinji chachileche chikulupi chao, chachigalaukana ni kuchimana jwine ni jwine. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Chachikopochela ŵakulondola ŵa unami achajinji chiŵalambusye ŵandu ŵajinji <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Ligongo lya winji wa ungalimate, unonyelo wa ŵandu ŵajinji chiuchinandupa. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Nambo jwalijose juchapililile mpaka kumbesi, jwelejo ni juchakulupuche. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Nambo, kukanaŵe kwika kumbesi, aji Ngani Jambone ja umwenye wa Akunnungu chijilalichikwe pa chilambo chose jiŵe umboni kwa ilambo yose.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulaga kwakukulungwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maliko 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Nipele, pachinchione ‘Chindu cha soni chachikusakasya Nyuumba ja Akunnungu’ chichaŵechetekwe ni che Danieli, jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu kuti chijimi peuto papaswela, ŵakusyoma amanyilile malumbo gakwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Pelepo, ŵaali ku Yudea autuchile kumatumbi. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Jwaali pachanya nyuumba akatuluka ni kwinjila nkati kukwigala chindu. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Jwaali ku migunda akauja panyuma kukwigala nguo jao. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Ulaje kukwao ŵele utachiŵa pachiilu ni ŵachajonjesye gele moŵa go! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Mpopele kuti kuutuka kwenu kunaŵe katema ka mbepo, atamuno Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila! <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Pakuŵa kele katema ko chikupagwe kulaga kwakukulungwa kwati nganikupagwe chitandile kugumbikwa chilambo chino mpaka sambano, atamuno ngali pachikutyochele sooni. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Iŵaga gele moŵa go ngagakapunguchikwe, ngapagwa mundu jwakakulupwiche, nambo gele moŵa go chigapunguchikwe kwa ligongo lya ŵele ŵaŵasagulikwe.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />“Nipele, kele katema ko mundu aikaga kunsalila, ‘Kilisito ali apa’ pane ‘Ali akuno,’ nkakulupilila. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Pakuŵa chachikopochela ŵanya kilisito ŵa unami ni ŵakulondola ŵa unami. Chachitenda imanyisyo yaikulungwa ni yakusimonjeka ya kwalambusya ŵandu yakombolekaga namose ŵasagulikwe ŵa Akunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Mpilikane, nanjamwiche chile kakanaŵe katema. <verse eid="MAT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Nipele, ansalilaga kuti, ‘Nnole, ali mwipululu,’ nkajaula kweleko, pane ‘Nnole, ali munkati,’ nkakulupilila. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Pakuŵa, mpela njasi ijikuti kumesya kutyochela kungopochelo lyuŵa mpaka kulikutiŵila lyuŵa, iyoyo peyo ni ichijile kwika kwa Mwana jwa Mundu. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Pele pauli ntembo, ni patachisongangana achikapungu.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwika kwa Mwana jwa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maliko 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Nambo nkumala kulaga kwa ge moŵa go, lyuŵa chilipilile, ni lwesi ngalulanguchisya, ni ndondwa sisipatuche kutyochela kwinani ni machili ga kwinani chigachitinganyika. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Nipele, chimanyisyo cha Mwana jwa Mundu chichioneche kwinani, pelepo ŵandu wose ŵa pa chilambo chalile, Chachimmona Mwana jwa Mundu ali nkwika pachanya maunde ga kwiunde, ni machili ni ukulu wekulungwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Nombe chachatuma achikatumetume ŵao ŵa kwinani ali akamulile mapenga ga kusona nnope, ni ŵanyawo chachasonganganya ŵandu ŵao uŵasagulikwe kutyochela mbande syose ncheche sya chilambo, chitandile aji mbesi ja kwinani mpaka aji mbesi ji.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha nkuju</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maliko 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Kwa chitela cha ntini nlijiganye achi chitagu chi, Paukutanda kola nyambi ni kusipuka masamba, ŵanyamwe nkumanyilila kuti katema ka chuuku kaŵandichile. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Iyoyo peyo ŵanyamwe pachingaone aga gose ga gali nkutendekwa, mmanyilile kuti katema ka une kuuja kaŵandichile. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Isyene ngunsalila, Au uŵelesi u ngaupita gakanaŵe kutendekwa aga gose ga. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Kwinani ni chilambo chiichipita, nambo maloŵe gangu ngagapita ng'o.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngapagwa jwakumanyilila lyuŵa ni saa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maliko 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Nambo, yankati lyuŵa ni saa, ngapagwa ŵakuimanyilila chakachi chiikopochele, atamuno achikatumetume ŵa kwinani, atamuno Mwana, Atati jika pe ni ŵakumanyilila. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Pakuŵa yaitite mmoŵa ga che Nuhu, ni iyoyo ichichiŵa kwika kwa Mwana jwa Mundu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Pakuŵa gele moŵa go, chikumba meesi chachikulungwa chikanaŵe, ŵandu ŵalyaga ni kung'wa, ni ŵalombelaga ni kulombwa, mpaka lye lyuŵa lyo che Nuhu paŵajinjile mu safina. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Nganamanyilila mpaka chikumba meesi pachaiche ni kwakumba wose. Ni iyoyo ichichiŵa kwika kwa Mwana jwa Mundu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Kele katema ko ŵandu ŵaŵili chachiŵa ku ngunda, jumo chachijigalikwa ni jwine kulekwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Achakongwe ŵaŵili chachiŵa aninkusyaga, jumo chachijigalikwa ni jwine kulekwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Nipele, nlilolechesye, pakuŵa ngankumanyilila lyuŵa chi litaiche Ambuje wenu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Nambo nkumbuchile lyeleli, kuti akaimanyi nsyene nyuumba katema chi jwawiyi pataiche, akachesisye, ngakajileche nyuumba jakwe jijonasikwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Kwalye ligongo lyo, ŵanyamwe nliŵiche chile, pakuŵa ngankumanyilila katema kachaiche Mwana jwa Mundu.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Katumetume jwakukulupilichika ni jwangakukulupilichika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Che Yesu ŵapundile kuŵecheta, “Nipele nduni jwali jwakutumichila jwakukulupilichika ni lunda, jwati ambujegwe chammiche pachanya pa ŵandu ŵao, ŵape chakulya katema kakwe? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Jwana upile jwakutumichila jo pataiche ambujegwe juchansimane aninkutendekanya yeleyo. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Isyene ngunsalila, chachimmika jwele katumetume jo alindilile chipanje chakwe chose. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Nambo jwakutumichila aŵaga jwangalumbana atiji muntima mwakwe kuti, ‘Ambuje ŵangu akukaŵa kuuja,’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />ni kutanda kwaputa achikapolo achinjakwe ni kulya ni kung'wa pamo ni ŵakolelwa, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />ambujegwe kapolo jula chachiika lyuŵa lyangakulilolela ni saa jangakujimanya. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Chachinjamuka wamba ni kummika mu mpingo umo ni ŵaulamba. Kweleko chikuŵe ni kulila ni kuchilimya meeno.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha achiŵali likumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Kele katema ko, Umwenye wa kwinani chiulandane ni achiŵali likumi ŵaŵajigele ibatali yao, ŵatyosile kwachingamila ambuje ŵa ulombela. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Nsano ŵao ŵaliji ŵakuloŵela ni nsano ŵaliji ŵakalamuka. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Ŵaŵaliji ŵakuloŵela ŵala ŵajigele ibatali yao, nambo nganajigala mauta ga akiba. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Nambo ŵele ŵaŵaliji ŵakalamuka ŵala ŵajigele mauta mu yupa pamo ni ibatali yao. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Pakuŵa ambuje ŵaulombela ŵakaŵile kwika, achiŵali ŵala wose ŵagwesele ni kugona. <verse eid="MAT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Nambo sikati chilo nnope kwapali kunyokonya, ‘Nnole! Ambuje ŵaulombela akwika, njaule nkaachingamile.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Pelepo achiŵali ŵala wose ŵajimwiche, ŵaiŵisile chile ibatali yao. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Ŵele ŵakuloŵela ŵala ŵaasalile ŵakalamuka kuti, ‘Mtupe mauta genu kanandi pakuŵa ibatali yetu ikusimika.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Nambo ŵakalamuka ŵala ŵajanjile, ‘Ngagatukwana uwe ni ŵanyamwe! Mmbaya njaule kwa kusumisya nkalisumile mwachinsyene!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Nipele, ŵele achiŵali ŵakuloŵela wo paŵajawile kusuma mauta, ambuje ŵaulombela ŵaiche, ni achiŵali ŵaŵaliŵisile chile ŵajinjile pamo nawo mu nyuumba ja ulombela ni nnango waugalikwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Kanyuma achiŵali ŵane ŵala ŵaiche, ŵaaŵilasile, ‘Achimwene, achimwene, ntuugulile!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Nambo ŵelewo ŵajanjile, ‘Ngunsalila isyene, ngangummanyilila ŵanyamwe.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵatite, “Nlilolechesye, pakuŵa ngankumanyilila lyuŵa atamuno saa pachaiche Mwana jwa Mundu.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitagu cha ŵakutumichila ŵatatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Pakuŵa Umwenye wa kwinani uli mpela mundu jwasachile kwaula ulendo, ŵaaŵilasile ŵakutumichila ŵao ni kwalechela chipanje chakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Ŵampele kila jumo ichaikombole, jumo maunjili nsano ga mbiya, ni jwine maunjili gaŵili ni jwine liunjili limo, ni ŵajawile. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Nipele, juŵapochele mbiya maunjili nsano ŵajawile kukusumisya malonda ni ŵapatile mbiya sine maunjili nsano. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Ilaila juŵapochele mbiya maunjili gaŵili jula, ŵapatile sine maunjili gaŵili. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Nambo jwele juŵapochele mbiya liunjili limo jula, ŵajawile, ni kusola lisimbo paasi, ni ŵasisile mbiya ja achimwene jwao.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Pagapite moŵa gamajinji, achimwene jwa ŵakutumichila ŵala ŵausile, ni ŵatandite kuŵalanjila mbiya sisyatumiche ni mbiya sisyapatikene mu mbiya syakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Katumetume juŵapochele mbiya maunjili nsano ŵaiche ali ajigele gane nsano, ŵaasalile, ‘Achimwene, mwambele maunjili nsano ga mbiya, nnole, nyonjechesye maunjili gane nsano.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Achimwene jwao ŵansalile jwelejo kuti, ‘Yambone, jwakutumichila jwambone ni jwakukulupilichika. Ndi jwakukulupilichika kwa indu yainandi pe, chinampe yejinji. Njise kukusengwa pamo ni achimwene jwenu.’<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />“Sooni jwakutumichila juŵapochele mbiya maunjili gaŵili ŵaiche, ŵatyosisye mbiya sine maunjili gaŵili gagajonjechekwe, ŵatite, ‘Achimwene, mwambele mbiya maunjili gaŵili. Nnole, mbatile sine maunjili gaŵili gagajonjechekwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Achimwene jwao ŵansalile jwelejo kuti, ‘Yambone, jwakutumichila jwambone ni jwakukulupilichika. Ndi jwakukulupilichika kwa indu yainandi pe, chinampe yejinji. Njise kukusengwa pamo ni achimwene jwenu.’<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />“Nambo juŵapochele mbiya liunjili limo jula ŵaiche, ŵatite, ‘Achimwene, nguimanyilila kuti mwe ndi ŵakulimba, mmweji nkugungula pa nganimpande, ni kusonganganya panganimmisa. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Najogwepe, najisisile mbiya jenu paasi. Nipele njigale mbiya jenu.’<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />“Achimwene jwao ŵanjanjile, ‘Mwe ndi jwakutumichila jwangalumbana ni jwa ulesi! Nkuumanyilila kuti une ngugungula panganimbande, ni kusonganganya panganimisa. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Nipele yammajile kujiŵika mbiya jangu mu nyuumba ja kugosela mbiya, none pachiiche ngajijigele jajili jangu ni chakonjecheka chakwe! <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Munsumule mbiya jo mumpe jwakwete mbiya maunjili likumi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Pakuŵa, jwali ni chindu chapegwe ni konjechekwa. Nambo jwanganakola chindu, ata chele chakwete cho chichijigalikwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Yankati jwakutumichila jwangaikanacho chakonjecheka, mumponye paasa ku chipi! Kweleko chikuŵe ni kulila ni kuchilimya meeno.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulamula kwa mbesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Katema kachaiche Mwana jwa Mundu mu ukulu wakwe ni achikatumetume ŵa kwinani wose ali pamo nawo, pelepo chachitama pa chitengu chao cha umwenye chachili ni ukulu. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Ŵandu ŵa ilambo yose chasongangane mmbujo mwao, nombe chachalekanganya ŵandu mpela ŵakuchinga yakuti pakusilekanganya ngondolo ni mbusi. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Chaachisiŵika ngondolo yaani ŵandu ŵambone kundyo kwakwe ni mbusi yaani ŵandu ŵangalumbana kunchiji kwakwe.<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />“Nombe Mwenye chiŵasalile ŵaali ŵa kundyo kwakwe kuti, ‘Njise ŵanyamwe ŵampegwile upile ni Atati ŵangu, mpochele umwenye ŵampanganyichisye chile chitandile kugumbikwa chilambo. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Pakuŵa jangwete sala ni ŵanyamwe mwambele chakulya ni jangwete njota ni ŵanyamwe mwambele meesi ni naliji jwannendo ni ŵanyamwe mwambochele mmajumba genu. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Naliji matakope, ŵanyamwe mwandakwisye ni naliji jwakulwala ŵanyamwe mwaaiche kukuunola ni naliji jwantawe ŵanyamwe mwanyimajimile.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Pelepo, ŵandu ŵakupanganya yaili yambone paujo pa Akunnungu chiŵajanje mwenye kuti, ‘Ambuje, ana chakachi twambweni ŵa sala ni kumpa chakulya, pane jinkwete njota ni kung'wesya meesi? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Ana chakachi twammweni nli jwannendo ni kumpochela, pane matakope ni kuntakusya? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Chakachi twammweni ndi nkulwala pane jwantawe ni kwika kukunnola?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Mwenye chiŵajanje, ‘Ngunsalila isyene, chachilichose chimwantendele jumo jwa ŵanyaŵa achalongo ŵangu achanandi, mwandendele une.’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Nipele chiŵasalile ŵele ŵaali kunchiji kwao, ‘Ntyoche mmbujo mwangu ŵanyamwe ŵankwete malweso! Njaule ku mooto moŵa gose pangali mbesi wangasimika, wauŵichikwe chile kwa ligongo lya Shetani ni achikatumetume ŵakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Pakuŵa jangwete sala nganimumba chakulya, jangwete njota nganimumba meesi. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Naliji jwannendo nganimumbochela mmajumba genu ni panaliji matakope nganimumba nguo ni nalwalaga ni nataŵikwe nganinnyika kukulola.’<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />“Pelepo nombe chajanje, ‘Ambuje, ana chakachi twammweni ndi jinkwete sala ni njota, ni ndi jwannendo pane matakope, ni ndi nkulwala pane jwantaŵikwe, nowe nganitunkamusya?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Mwenye chajanje, ‘Ngunsalila isyene, kila pamwakanaga kumpanganichisya gelega jumo jwa ŵanyaŵa achanandi ŵa, mwakanile kuumbanganichisya une.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Nipele, ŵanyaŵa chajaule kumasausyo moŵa gose pangali mbesi, nambo ŵandu ŵakupanganya yaili yambone paujo pa Akunnungu chajaule ku umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Majilano ga kwaulaga Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Che Yesu paŵamalisisye kuŵecheta gelego gose, ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Nkumanyilila kuti pachigamale moŵa gaŵili chichiŵe chindimba cha Pasaka, ni Mwana jwa Mundu chakatyosyekwe kuti aŵambikwe pa nsalaba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Katema ko achakulu ŵa mbopesi ni achakulu ŵa ŵandu ŵasimene pa nsana wa nyuumba ja Jwankulu Jwambopesi jwaŵilanjikwe che Kayafa. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Ŵajilene ichajile pa kwakamula Che Yesu kwa malindi ni kwaulaga. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Nambo ŵatite chele chindu chinatyochele katema ka lyuŵa lya chindimba cha Pasaka, ngakaŵa chikutyochele kutindiganya pa ŵandu.<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akupakaswa mauta ku Besania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliko 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Che Yesu paŵaliji ku Besania, ku nyuumba ji che Simoni, juŵalamile matana. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Jwankongwe jumo juŵaliji ni chuupa chachikolochekwe ni liganga lya alabasta chachili ni mauta ga kununjila nnope ni ga ndalama jajikulungwa, ŵaichilile Che Yesu paŵatemi kulya chakulya, ŵajitile mauta muntwe. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵao paŵaiweni yele ŵatumbile, ŵatite, “Awu uwonasi u wa chichi? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Aga mauta ga ngati gakasumichikwe kwa mbiya jekulungwa, ni kupegwa ŵakulaga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Che Yesu ŵasimanyilile ng'anisyo syao, ŵaasalile, “Ligongo chi nkunsausya jwankongwe jo? Jwele atesile yambone kukwangu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Ŵakulaga alinji moŵa gose ni ŵanyamwe, nambo une nguuŵa ni ŵanyamwe moŵa gose. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Aju jwankongwe ju anyitilile pa chiilu mauta ga kununjila kuti amiche chile kwa masiko gangu. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Ngunsalila isyene, papali pose pa chilambo pano patachilalichila Ngani Jambone ji, achi chatesile jwankongwe ju chichisalichikwe kwa kunkumbuchila.<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yuda akukunda kwagalauka Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maliko 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Nipele, che Yuda Isikaliote, jumo jwa likumi ni ŵaŵili ŵala, ŵajawile kwa achakulu ŵa mbopesi, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />ŵausisye, “Ana chimuumbe ichichi nannyichisyaga Che Yesu kukwenu?” Ŵaŵalanjile ipande selasini ya feza. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Chitandile kele katema ko che Yuda ŵasosaga lipesa lya kwaichisya kukwao.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao akulya chakulya cha Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maliko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Lyuŵa limo likanaŵe lyuŵa lya chindimba cha mikate jangatagwa amila, ŵakulijiganya ŵajaulile Che Yesu ni kwausya, “Ana kwapi nkusaka tukankolochesye chakulya cha Pasaka?” <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Ŵajanjile, “Njaule mmusi kwa mundu jumpepe, nkansalile, ‘Jwakwiganya akuti, katema kangu kaiche, chindye chakulya cha Pasaka kumangwenu pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵangu.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵala ŵatesile mpela iŵatite pakusalilwa ni Che Yesu, ŵakolosisye chakulya cha Pasaka.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Ligulo, Che Yesu ŵatemi pakulila chakulya pamo ni ŵakulijiganya ŵao kumi na mbili. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Paŵalyaga, Che Yesu ŵatite, “Ngunsalila isyene, jumo jwenu chakang'alauche.” <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Ŵakulijiganya ŵasupwiche nnope, ŵatandite kuusya jumo jumo, “Ambuje! Uli, ndili une?” <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Juchakatoŵele nkate mumbale pampepe ni une jujojo ni juchakang'alauche. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Elo, Mwana jwa Mundu chawe mpela Malembelo ga Akunnungu igakuti pakusala, nambo ulaje kwa jwelejo juchakangalauche Mwana jwa Mundu! Ikaliji mmbaya ngakapagwe jwele mundu jo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Che Yuda, juŵangalawiche, ŵausisye, “Jwakwiganya! Ndili une?” Che Yesu ŵajanjile, “Ugwe mmechete.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chakulya cha Ambuje</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maliko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Ŵakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Paŵalyaga, Che Yesu ŵaujigele nkate, ŵaatogolele Akunnungu, ŵaugaŵenye, ŵapele ŵakulijiganya ŵao achitiji, “Njigale ndye, achi ni chiilu changu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Nipele ŵachijigele chikombe cha divai, ŵatogolele, ŵapele achitiji, “Nng'welele achi ŵanawose, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />pakuŵa aji ni miasi jangu ja lilangano jajikwitika kwa ligongo lya ŵajinji kwa kwalechelesya sambi. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Nambo ngunsalila kuti nguung'wa sooni divai ja sabibu mpaka paching'we jasambano pamo ni ŵanyamwe mu umwenye wa Atati ŵangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Paŵamasile kwimba lujimbo lwa kulapa, ŵatyosile, ŵajawile kuchikwesya cha Miseituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akusala kuti chakanikwe ni che Petulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵaasalile sooni, “Chilo cha lelo jino, ŵanyamwe ŵanawose chinchimwe ni une, pakuŵa Malembelo ga Akunnungu gakuti, ‘Chinampute jwakuchinga ni mpingo wa ngondolo chipwilingane.’<verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Nambo pachimale kusyuka, chinannongolele ku Galilaya.” <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Che Petulo ŵaasalile Che Yesu, “Nachiŵamuno ŵanawose chachimwe ni mmwe ni kunneka, nambo une ngali pachinanneche.” <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Che Yesu ŵansalile che Petulo, “Ngunsalila isyene, chilo chino jikanaŵe kutongola tambala, chimungane katatu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Che Petulo ŵatite, “Iŵaga chingawe pamo nomwe, ngasinankana.” Ŵakulijiganya ŵane ŵala ŵanawose ŵatite iyoyo.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akupopela ku Getesemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maliko 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵajawile pamo nawo kwiuto kwakukuŵilanjikwa ku Getesemane, ŵaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao kuti, “Ntame apano une ngwaula ako kukupopela.”<verse eid="MAT 26:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Ŵalongene nawo che Petulo pamo ni ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵa chilume ŵa che Sebedayo, ŵatandite kusupuka nnope ni kulagasika. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Pelepo ŵaasalile, “Ngusupuka nnope muntima mpaka chiŵandi kuwa. Ntame apano ni nchesye pamo ni une.” <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Nipele, ŵajawile mmbujo kanandi, ŵagwile manguku, ŵapopele achitiji, “Atati ŵangu, iŵaga ikukomboleka, achi chikombe cha malagasyo chimbite, nambo ngaŵa kwa kusaka une, nambo iŵe mpela inkuti pakusaka mmwe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Ŵajaulile ŵakulijiganya ŵala, ŵasimene agonile, ŵaasalile che Petulo, “Ana uli, nganinkombola kuchesya pamo ni une atamuno saa jimope? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Nchesye ni kupopela kuti nkaika kwinjila nkulinjikwa. Mbumu jikusaka nambo chiilu changali machili.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Che Yesu ŵajawile sooni kaaŵili kukupopela, “Atati ŵangu, iŵaga ngaikomboleka achi chikombe cha malagasyo chipite pangang'welela une, nipele, chinkusaka chitendekwe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Ŵajaulile sooni ŵakulijiganya ŵao, ŵasimene agonile, pakuŵa meeso gao gatopelwe ni lugono.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Nipele ŵalesile, ŵajawile sooni kukupopela kaatatu kwa maloŵe galagala. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Nipele ŵajaulile ŵakulijiganya ŵala, ŵaasalile, “Ana uli, chiŵela nli mu lugono ni kupumulila? Nnole katema kasyene kaiche, ni Mwana jwa Mundu chatajikwe mmakono mwa ŵandu ŵa sambi. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Njime, twende. Nnole! Akwika jwakuung'alauka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akukamulwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Nipele, Che Yesu paŵaliji nkuŵecheta nawo, ŵaiche che Yuda, jumo jwa ŵakulijiganya kumi na mbili ŵala. Pamo nawo ŵaiche ŵandu ŵajinji ali ajigele mapanga ni imbonga ŵaŵatumikwe ni achakulu ŵambopesi ni achakulu ŵa ŵandu. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Juŵasachile kungalauka Che Yesu jo, ŵapele chimanyisyo kuti, “Juchinankomasye kwa kwakunnonyela ni jujojo, munkamule.” <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Che Yuda ŵammandichile Che Yesu, ŵaasalile, “Ngunkomasya jwakwiganya!” Nipele ŵankomasisye kwa kwakumbata. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Che Yesu ŵansalile, “Ambusanga, ntende chinnyichile.” Pelepo ŵaiche ŵandu ŵala, ŵankamwile Che Yesu ni kwaŵika paasi pa ulamusi wao.<verse eid="MAT 26:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Jumo jwa ŵaŵaliji pamo ni Che Yesu ŵalisolomwele lipanga lyakwe, ŵamputile kapolo jwa Jwankulu Jwambopesi, ŵankatile liwiwi. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Pelepo Che Yesu ŵansalile jwejo, “Mmusye upanga wenu mwigonelo mwakwe, pakuŵa jwalijose jwakuulaga ni lipanga, chaulajikwe ni lipanga. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Uli ana ngankwimanyilila kuti ngukombola kwaŵenda Atati ŵangu ni kuumbelechela kupunda ŵangondo mipingo kumi na mbili ŵa achikatumetume ŵa kwinani? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Nambo chigamalile chinauli Malembelo ga Akunnungu gagakuti ikuŵajilwa kuwa?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Katema kakoko Che Yesu ŵausalile mpingo wa ŵandu uŵaiche kukwakamula, “Uli nnyiche kukungamula kwa mapanga ni imbonga mpela ndili mundu jwangangugakamulichisya malajisyo? Moŵa gose naliji pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu njijiganyaga, nambo nganimungamula! <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Nambo aga gose ga gatendekwe pakuti gamalile malembelo ga ŵakulondola ŵa Akunnungu.” Pelepo ŵakulijiganya ŵanawose ŵalesile, ŵatisile.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwauswa kunkungulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maliko 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Nipele, ŵele ŵandu ŵaŵankamwile Che Yesu ŵanjawisye ku nyuumba ji che Kayafa juŵaliji Jwankulu Jwambopesi, kuŵasongangene ŵakwiganya Malajisyo ni achachekulu. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Che Petulo ŵankuiye kwa kutali mpaka mu lutenje lwa Jwambopesi Jwankulu, ŵajinjile nkati pamo ni ŵakulindilila kuti alole ichikatendekwe.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Nipele, achakulu ŵambopesi ni nkungulu wose ŵausosile umboni wa unami kuti akombole kumbulaga Che Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Nambo nganapata umboni wauli wose, nachiŵamuno ŵaiche ŵandu ŵajinji ŵa unami. Kumbesi kwakwe ŵaiche ŵandu ŵaŵili. <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />Ŵatite, “Aju mundu ju ŵatite, ‘Ngukombola kujigumula Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ni kujitaŵa sooni kwa moŵa gatatu.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Jwambopesi Jwankulu ŵajimi, ŵammusisye Che Yesu, “Ana ngankwanga liloŵe? Ana ŵandu ŵa akummechetela chichi?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Nambo Che Yesu ŵatemi ji. Jwambopesi Jwankulu ŵansalile, “Ngunnumbisya kwa Akunnungu ŵaali ŵajumi, ntusalile naga isyene mmwe ni Kilisito, Mwana jwa Akunnungu!” <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Che Yesu ŵanjanjile, “Mmwe mmechete! Nambo ngunsalila kuti, chitandile sambano chimumbone Mwana jwa Mundu ali atemi kundyo kwa Ambuje ŵa machili, chimumbone iyoyo achiikaga pa maunde ga kwinani.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Pelepo, Jwambopesi Jwankulu ŵapapulenye nguo syao, ŵatite, “Ŵatukene Akunnungu! Uli tukuusaka sooni umboni nkati jweleju? Sambano mpilikene yatite pakwatukana Akunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Ŵanyamwe nkuti uli?” Ŵanyawo ŵanjanjile, “Aŵajilwe kuwa!” <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Nipele ŵansunile mata ku meeso, ŵamputile. Ŵane ŵamputile majanda palijeje, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />achitiji, “Nlondole, alakwe Kilisito Jwakuwombola, ŵaani ŵamputile!”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Petulo akwakana Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maliko 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Che Petulo ŵatemi paasa mu lutenje. Nipele, jwakutumichila jumo jwankongwe ŵanjaulile, nikuti, “Alakwe mwaliji pampepe ni Che Yesu jwa ku Galilaya.” <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Nambo che Petulo ŵakanile mmbujo mwa ŵanawose achitiji, “Ngangumanyilila inkuŵecheta yo.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Paŵakopokaga paasa, katumetume jwine jwankongwe ŵammweni, ŵaasalile uŵaliji pelepo kuti, “Mundu ju ŵaliji pamo ni Che Yesu jwa ku Nasaleti.” <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Che Petulo ŵakanile sooni kwa kulumbilila, “Ngangummanyilila mundu ju.” <verse eid="MAT 26:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Kanyuma kanandi, ŵandu ŵaŵaliji pelepo ŵajaulile che Petulo, ŵansalile, “Kusyene, mmwe nomwe nli jumo jwakwe, pakuŵa uŵechete wenu ukummanyisya.” <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Pelepo che Petulo ŵatandite kulumbilila kwakulilwesya achitiji, “Ngangummanyilila mundu ju!” Katema kakoko tambala jatongwele. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Che Petulo ŵagakumbuchile maloŵe gaŵasalilwe ni Che Yesu kuti, “Chimungane katatu, jikanaŵe kutongola tambala.” Nipele, ŵatyosile paasa, ŵalisile nnope.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akujigalikwa ku Che Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maliko 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohana 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Pakwachele, achakulu ŵambopesi ni achakulu ŵa ŵandu ŵajilene ichajile pakwaulaga Che Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Ŵataŵile magwedegwede, ŵanjigele, ŵampeleche ku che Pilato, jwankulu jwa Chiloma.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi che Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Masengo 1:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Pelepo, che Yuda juŵangalawiche, paŵaiweni kuti Che Yesu amasile kulamulikwa, ŵalilasiche muntima, ŵausisye kwa achakulu ŵambopesi ni achakulu ŵa ŵandu ipande selasini ya feza. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Ŵaasalile, “Leŵile kwa kuntyosya mundu jwangali ni sambi aulajikwe.” Nambo ŵele ŵanyawo ŵatite, “Yeleyo ili yetuwe? Chimmanyilile mwasyene.” <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Nombejo ŵaponyele feza sila pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ŵakopweche paasa, ŵajawile kukulitaŵilila. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Achakulu ŵambopesi ŵasijigele feza sila, nikuti, “Ngalumbana kusiŵika kwa jwakugosa feza sya Nyuumba ja Akunnungu pakuŵa sili feza sisyapatikene kwa kuulaga.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Nipele, ŵajilene, ŵasumile ngunda wa lilongo kuti paŵe pakwasichila achalendo. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Nipele, mpaka lelo jino wele ngunda wo ukuŵilanjikwa ngunda uwasumikwe kwa feza sisyapatikene kwa kuulaga.<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Kwa yeleyo maloŵe gaŵaŵechete che Yelemia jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu gamalile gagakuti, “Ŵajigele ipande selasini ya feza, malinga ni malipilo gaŵajilene Ŵaisilaeli kulipa kwa ligongo lyao. <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />Feza syo ŵasumile ngunda wa lilongo, mpela iŵanajisye Ambuje.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Pilato akwausya Che Yesu mausyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maliko 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohana 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Che Yesu ŵajimi mmbujo mwa jwankulu jwa chilambo. Nipele, jwankulu jwa Chiloma ŵammusisye, “Ana mmwe ni Mwenye jwa Ŵayahudi?” Che Yesu ŵanjanjile, “Mmwe mmechete.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Nambo achakulu ŵambopesi ni achachekulu paŵammechetelaga, nganajanga. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Nipele che Pilato ŵammusisye, “Ana ngankupilikana ganagose gele gakummechetela go?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Nambo Che Yesu nganajanga namose liloŵe limo, jwankulu jwa Chiloma jo ŵasimosile nnope.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akulamulikwa kuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maliko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Yasyoŵeleche jwankulu jwa Chiloma kwagopolela Myahudi jumo jwataŵikwe juŵansachile katema ka chindimba cha Pasaka. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Kele katema ko paliji ni jwantawe juŵamanyiche nnope, liina lyakwe che Balaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Nipele, paŵasongangene ŵandu pamo, che Pilato ŵausisye, “Ana nkusaka nangopole jwapi mwa ŵele ŵaŵili, che Balaba pane Che Yesu jwakuŵilanjikwa Kilisito?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Pakuŵa ŵaimanyilile kuti ŵantyosisye kwa ligongo lya wiu.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Che Pilato paŵatemi pa chitengu cha kulamulila, ŵankwawo ŵaichenawo utenga wanti, “Nkalipasyapasya kutenda chachili chose nkati jwele mundu jwambone jo, pakuŵa lelo lasile mu sagamisi kwa ligongo lyakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Nambo achakulu ŵambopesi ni achakulu ŵane ŵanyenjile ŵandu kuti ŵaŵende agopolwe che Balaba ni ŵaulaje Che Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Che Pilato ŵausisye ŵanyawo, “Nkunsaka jwapi nangopolele mwa ŵele ŵaŵili ŵa?” Ŵajanjile, “Che Balaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Che Pilato ŵausisye ŵanyawo, “Sano, naatende chichi Che Yesu jwakuŵilanjikwa Kilisito?” Ŵanawose ŵatite, “Mwaŵambe pa nsalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Nambo che Pilato ŵausisye, “Ligongochi? Ungalumbana chi watesile?” Ŵanyawo ŵanyanyisye achitiji, “Mwaŵambe pa nsalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Nipele, che Pilato paŵaiweni kuti ngakukombola kupanganya chachili chose nambo kutindiganya kukutanda, ŵajigele meesi ni kunaŵa makono mmbujo pa ŵandu ni ŵatite, “Une ngangulipasyapasya nkati chiwa cha aju mundu ju, chinyimanyilile mwachinsyene.” <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Ŵandu ŵanawose ŵatite, “Miasi jao jiŵe pachanya petu ni achiŵana ŵetu!” <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Nipele che Pilato ŵagopolele che Balaba kutyochela mu nyuumba jakutaŵilwa, nambo paŵamasile kumputa Che Yesu ibokola ŵantyosisye kukwaŵamba pa nsalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵangondo akuntendela chanache Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maliko 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohana 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Nipele ŵangondo ŵa jwankulu jwa Chiloma ŵanjinjisye Che Yesu nkati likome, wansyungwile mpingo wose. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Ŵammusile nguo syao, ŵammwasisye mwinjilo wechejeu wa chimwenye. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Nipele ŵakolosiye chindu mpela singwa ja miiŵa, ŵammwasisye mu ntwe, sooni ŵammichile nnasi kundyo. Ŵatindiŵele mmbujo mwao ni kuntendela chanache achitiji, “Tukunkomasya Mwenye jwa Ŵayahudi!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Ŵansunile mata, ŵaujigele nnasi ula ni kumputa mu ntwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Paŵamasile kuntendela chanache, ŵammusile mwinjilo ula ni kuntakusya nguo syao, nipele ŵampeleche kukwaŵamba pa nsalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akuŵambikwa pa nsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Paŵajaulaga, ŵansimene mundu jumo liina lyakwe che Simoni jwa musi wa ku Kulene, ŵankanganichisye kujigala nsalaba u Che Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Paŵaiche peuto papakuŵilanjikwa Goligota, malumbo gakwe, peuto pa Chikalakasa cha Ntwe, <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />ŵampele divai jewanganye chindu chakuŵaŵa kutyosya kupeteka. Nambo Che Yesu nkupasya pe ŵakanile kung'wa.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Ŵaŵambile pa nsalaba, nipele ŵagaŵene nguo syao kwakutendela gudugudu. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Ŵatemi pepala, ŵaliji nkwalindilila. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Pachanya ntwe wakwe pa nsalaba ŵaŵisile chibao cha maloŵe gagalembekwe, “Aŵa ni Che Yesu, Mwenye jwa Ŵayahudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Paliji ni ŵachiswamba ŵaŵili ŵaŵambikwe pamo nawo, jumo kunchiji ni jwine kundyo.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Ŵandu ŵaŵapitaga pelepo ŵantukene achipukunyaga mitwe jao nikuti, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />“Mmwe jumwatite kuti nkukombola kujigumula Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ni kujitaŵa kwa moŵa gatatu. Sambano nlikulupusye mwasyene. Iŵaga mmwe ndi Mwana jwa Akunnungu, ntuluche pa nsalaba po!” <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Iyoyo peyo achakulu ŵambopesi pamo ni ŵakwiganya malajisyo ni achachekulu ŵantendele chanache achitiji, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Ŵakulupwisye ŵane, nambo asyene ngakukombola kulikulupusya! Iŵaga ŵele ali Mwenye jwa Ŵaisilaeli! Sambano atuluche pa nsalaba po, noweji tutwakulupile. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Ŵaakulupilile Akunnungu ni kuŵecheta kuti ŵele ali Mwana jwa Akunnungu, nipele, iŵaga Akunnungu akunsaka ŵakulupusye sambano.”<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Iyoyo peyo ŵeŵala uŵaŵambikwe pamo nawo pa nsalaba nombe ŵantukene.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Chitandile lyuŵa pantwe mpaka saa tisa, chilambo chose chaliji chipi. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Pajaiche saa tisa Che Yesu ŵalisile kwa liloŵe lyekulungwa, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakitani?” Malumbo gakwe, “Akunnungu ŵangu, Akunnungu ŵangu, kwachichi mulesile?” <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Nambo ŵandu ŵane ŵaŵajimi pele paŵapilikene yele ŵatite, “Akwaŵilanga che Elia.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Jumo jwao ŵautwiche, ŵajigele lidodoki ni kunyoya mu divai jakuipa, ŵajiŵisile mu nnasi, ŵapele ang'we. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Ŵane ŵatite, “Nnindilile tulole iŵaga che Elia chaiche kukwakulupusya.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Nipele, Che Yesu ŵalisile sooni kwa liloŵe lyekulungwa, ŵajasiche.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Pelepo nguo jalusasa ja Nyuumba ja Akunnungu japapwiche pambindikati, kutyochela mwinani mpaka paasi, chilambo chatinganyiche ni lwala syapalwiche. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Malembe gaunukwiche ni iilu ya ŵandu ŵajinji ŵa Akunnungu ŵaŵajasiche ŵasyuchikwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Nombewo ŵakopweche mmalembe, ni Che Yesu paŵamasile kusyuka, ŵajinjile mu mmusi wa Akunnungu, yaani Yelusalemu, ni ŵandu ŵajinji ŵaweni.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Nipele, jwankulu jwa ŵangondo ni ŵangondo ŵane ŵaŵaliji pamo nawo achinlindililaga Che Yesu paŵachiweni chilambo chininkutinganyika ni gagakopochele gala, ŵajogwepe nnope, ŵatite, “Isyene aju mundu ju ŵaliji Mwana jwa Akunnungu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Pelepo paliji ni achakongwe ŵajinji ŵaŵalolechesyaga kwakutali. Ŵanyawo ni ŵeŵala ŵaŵankuiye Che Yesu kutyochela ku Galilaya ni kwatumichila. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Mwa ŵele ŵanyawo ŵaliji che Maliamu jwa musi wa ku Magidala ni che Maliamu achikulugwe che Yakobo ni che Yusufu, pamo ni achikulu ŵa ŵanache ŵa che Sebedayo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masiko gi Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Pakwaswele, ŵaiche mundu jumo jwa chipanje jwa musi wa ku Alimataya liina lyao che Yusufu, nombejo jwaliji jwakulijiganya jwa Che Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Ŵajawile kwa che Pilato, ŵaŵendile apegwe chiilu chi Che Yesu. Che Pilato ŵalamwile kuti apegwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Che Yusufu ŵachijigele chiilu chila, ŵachiŵijilile nguo jeswela mbee jajili jasambano, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />Che Yusufu ŵachiŵisile chiilu chi Che Yesu mu lilembe lyasambano liŵasepile palwala kwa ligongo lyakwe nsyene. Nipele, ŵaligalambulile liganga lyekulungwa pa nnango wa lilembe ni kutyoka. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Che Maliamu jwa musi wa ku Magidala ni che Maliamu ŵane ŵala ŵatemi aninkulolechesya ku lilembe.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilembe likulindililwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Malaŵi jakwe, yaani lyuŵa lyakuliŵika chile kwa ligongo lya Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila, achakulu ŵambopesi ni Mafalisayo ŵajaulile che Pilato, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Ŵatite, “Achimwene, tukukumbuchila kuti jwakulambusya jula akanaŵe kuwa ŵatite, ‘Pakumala moŵa gatatu chisyuche.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Kwayele tukummenda mwasalile ŵangondo ajaule akalilindilile lilembe kwa moŵa gatatu, kuti ŵakulijiganya ŵao anakombole kuchijigala chiilu chao ni kwasalila ŵandu kuti asyuchile. Akuno kulambusya kwa mbesi kuno chikuŵe kwawamba nnope kupunda kwaandanda kula.” <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Che Pilato ŵaasalile, “Ayaga, nkwete ŵangondo, njaule nkalilindilile inkuti pakukombola.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Nipele, ŵajawile, ŵalilindilile lilembe, ŵaŵisile chiugulilo peganga ni kwaleka ŵangondo kulindilila.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Kusyuka ku Che Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maliko 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Palyamasile Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila, kuninkucha lyuŵa lyaandanda lya chijuma, che Maliamu jwa musi wa ku Magidala ni che Maliamu jwine ŵajawile kukulilola lilembe. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Chisisimuchile chakopochele chindendemesi chachikulungwa cha chilambo, katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje ŵatulwiche kutyochela kwinani, ŵaligalambwile liganga lila ni kutamila. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Uwoneche wakwe waliji mpela kumesya ni nguo syakwe syaliji syeswela mbee. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Ŵakulindilila lilembe lila ŵatetemele kwa lipamba nnope, ŵaliji mpela ŵawe.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Nambo katumetume jwa kwinani jula ŵaasalile achakongwe ŵala achitiji, “Ŵanyamwe nkajogopa! Ngumanyilila kuti nkunsosa Che Yesu juŵaŵambikwe pa nsalaba. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Nganapagwa pelepa pakuŵa ŵamale kusyuka mpela iŵasasile. Njise kunnole paŵagonile. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Nipele, njaule chitema nkaasalile ŵakulijiganya ŵao kuti asyuchile, nombewo akunnongolela ku Galilaya, kweleko chimwasimane. Ayaga, une jwammale kunsalila.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Achiŵaga ni lipamba ni kusengwa kwakukulungwa, achakongwe wo ŵatyosile chitema ku lilembe, achiutukaga kukwasalila ŵakulijiganya ŵao.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Chisisimuchile, Che Yesu ŵasimene nawo, ŵatite “Ngunkomasya.” Achakongwe ŵala ŵajawile, ŵagakamwile makongolo gao ni kwapopelela. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵaasalile, “Nkajogopa! Njaule nkaasalile achalongo ŵangu ajaule ku Galilaya, kweleko ni kuchakamone une.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utenga wa ŵakulindilila lilembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Achakongwe ŵala pawajaulaga, ŵakulindilila ŵampepe ŵa lilembe ŵajawile mu mmusi kukwasalila achakulu ŵambopesi yanayose iyatendekwe. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Nipele, ŵasimene pamo ni achachekulu, ŵatemi nkungulu, pakumala kukunguluka ŵapele ŵakulindilila ŵala mbiya syasijinji, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />ni kwasalila, “Ŵanyamwe chinjile yeleyi, ‘Ŵakulijiganya ŵao ŵaiche chilo, ŵachijiŵile chiilu uwe tuli tugonile.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Iŵaga chaimanye yeleyi jwankulu jwa chilambo, uwe chitwanyenje, ni ŵanyamwe ngamma ni masausyo.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Ŵakulindilila ŵala ŵasijigele mbiya sila, ŵatesile mpela iŵatite pakusalilwa. Jele ngani jo jajenele pasikati ja Ŵayahudi mpaka lelo jino.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yesu akwakopochela ŵakulijiganya ŵao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Masengo 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Ŵakulijiganya kumi na moja ŵala ŵajawile ku Galilaya ku chitumbi kwaŵasalilwe ni Che Yesu ajaule. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Paŵamweni, ŵampopelele, nambo ŵampepe mwa ŵanyawo ŵaliji ni lipamba. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Nipele Che Yesu ŵaiche chiŵandi, ŵaasalile, “Mbegwile ukombole wose kwinani ni pachilambo. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Nipele njaule, nkaatende ŵandu ŵa ilambo yose aŵe ŵakulijiganya ŵangu, nchabatisyaga kwa liina lya Atati ni lya Mwana ni lya Mbumu jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Nkaajiganye kugakamulichisya gose mpela ila indite pakunnajisya ŵanyamwe. None ndili pamo ni ŵanyamwe moŵa gose, elo, mpaka kumbesi kwa chilambo.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>